RADAR_LOAD("2026-06",[{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.6c03562","t":"Kinetic and Oxygen-Poisoning Study of Ammonia Synthesis and Decomposition over Supported MXene Mo2C Tx","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.6c03562","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2026-06-30","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":32,"ab":"Abstract The synthesis and decomposition of NH3 have gained renewed attention in the context of using NH3 as a renewable energy carrier. Both reactions require active catalysts based on earth-abundant metals that are also stable against common poisons. Here, we dispersed two-dimensional Mo2CTx MXene nanosheets onto SiO2 to improve the accessibility of their active sites. In doing so, we achieved a ca. 10-fold improvement in Mo utilization for both reactions relative to an unsupported 3D β-Mo2Ν. A comparison with this reference catalyst showed that SiO2 strongly affects the Mo active sites and alters the kinetic parameters of both reactions. For the NH3 decomposition reaction, the support effect is stronger at lower Mo loadings, whereas at higher Mo loadings, a partial restacking occurs, and such Mo2CTx/SiO2 catalysts behave similarly to bulk β-Mo2Ν. Interaction with the SiO2 support incr","au":["Evgenia Kountoupi","Diana Piankova","Tristan Petit","Christoph R. Müller","Alexey Fedorov"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"负载MXene Mo2C Tx上氨合成与分解的动力学及氧中毒研究","zb":"将二维Mo2CTx MXene纳米片分散在SiO2上以提高活性位点可及性。相比未负载催化剂，Mo利用率提高约10倍。研究发现SiO2支持会改变动力学参数，增加Mo2CTx对H2中毒的敏感性，但在8000 ppm水蒸气下稳定性增强。在氨合成中，CO2浓度为210 ppm时会导致活性丧失，CO2中毒部分不可逆。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨","top":1},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzkwMTU5NDY3OQ==&mid=2247710062&idx=6","t":"唯一通讯！上海交通大学「国家高层次人才」叶天南Nature子刊丨富电子双阴离子空位高效化学链合成氨！","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkwMTU5NDY3OQ%3D%3D&mid=2247710062&idx=6","s":"顶刊收割机","d":"2026-06-30","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:59Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"近日，上海交通大学叶天南在Nature Communications发表了题为“Electron-rich dianion vacancies boost diazenide intermediates for efficient chemical looping ammonia synthesis”的研究论文，Jiaqi Wang、Bo Dai、Zichuang Li、Jiang Li为论文第一作者，叶天南为论文通","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨","wx":1},{"id":"10.9767/jcerp.20603","t":"Optimization of Operating Conditions for Enhanced Efficiency in Green Ammonia Production toward Sustainable Fertilizer Applications","u":"https://doi.org/10.9767/jcerp.20603","s":"Journal of Chemical Engineering Research Progress","d":"2026-06-30","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"This study investigates the enhancement of reaction efficiency in green ammonia production through the optimization of operating conditions using Aspen HYSYS simulation. Conventional ammonia synthesis is limited by its high energy demand, driven largely by extreme operating pressures and temperatures as well as the substantial load on compressors. To address these constraints, the process was modified by lowering the operating temperature in the main heating unit (Q‑101) and adjusting compressor pressure and recycle streams, thereby shifting the reaction equilibrium toward product formation while reducing overall energy requirements. Simulation results reveal that decreasing the temperature from 482.5 °C to 368.9 °C significantly increased the molar flow rates of nitrogen, hydrogen, and particularly ammonia, which reached 185.5 kmol/h. This outcome confirms that lower temperatures in an ","au":["Balqis Azzahra","Cornelley Kadja Pala","Nayla Amira Andaristi","Ruqoya Akmalia","Yuliana Sinta Rizka Hapsari"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"面向可持续肥料应用的高效绿色氨生产操作条件优化","zb":"利用Aspen HYSYS模拟优化绿色氨生产的操作条件。通过降低主加热单元温度（从482.5 °C降至368.9 °C）和调整压缩机压力，显著提高了氨的摩尔流量（达185.5 kmol/h），同时降低了整体能耗和压缩热负荷，提升了过程热效率。"},{"id":"10.65599/eng2397","t":"CATALYTIC PROPERTIES OF IRON OXIDE SYSTEMS IN THE HETEROGENEOUS SYNTHESIS OF AMMONIA","u":"https://doi.org/10.65599/eng2397","s":"“Polytechnic Bulletin” series “Engineering Research”","d":"2026-06-30","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"The study investigates the catalytic properties of iron oxide catalysts in the form of wüstite of iron in the heterogeneous synthesis of ammonia. The effects of structure-forming and activating promoters (Al₂O₃, K₂O) and the addition of CoO on the specific surface area, reaction rate constant, and specific catalytic activity of the catalysts were examined. It was found that the optimal contents of Al₂O₃ and K₂O are 15 wt.% and 5 wt.%, respectively, while the addition of approximately 5 wt.% CoO ensures the maximum activity of the iron catalyst. It was determined that the optimal temperature for the Haber–Bosch process with this catalysator is approximately 450 °C.","au":["Zumrat Gaibullaeva","Tojiddin Gadoev"],"o":"回填","why":["SYNTHESIS OF AMMONIA"],"zt":"铁氧化物体系在氨合成中的催化性能研究","zb":"研究铁氧化物催化剂（主要为铁的浮石体）在氨合成中的催化性能。考察了Al₂O₃、K₂O和CoO对催化剂比表面积、反应速率常数及活性的影响。结果表明，Al₂O₃和K₂O的最佳含量分别为15 wt.%和5 wt.%，添加约5 wt.% CoO可确保铁催化剂的最大活性，最佳反应温度约为450 °C。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨；涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1038/s41929-026-01562-3","t":"Unveiling Solid Electrolyte Interphase Dynamics in Electrochemical Lithium-Mediated Ammonia Synthesis via Operando Raman Spectroscopy","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41929-026-01562-3","s":"Nature Catalysis","d":"2026-06-30","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction to ammonia (LiNRR) offers a sustainable pathway for ammonia synthesis under ambient conditions, but the role of the solid electrolyte interphase (SEI) remains unclear. Here, operando Raman spectroscopy yielding realistic ammonia Faradaic efficiencies in THF-based LiClO4 and LiFSI electrolytes revealed how SEI composition and dynamics drive ammonia synthesis. By systematically probing the interaction between N2, ethanol and electroplated Li, we found that ethanol, beyond acting as a proton donor, actively reshapes the SEI via lithium ethoxide formation, thereby enabling N2 activation. Tuning electrolyte composition led to high LiNRR performance of up to 16% Faradaic efficiency, 5 nmol s-1 cm-2 rate and a low overpotential of -0.4 VLi+/Li in 1.0 M LiFSI. High activity correlated with SEIs enriched in lithium alkoxides and LiOH, which enhances the reactiv","au":["Antonia Herzog","Haldrian Iriawan","Louis Ah","Yang Shao-Horn"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"通过原位拉曼光谱揭示锂介导的氨合成中固体电解质界面动力学","zb":"研究对象为锂介导的氮还原反应 (LiNRR)，关键方法为原位拉曼光谱，主要结果为揭示了 THF 基 LiClO4 和 LiFSI 电解液中固体电解质界面 (SEI) 组成和动力学对氨合成的驱动作用，乙醇通过形成锂乙氧化物重塑 SEI，实现 N2 活化，高活性电解质 SEI 富含锂烷氧化物和 LiOH，增强 Li 表面对 N2 和 H+ 的反应性。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pp":"ChemRxiv","top":1,"rb":["CAT催化"]},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzkyODk2MDQ4Mw==&mid=2247496210&idx=1","t":"原位拉曼揭示合成氨机理，麻省理工学院邵阳最新Nature Catalysis！","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkyODk2MDQ4Mw%3D%3D&mid=2247496210&idx=1","s":"CAT催化","d":"2026-06-30","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"锂介导氮还原反应（LiNRR）被认为是目前较可靠的电化学 合成氨 路线之一。该过程通常包括 Li 电沉积形成金属 Li、Li 与 N 反应生成氮化锂中间体，以及质子供体进一步质子化生成 NH。 第一作者：Antonia Herzog 通讯作者：邵阳、Antonia Herzog 通讯单位：麻省理工学院 论文DOI：10.1038/s41929-026-01562-3（点击文末「阅读原文」，直达链接） 2026年6月30日，麻省理工学院邵阳、Antonia Herzog在Nature Catalysis期刊发表题为Unveiling solid electrolyte interphase dynamics in electrochemical lithium-mediated ammonia synthesis via operando Raman spectroscopy的研究论文，Antonia Herzog为论文第一作者，邵阳、Antonia Herzog为论文共同通讯作者。 一、研究背景 锂介导氮还原反应（LiNRR）被认为是目前较可靠的电化学合成氨路线之一。该过程通常包括 Li⁺ 电沉积形成金属 Li、Li 与 N₂ 反应生成氮化锂中间体，以及质子供体进一步质子化生成 NH₃。 问题在于，真正决定反应效率的并不只是电解液、锂盐或质子供体本身，而是反应过程中形成的固态电解质界面层（SEI）。SEI 一方面保护金属锂，另一方面又会调控 N₂、H⁺ 和 Li⁺ 的传输。如果 SEI 太致密，N₂ 难以接触金属 Li；如果 SEI 组成不合适，则容易走向析氢或无效锂沉积。 过去大量研究依赖 XPS、XRD、冷冻电镜等后表征手段，难以直接捕捉 SEI 在反应过程中的动态演变。因此，作者搭建了原位拉曼平台，在接近真实 LiNRR 条件下观察 SEI 的形成、转化和空间分布。 二、核心发现 作者发现，乙醇并不只是简单的质子供体。它会主动参与 SEI 重构，促进 lithium ethoxide（LiOEt，乙氧基锂）和 LiOH 等组分形成，从而构建更加多孔、可渗透的 SE","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","wx":1,"mt":["10.1038/s41929-026-01562-3"]},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.76745","t":"General Synthesis of Amorphous Pd‐Based Nanoparticles Towards Highly Efficient Nitrate‐to‐Ammonia Electrocatalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.76745","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-06-30","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) towards ammonia (NH 3 ) production is a critical process that sustainably converts hazardous nitrate to value‐added chemicals. Amorphous metal‐based nanomaterials are promising NO 3 RR catalysts owing to the abundant surface active sites, but their performance is still unsatisfactory for practical needs. We develop a robust one‐pot strategy to prepare a family of amorphous PdMP ( a ‐PdMP, M = Cu, Ni, Co, Fe, Mn, and Zn) nanoparticles with high yield, high structural stability, uniform morphology, and tunable composition. Impressively, the as‐prepared a ‐PdCoP nanoparticles show excellent electrocatalytic activity (onset potential measured at +0.3 V vs. reversed hydrogen electrode), high NH 3 selectivity, and outstanding long‐term stability (Faradaic efficiency (FE) maintained > ∼98% at 200 mA cm −2 for 200 h) in NO 3 RR. Theo","au":["Lei Xu","Chuhao Luan","Mingzi Sun","Weiwei Chen","Xiaozhi Liu","Chen Ma"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"面向高效硝酸盐至氨电催化的非晶态 Pd 基纳米粒子通用合成","zb":"研究对象为非晶态 PdMP (M = Cu, Ni, Co, Fe, Mn, Zn) 纳米粒子，关键方法为一步法合成策略，主要结果为 a-PdCoP 纳米粒子在硝酸盐还原反应中表现出优异活性（+0.3 V vs RHE）、高选择性 (>98% at 200 mA cm−2 for 200 h）和理论计算揭示的电子交换/转移增强和金属价态稳定机制。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1116/6.0005458","t":"Modifying the zeta potential of silica particles via atomic layer deposition of nanoscale oxide coatings","u":"https://doi.org/10.1116/6.0005458","s":"Journal of Vacuum Science & Technology A","d":"2026-06-29","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Atomic layer deposition (ALD) shows promise for purposefully modifying the surface chemistry of powders because it has excellent control over the thickness of the applied coatings. ALD can precisely deposit coatings with a resolution approaching 0.1 nm, providing intricate control over surface properties. However, few studies have investigated the potential to systematically vary the surface potential of powders using this precision in ALD’s deposition process. In this work, titanium oxide thin films are deposited onto silicon oxide nanoparticles via ALD to create silica–titania core-shell nanoparticles. The change in the isoelectric points of the particles is investigated as a function of the thickness of the ALD deposited TiO2 layer. For films deposited at 1 nm thickness and below, the isoelectric point changes approximately linearly with coating thickness. For films thicker than 1 nm,","au":["Typher Yom","Joseph J. Kuchta","Mengkun Tian","Aaron K. Vannucci","Mark D. Losego"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"通过原子层沉积纳米级氧化物涂层来调节二氧化硅颗粒的 zeta 电位","zb":"通过原子层沉积（ALD）在二氧化硅纳米颗粒上沉积二氧化钛薄膜以创建二氧化硅-二氧化钛核壳纳米颗粒。研究了颗粒等电点随 ALD 沉积 TiO2 层厚度的变化。对于 1 纳米厚度及以下的薄膜，等电点随涂层厚度近似线性变化。对于 1 纳米以上的薄膜，等电点不再变化，表明表面电位不再受下方的二氧化硅核影响。使用电子显微镜、X 射线光电子能谱和能量色散 X 射线（EDX）分析研究了涂层的致密性。此外，基于简单的几何和化学计量学假设，引入了一个从 EDX 测量中估计层厚度的模型。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.6c01159","t":"Subnanometer Ru Sites on CeO 2 Oxygen Vacancy Clusters: A Highly Efficient and Durable Catalyst for Ammonia Decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01159","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2026-06-29","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Decomposing ammonia to produce hydrogen is a promising approach to address challenges in hydrogen storage and transport. While Ru-based catalysts have demonstrated high activity, their long-term stability under industrial conditions remains a critical hurdle. Here, we develop a reductive synthesis strategy to fabricate rod-shaped ceria (CeO2-RodRed) featuring high-density oxygen vacancy clusters, where Ru clusters are effectively anchored via robust Ru-O-Ce3+ linkages formed at 450 °C under N2 atmosphere. The resulting Ru/CeO2-RodRed-450N2 catalyst achieves an impressive 99.0% NH3 conversion at 450 °C, approaching the thermodynamic equilibrium (99.6%), and shows exceptional stability over 1000 h of operation. Integrated experimental characterization and density functional theory calculations reveal that the abundant Ce3+ species and oxygen vacancy clusters create an electron-rich surface","au":["Jiyang Xie","Lei Zeng","Wentao Yuan","Xiaolong Li","Chen Zou","Tian Tan"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"CeO2 氧空位簇上的亚纳米 Ru 位点：一种高效且耐用的氨分解催化剂","zb":"研究对象为 Ru/CeO2-RodRed-450N2 催化剂，关键方法为还原合成策略制备 CeO2-RodRed 并负载 Ru，主要结果为在 450 °C 下实现 99.0% NH3 转化率，接近热力学平衡，并展示 1000 h 的稳定性。实验和理论计算揭示 Ce3+ 物种和氧空位簇形成富电子表面，促进 H 从 Ru 溢流至 CeO2 形成动态 Ce-OH 基团，加速 H2 释放并抑制 Ru 位点中毒，通过溢流持续去除吸附 H 原子，促进 N-N 耦合并降低 N2 解吸能垒。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系","top":1},{"id":"wx:__biz=Mzg5NDYxNjYzNQ==&mid=2247529104&idx=2","t":"Nat. Commun.:富电子C2空位促进(N=N)δ-中间体催化合成氨","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5NDYxNjYzNQ%3D%3D&mid=2247529104&idx=2","s":"科学百晓生","d":"2026-06-28","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:59Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"基于此，叶天南团队提出了双活性位点策略，并开发了Ni/LaN氨合成催化剂。该策略利用LaN载体上的氮空位活化N2，从而克服了Ni自身氮结合能较弱的限制。","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["合成氨"],"wx":1},{"id":"10.1002/smll.74213","t":"Electrochemical Nitrogen Reduction for Green Ammonia: Mechanistic Insights and Advanced Materials Design","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.74213","s":"Small","d":"2026-06-28","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT Electrochemical nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) provides a promising pathway for sustainable ammonia synthesis under ambient conditions and direct integration with renewable electricity. However, practical implementation remains limited by sluggish N 2 activation, severe competition from the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER), low ammonia partial current densities, and insufficient long‐term stability. Existing studies frequently address these challenges separately, focusing on catalyst classes or mechanistic pathways, leaving a gap between atomic‐scale materials design and system‐level requirements for scalable operation. In this Review, we present an integrative perspective on electrocatalytic NRR that links reaction kinetics, descriptor‐guided materials design, and reactor‐level considerations. Emerging catalyst architectures, including single‐atom, dual‐atom, vacancy‐engine","au":["Aslam Hossain","Jun Ho Shim"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"电化学氮还原用于绿色氨合成：机理洞察与先进材料设计","zb":"电化学氮还原反应（NRR）为在环境条件下可持续合成氨及与可再生能源直接集成提供了有前景的途径。然而，实际应用仍受限于缓慢的N2活化、严重的析氢反应（HER）竞争、低氨分电流密度和长期稳定性不足。现有研究通常分别解决这些挑战，关注催化剂类别或机理途径，留下原子级材料设计与可扩展操作的系统级要求之间的差距。本文综合分析了电催化NRR，将反应动力学、描述符指导的材料设计与反应器级考虑联系起来。评估了单原子、双原子、空位工程和金属自由体系等新兴催化剂架构，强调了协同活性位点、电子结构调制和缺陷化学如何调控N2吸附、关键中间体（特别是NNH）的稳定性和HER抑制。讨论了机理描述符、比例关系和设计原则，以及实验性能趋势，以阐明控制选择性的热力学和动力学极限。除了催化剂发现，还考察了电解质和界面工程、气-液-固传输、压力和流管理、耐久性和氨处理。通过连接催化剂设计、机理描述符、反应器约束和技术经济目标，","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.7008909","t":"Modeling and simulation of a membrane reactor for ammonia synthesis. Analysis of the permeate transport mechanisms","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.7008909","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-06-27","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"A ammonia reactor with MFI-type zeolitic ammonia-selective membrane is simulated. The reactor configuration consists of two concentric tubes, where the catalyst is located in retentate side, and the permeate side, separated from the former by a membrane, allows the selective removal of ammonia. The proposed design avoids the use of sweep gas to prevent diluting the ammonia withdrawn from the retentate side. For this purpose, a blind flange is considered at z=0 for the permeate side. The novelty consists in considering convective and diffusive mechanisms simultaneously at the permeate side, which to the best of our knowledge has still not been dealt with in the context of membrane reactors. The diffusive flux is modelled by the Stefan-Maxwell diffusion mechanism, while the convective flux is described using Hagen–Poiseuille’s law. The membrane is modeled considering permeances obtained fr","au":["Juan Francisco Díaz Mendivil","Maria Adrover","Pablo Daniel Giunta"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"膜反应器合成氨的建模与模拟：渗透侧传质机制分析","zb":"利用MFI型沸石氨选择性膜构建双管同心反应器模型，模拟了渗透侧同时存在的对流与扩散传质机制。结果表明，当原料侧总压足够大时，系统性能与渗透侧出口组成差异较小，膜反应器转化率超过哈伯-博施工艺，渗透侧回收氨的纯度约为80%，且扩散机制不可忽略。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨","pre":1},{"id":"10.3724/2097-213x.2026.jfct.0140","t":"Effect of support size on CO oxidation performance of Pt/Fe<sub>2<\/sub>O<sub>3<\/sub> catalysts constructed by atomic layer deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.3724/2097-213x.2026.jfct.0140","s":"Journal of Fuel Chemistry and Technology","d":"2026-06-27","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"CO催化氧化在环境净化与能源转化中具有重要意义，然而开发兼具高活性和稳定性的低温CO氧化催化剂仍面临挑战。本研究采用水热法制备了20、50及80 nm三种尺寸的菱面体Fe2O3载体，并利用原子层沉积技术在其表面精准负载Pt，制得Pt/Fe2O3催化剂。通过XRD、XPS和EPR等表征，系统考察了载体尺寸及Pt负载量对催化剂结构、表面性质及CO氧化性能的影响。结果表明，小尺寸Fe2O3表面具有更丰富的氧空位，有利于Pt的分散与电子调控。在优化Pt的沉积次数后，20 nm Fe2O3仅需10次Pt循环即可实现100 °C条件下CO完全转化，其活性显著优于大尺寸载体。我们揭示了Pt与Fe2O3载体间的强相互作用及表面氧物种可提高CO氧化性能，证实该催化体系遵循Mars-van Krevelen反应机理。本研究阐明了载体的尺寸效应对CO氧化性能的影响，为设计高效CO氧化催化剂提供了新思路。","au":["Linlin XIAN","Yukun PAN","Jiawen YANG","Conghui WANG","Bin ZHANG","Shichao ZHAO"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"支撑体尺寸对原子层沉积构建的 Pt/Fe2O3 催化剂 CO 氧化性能的影响","zb":"采用水热法制备 20、50 及 80 nm 三种尺寸的 Fe2O3 载体，并利用原子层沉积负载 Pt。结果表明小尺寸 Fe2O3 表面氧空位更丰富，利于 Pt 分散与电子调控。在 20 nm 载体上仅需 10 次 Pt 循环即可在 100 °C 实现完全转化，证实了强金属-载体相互作用及 Mars-van Krevelen 反应机理。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"wx:__biz=Mzk2NDYxNDQxNQ==&mid=2247507005&idx=2","t":"上海交通大学叶天南JACS：低温高效：Mo催化剂实现氮气直接合成胺","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk2NDYxNDQxNQ%3D%3D&mid=2247507005&idx=2","s":"青研经纬","d":"2026-06-27","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:59Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"3. 图1c评估了典型氨合成金属（W、Mo、Fe、Ru）在高温氮化后生成和储存N-H物种的能力，Mo释放的'N'物种最多，表明其在低温下生成和稳定储存丰富N-H物种的优越能力","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["氨合成"],"wx":1},{"id":"10.3724/2097-213x.2026.jfct.0016","t":"Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia over Cu-Ag bimetallic catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.3724/2097-213x.2026.jfct.0016","s":"Journal of Fuel Chemistry and Technology","d":"2026-06-27","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"电催化硝酸盐还原反应（${{\\mathrm{eNO_3^-RR}} }$）为实现废水资源化利用和绿色合成氨提供了一条可行途径。铜基催化剂优异的硝酸根离子活化能力，被广泛应用于${{\\mathrm{eNO_3^-RR}} } $，然而，其在电催化硝酸盐还原合成氨过程中的选择性仍有待提升。本研究通过“共沉淀-高温煅烧-电化学还原”三步法制备了Cu-Ag双金属催化剂，评估了其${{\\mathrm{eNO_3^-RR}} } $性能。催化活性评价结果表明，该催化剂在−0.6 V（vs. RHE）电位下实现了高达97.6%的合成氨法拉第效率。−0.9 V（vs. RHE）电位下，氨产率达到了64.52 mg/(h·cm2)，是未改性的纯Cu催化剂的2.41倍。机理研究表明，Ag位点的引入促进了水的解离生成活性氢，并导致了Cu位点形成了富电子环境，从而显著提升了Cu位点上硝酸根离子加氢反应动力学。本研究为开发高${{\\mathrm{eNO_3^-RR}} } $活性的Cu基双金属催化剂提供了理论依据。","au":["Yu BAI","Weiling CHANG","Hongsong LEI","Na XU","Hongna ZHANG","Chao WAN"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"Cu-Ag双金属催化剂上的电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"电催化硝酸盐还原反应（${{\\mathrm{eNO_3^-RR}} }$）为实现废水资源化利用和绿色合成氨提供了一条可行途径。铜基催化剂优异的硝酸根离子活化能力，被广泛应用于${{\\mathrm{eNO_3^-RR}} } $，然而，其在电催化硝酸盐还原合成氨过程中的选择性仍有待提升。本研究通过“共沉淀-高温煅烧-电化学还原”三步法制备了Cu-Ag双金属催化剂，评估了其${{\\mathrm{eNO_3^-RR}} } $性能。催化活性评价结果表明，该催化剂在−0.6 V（vs. RHE）电位下实现了高达97.6%的合成氨法拉第效率。−0.9 V（vs. RHE）电位下，氨产率达到了64.52 mg/(h·cm2)，是未改性的纯Cu催化剂的2.41倍。机理研究表明，Ag位点的引入促进了水的解离生成活性氢，并导致了Cu位点形成了富电子环境，从而显著提升了Cu位点上硝酸根离子加氢反应动力学。本研","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.inorgchem.6c01852","t":"Gold- and Silver-Nanoparticle-Embodied Amino Acid-Based Hybrid Sustainable Hydrogel Biomatrices for the Electrocatalytic Reduction of Nitrate to Value-Added Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.inorgchem.6c01852","s":"Inorganic Chemistry","d":"2026-06-27","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"In this study, in situ gold and silver nanoparticle syntheses have been investigated within Fmoc-Y-OH and Fmoc-W-OH-based supramolecular hydrogel matrices to form four different hybrid hydrogel systems, which include Fmoc-Y-AuNPs, Fmoc-Y-AgNPs, Fmoc-W-AuNPs, and Fmoc-W-AgNPs for electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (eNO3RR). The catalytic performance of the resulting hybrid xerogels has been evaluated as a function of catalyst's loading and electrolyte's pH. Among all these four hybrid xerogels, Fmoc-Y-AuNPs exhibited the best activity, achieving 88.8% Faradaic efficiency (FE) at -0.1 V vs RHE (pH 5). Post-catalytic FE-SEM and HR-TEM analyses confirmed the coexistence of both nanofibrillar and nanoparticle morphologies, bestowing excellent post-catalytic stabilities of the xerogel eNO3RR catalysts. Additionally, Fmoc-W-based AuNP and AgNP hydrogels induced apoptosis in PANC-1 cell","au":["Swaraj Ganesh Gaonkar","Dikshita Garg","S. Daisy Precilla","Agieshkumar Balakrishna Pillai","Sudipta Bhowmik","Biswarup Chakraborty"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.iecr.6c01380","t":"Resolving Multiscale Diffusion in a Nanoparticle Fluidized Bed Atomic Layer Deposition Reactor by an Extended Two-Fluid–Population Balance Model","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.iecr.6c01380","s":"Industrial & Engineering Chemistry Research","d":"2026-06-26","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Fluidized bed atomic layer deposition (FB-ALD) has emerged as a scalable technique for surface coating on nanoparticles with subnanometer precision. Nevertheless, nanoparticles, due to strong cohesive forces, tend to form polydisperse agglomerates during fluidization, complicating mass transfer and reaction processes. In this study, a two-stage diffusion-reaction model for nanoparticle agglomerates is developed and coupled with a two-fluid model–population balance model (TFM-PBM), which effectively simulates fluidized bed reactors while considering fragmentation and reassembly of agglomerates during fluidization. The effects of particle cohesion and fluidizing gas velocity on ALD of nanoparticles in a fluidized bed reactor are investigated. The diffusion-reaction model can capture diffusion resistances at two scales: primary and complex agglomerates of nanoparticles and describe how the ","au":["Zuyang Zhang","Daoyin Liu","J. Ruud van Ommen"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"通过扩展双流体-种群平衡模型解析纳米颗粒流化床原子层沉积反应器中的多尺度扩散","zb":"开发耦合双流体模型-群体平衡模型 (TFM-PBM) 的两阶段扩散-反应模型，模拟纳米颗粒流化床 ALD 过程。模型考虑了团聚体的破碎与重组，发现扩散阻力随团聚体尺寸增加而增大。平均团聚体尺寸和前驱体停留时间是影响转化率的主要因素，小尺寸团聚体和适宜的流化气速能获得最佳前驱体利用率。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1126/sciadv.aee9634","t":"A subnanoscale dynamic-integrated catalytic system for bioinspired photoelectrochemical ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1126/sciadv.aee9634","s":"Science Advances","d":"2026-06-26","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Photoelectrochemical nitrogen (N) fixation to ammonia (NH 3 ) is a sustainable route for hydrogen storage yet limited by the stubborn N≡N bond and competitive interfacial reaction kinetics. Inspired by nitrogenase, we design single-atom iron (Fe)–doped tungsten oxide (WO 3 ) subnanowires as a bioinspired, dynamically integrated catalytic platform to systematically overcome these challenges: (i) The distorted lattice and asymmetric sites create a dynamically responsive catalytic center, where photoinduced valence-lattice oscillation drives electron delocalization, shifting the conventional N 2 adsorption mode and reaction pathway; (ii) the unique self-adhesive and film-forming properties enable robust, binder-free electrodes with maximized active-site exposure; and (iii) surface ligand engineering establishes a bioinspired microenvironment that selectively enriches N 2 and regulates proto","au":["Yan Lin","Biao Yu","Hao Ren","Zhongtao Li","Qingda Liu","Xun Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"用于生物启发光电化学氨合成的亚纳米级动态集成催化系统","zb":"光电化学氮（N）固定为氨（NH 3 ）是一种可持续的储氢途径，但受限于顽固的N≡N键和竞争的界面反应动力学。受氮酶启发，我们设计单原子铁（Fe）-掺杂氧化钨（WO 3 ）亚纳米线作为生物启发的动态集成催化平台，以系统性地克服这些挑战：（i）扭曲的晶格和非对称位点创建了一个动态响应的催化中心，其中光诱导的价-晶格振荡驱动电子离域，使传统的N 2 吸附模式和反应途径发生转变；（ii）独特的自粘附和成膜性能使具有最大活性位点暴露的坚固、无粘结剂的电极得以实现；（iii）表面配体工程建立了生物启发的微环境，选择性地富集N 2 并调节质子进入。该系统实现了每毫克催化剂每小时286微克的氨产率，比传统的Fe-WO 3 纳米线提高了24倍，并在30个循环中表现出稳定性能。这项工作展示了亚纳米尺度功能集成、生物启发的催化，为高效的分子转化提供了范例。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.7004986","t":"DBD Plasma-Coupled Fe1-XO Thermal Catalytic Ammonia Cracking to Hydrogen: Reaction Mechanism Elucidation and Thermodynamic Performance Assessment","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.7004986","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-06-26","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Driven by the EU Renewable Energy Directive (RED III) and renewable hydrogen/RFNBO targets, ammonia (NH3) cracking is becoming an important route for producing carbon neutral hydrogen (H2). Here, a dielectric barrier discharge (DBD) plasma was coupled with a Fe1-xO thermocatalyst to enhance NH3 cracking and clarify the reaction mechanism. Plasma coupled catalytic reaction (PR-CR) and catalytic reaction (CR) systems were compared over varied volume space velocities (VSV), temperatures, and voltages. 1) At 550 °C, 1060 h⁻¹ and 12 kV, the PR-CR system achieved 94.39% NH3 conversion, exceeding that of the CR system (83.33%). Catalytic pre-cracking first reduced the breakdown voltage in the DBD zone from 11 to 6 kV; after stable discharge was established, electron-impact activation, H-radical abstraction, and excited-N2-assisted pathways were generated to crack residual NH3. 2) The energy and","au":["Kai Deng","Junhao Zhu","Jingyu Hou","Qinglu Lin","Junjie Zhu","Shiheng Ye"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Cracking"],"zt":"DBD等离子体耦合Fe1-XO热催化氨裂解为氢：反应机理阐明和热力学性能评估","zb":"受欧盟可再生能源指令（RED III）和可再生氢/RFNBO目标的驱动，氨（NH3）裂解正成为生产碳中和氢（H2）的重要途径。在此，一个介电屏障放电（DBD）等离子体与Fe1-xO热催化剂耦合，以增强NH3裂解并阐明反应机理。比较了等离子体耦合催化反应（PR-CR）和催化反应（CR）系统在变化的体积空间速度（VSV）、温度和电压下的性能。1) 在550 °C, 1060 h⁻¹ 和 12 kV下，PR-CR系统实现了94.39%的NH3转化率，超过CR系统（83.33%）。催化预裂解首先将DBD区的击穿电压从11降至6 kV；在稳定放电建立后，电子轰击活化、H自由基抽象和激发-N2辅助途径产生，以裂解残留NH3。2) PR-CR系统的能量和火用效率分别达到43.2%和6.11%，高于CR系统（40.46%和3.94%），因为等离子体增强裂解增加了单位加热输入的H2产量，并减少了分配给目标产","ob":"氨分解制氢","pre":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.7001008","t":"Cu-Enriched SnS/rGO Heterointerfaces for Efficient Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.7001008","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-06-26","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Currently, the development of earth-abundant electrocatalysts with both high Faradaic efficiency and ammonia yield remains a significant challenge. Herein, we report a Cu-enriched SnS/rGO heterostructure (Cu/SnS-rGO) fabricated via a facile one-pot hydrothermal method followed by anhydrous copper chloride impregnation, in which a spontaneous galvanic replacement mechanism (Sn²⁺ → Sn⁴⁺ + 2e⁻; Cu²⁺ + 2e⁻ → Cu⁰) drives the preferential deposition of metallic Cu species onto the surfaces and edges of SnS nanobelts rather than into the bulk lattice. The optimized Cu/SnS-rGO composite delivers an exceptional NO₃RR performance with a Faradaic efficiency of 93.87% at −0.8 V (vs. RHE) and an ammonia yield rate of 5900.8 μg h⁻¹ mgcat⁻¹ at −0.9 V (vs. RHE), significantly surpassing pristine SnS (FE: 33.2%, yield: 760 μg h⁻¹ mgcat⁻¹) and most reported non-noble-metal catalysts.","au":["Faming Gao","Xiuhui Bai","Shuangyan Li","Zhimu Zheng","Weijia Cao","Miao Wu"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"Cu富集的SnS/rGO异界面用于高效电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"目前，开发具有高法拉第效率和氨产率的地球丰产电催化剂仍然是一个重大挑战。在此，我们报告通过简便的一锅水热法后继无水氯化铜浸渍制备的Cu富集的SnS/rGO异质结构（Cu/SnS-rGO），其中自发的伽伐尼取代机制（Sn²⁺ → Sn⁴⁺ + 2e⁻; Cu²⁺ + 2e⁻ → Cu⁰）驱动金属Cu物种优先沉积在SnS纳米带表面和边缘，而不是进入体晶格。优化的Cu/SnS-rGO复合材料提供了卓越的NO₃RR性能，在−0.8 V（vs. RHE）下法拉第效率为93.87%，在−0.9 V（vs. RHE）下氨产率率为5900.8 μg h⁻¹ mgcat⁻¹，显著超过原始SnS（FE: 33.2%，产率: 760 μg h⁻¹ mgcat⁻¹）和大多数报道的非贵金属催化剂。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzkyNDQyNjc3OA==&mid=2247518818&idx=1","t":"C₂空位介导高效化学链制氨！上海交通大学叶天南，最新Nature子刊！","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkyNDQyNjc3OA%3D%3D&mid=2247518818&idx=1","s":"催化进展","d":"2026-06-25","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:59Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"化学链合成氨（CLAS）可将 N、H分步通入反应器，规避混合气平衡转化率限制，但现有载体循环稳定性差、低温活性不足，缺少兼具高电子供给能力、可逆缺陷的载体材料。","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["合成氨"],"ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨","wx":1},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzIyMzcyNDM0MA==&mid=2247651700&idx=3","t":"上海交通大学叶天南最新Nature子刊丨富电子双阴离子空位高效化学链合成氨！","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIyMzcyNDM0MA%3D%3D&mid=2247651700&idx=3","s":"催化开天地","d":"2026-06-25","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"这些物种对于通过缔合路径促进合成氨至关重要。借助化学循环合成氨过程，LaC成为N活化的优选候选材料，Ni/LaC催化剂表现出优异性能，在400 °C、0.1 MPa下达到6.9 mmol·g·h，超过此前报道的化学循环合成氨金属催化剂，甚至在相","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["合成氨"],"ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨","wx":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.6998341","t":"Optimizing *H Supply via Interfacial Water Activation on Co3O4/CuxO Heterojunctions with Cu-Co Bridge for High-Performance Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6998341","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-06-25","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO3RR) offers a sustainable approach for ammonia synthesis at room temperature, but its efficiency is limited by the lack of catalysts with optimized activity and selectivity. In this work, Co3O4/CuxO heterojunctions were constructed on three-dimensional (3D) porous copper foams (CF) via chemical oxidation, hydrothermal reaction and calcination. This optimized catalyst integrates a stratified nanoflower morphology, abundant oxygen vacancies, and modulated electronic structures induced by strong Co–Cu interface interactions. The electrochemical evaluations of the system indicate that Co3O4/CuxO achieves an excellent ammonia Faradaic efficiency (FE) of over 98% and a high yield of 25.89 mg h−1 cm−2 at −1.0 V (vs. relative hydrogen electrode (RHE)), while demonstrating remarkable stability over 25 h. In situ spectral analysis reveals that the add","au":["Ling Ma","Huasheng Pan","Youfeng Wang","Honggui Wang","Ya Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"通过 Co3O4/CuxO 异质结界面水活化优化 *H 供应，用于高性能硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"在三维多孔铜泡沫（CF）上通过化学氧化、水热反应和煅烧构建了 Co3O4/CuxO 异质结。优化的催化剂集成了分层纳米花形态、丰富的氧空位以及强 Co-Cu 界面相互作用诱导的调节电子结构。电化学评估表明，Co3O4/CuxO 在 -1.0 V (vs. 相对氢电极 (RHE)) 下实现了 98% 以上的氨法拉第效率 (FE) 和 25.89 mg h−1 cm−2 的高产率，同时表现出 25 小时的优异稳定性。原位光谱分析揭示，Co 的添加促进了硝酸盐吸附，加速了关键 *NO2 和 *NHx 中间体的转化，并通过增强水裂解动力学增加了自由界面水的比例，从而为氨形成提供了更多的质子供体。该研究阐明了异质结工程和界面水调节的协同效应，并为设计高性能 NO3RR 电催化剂提供了一种可行策略。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"10.1021/cbe.6c00044","t":"Energy-Efficient Cascade Synthesis of Ammonia from Air via Spark Plasma-Mediated Nitrite Generation and CuRu Nanoalloy Electrocatalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/cbe.6c00044","s":"Chem & Bio Engineering","d":"2026-06-25","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Plasma–electrocatalytic cascade ammonia synthesis offers a promising route for decentralized nitrogen fixation, yet remains hindered by excessive NO3– formation and poor energy matching between the two stages. Here, we propose a strategy that breaks this bottleneck by selectively generating NO2– via spark-discharge plasma and efficiently reducing it over a CuRu0.5 nanoalloy. Systematic optimization of the plasma discharge and electrocatalytic interface enables synergistic energy matching, delivering a record-low specific energy consumption of 273.41 kWh/kg NH3. Mechanistic studies reveal that Ru modulates the electronic structure of Cu, enhancing NO2– adsorption and deoxygenation while suppressing the hydrogen evolution reaction. This work establishes a generalized paradigm for low-energy, high-selectivity ammonia synthesis from air and water.","au":["Jian Sun","Bo Wu","Heyang Zhu","Shuyue Wang","Shaodong Zhou","Zhongjian Li"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"通过火花等离子体介导的亚硝酸生成和 CuRu 纳米合金电催化作用实现高效的氨合成","zb":"提出了一种通过火花放电等离子体选择性地生成亚硝酸根，并在 CuRu0.5 纳米合金上有效还原的策略，以突破等离子体-电催化级联氨合成中过量的 NO3– 形成和两个阶段之间能量不匹配的瓶颈。系统优化等离子体放电和电催化界面实现了协同能量匹配，实现了 273.41 kWh/kg NH3 的创纪录低比能消耗。机理研究表明，Ru 调节了 Cu 的电子结构，增强了亚硝酸根吸附和去氧，同时抑制了析氢反应。这项工作为从空气和水出发的低能耗、高选择性氨合成建立了一个通用范式。","ob":"等离子体制氨；涉及Ru/钌体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsphyschemau.6c00051","t":"Descriptor-Based Insights into Hydrazine Selectivity in Electrochemical Ammonia Oxidation on Single-Atom Centers of MXenes","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsphyschemau.6c00051","s":"ACS Physical Chemistry Au","d":"2026-06-25","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Selective electrochemical synthesis of hydrazine (N2H4) from ammonia oxidation offers a promising route toward value-added nitrogen chemicals but remains challenging due to competing oxidation pathways. Here, density functional theory calculations are employed to investigate hydrazine formation at electrochemically formed single-atom centers on 14 carbide- and nitride-based MXenes (MXene-SACs). Hydrazine selectivity is assessed using three descriptors, namely the thermodynamic free-energy span Gmax(U), the kinetic descriptor G‡(U) associated with the N–N coupling activation barrier, and the hydrazine desorption energy (ΔGdes) governing product release from the catalytic surface. Evaluation of Gmax(U) identifies Nb2C-, V2C-, Cr2C-, and V2N-SAC motifs as promising materials for efficient hydrazine formation. However, transition state calculations for N–N coupling barriers modify t","au":["Totan Mondal","Kai S. Exner"],"o":"回填","zt":"基于描述符的洞察：MXenes 单原子中心电化学氨氧化中肼选择性的研究","zb":"研究对象为电化学形成的 14 种碳化物和氮化物基 MXenes（MXene-SACs）上的肼形成。采用密度泛函理论计算，评估了三种描述符：热力学自由能跨度 Gmax(U)、与 N-N 耦合活化能垒相关的动力学描述符 G‡(U) 以及控制产物从催化表面释放的肼脱附能 ΔGdes。评估 Gmax(U) 确定 Nb2C-, V2C-, Cr2C-, 和 V2N-SAC 基元是高效肼形成的潜在材料。然而，N-N 耦合能垒的过渡态计算修改了热力学活性趋势，如 G‡(U) 所反映，并表明选择性通常偏向 N2 形成。综合描述符评估表明，基于碳化物的 MXene-SAC 基元，特别是 V2C 和 Cr2C，由于它们平衡的中间体稳定性和有利的脱附能，仍然是肼竞争性最有希望的候选者，而 V2N-SAC 在描述符空间中最接近理想的肼选择性区域。总体而言，基于描述符的筛选策略为分析氨电氧化和相关催化体系中肼形成的","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzkwNzIxMDczMQ==&mid=2247491601&idx=1","t":"叶天南团队Nature Communications：富电子C2空位促进(N=N)δ-中间体用于化学链循环氨合成","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkwNzIxMDczMQ%3D%3D&mid=2247491601&idx=1","s":"上海交大变革性分子前沿科学中心","d":"2026-06-24","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:59Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"针对上述挑战，近日上海交通大学变革性分子前沿科学中心叶天南团队在稀土金属碳化物LaC2中构建了大尺寸、富电子的阴离子缺陷位点，并证明 LaC2在负载 Ni 后是一种优异的化学链循环氨合成（CLAS）催化剂。 近日，上海交通大学变革性分子前沿科学中心叶天南团队在稀土金属碳化物LaC2中构建了大尺寸、富电子的阴离子缺陷位点，并证明 LaC2在负载 Ni 后是一种优异的化学链循环氨合成（CLAS）催化剂。相关研究成果以“Electron-rich dianion vacancies boost diazenide intermediates for efficient chemical looping ammonia synthesis”为题发表于期刊Nature Communications。该工作的第一作者为上海交通大学博士生王佳琪、戴博、李自闯，日本东京科学大学李江博士，唯一通讯作者为上海交通大学变革性分子前沿科学中心叶天南副教授。上述研究工作得到了国家自然科学基金、科技部重点研发项目、上海市科技重大专项和上海市教委等资助。 氨不仅是工农业生产的重要原料，也在能源存储与转化中扮演着关键角色，因此，在温和条件下实现高效氨合成对降低能耗至关重要。然而，氨合成反应受到N≡N三键极高键能的动力学阻碍，使其在温和条件下难以快速进行。为促进N2解离，常采用电子注入策略，即向N2的π反键轨道注入电子以降低其键级，为此，科研人员开发了富电子活性位点来构建高效氨合成催化剂。但由于氨的生成仅限于单一催化剂表面，该方法通常受标度关系制约。 为克服这一固有局限，双活性位点催化剂（如Ni/LaN）被提出。在该体系中，Ni负责氢活化，LaN则负责氮的吸附与活化，从而在更温和的温度下也能促进氨的生成。在此基础上，一系列基于空位的合成氨催化剂相继研究（Nature 2020, 583, 391; J. Am. Chem. Soc. 2020, 142, 14374; J. Am. Chem. Soc. 2021, 143, 12857; Angew. Chem. Int. Ed. 2022, e202","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨","wx":1},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzUxMDMzODg2Ng==&mid=2247823323&idx=3","t":"上海交通大学叶天南团队Nature Communications：富电子C2空位促进(N=N)δ-中间体催化合成氨","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUxMDMzODg2Ng%3D%3D&mid=2247823323&idx=3","s":"研之成理","d":"2026-06-24","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:59Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"基于此，叶天南团队提出了双活性位点策略，并开发了Ni/LaN氨合成催化剂。该策略利用LaN载体上的氮空位活化N2，从而克服了Ni自身氮结合能较弱的限制。","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["合成氨"],"wx":1},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzI3NDIwNDc0Ng==&mid=2651818686&idx=4","t":"科研新突破：科学家揭示钾助剂在铁基合成氨催化剂中的活性氢新机制","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3NDIwNDc0Ng%3D%3D&mid=2651818686&idx=4","s":"浙江省纺织印染助剂行业协会","d":"2026-06-24","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:57Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"据了解，陈萍研究员团队长期深耕氢化物催化领域，在温和条件固氮、合成氨催化技术方向已积累多项创新性科研成果，持续推动合成氨行业绿色低碳技术革新。","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["合成氨"],"ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系","wx":1},{"id":"10.3390/pr14132055","t":"Modeling and Optimization of a Green Ammonia Synthesis Loop Across a Wide Production Load Range","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/pr14132055","s":"Processes","d":"2026-06-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"“Power-to-ammonia” is widely regarded as a viable solution for large-scale consumption of wind and solar power, as well as for deep decarbonization in the energy and chemical sectors. However, the intermittent nature of renewable energy requires ammonia synthesis systems to operate across a wide and varying range of loads, posing challenges to their economic viability. To address this, we develop a simulation and optimization methodology for ammonia reactor operation under varying loads. Firstly, a high-fidelity reactor model is developed based on the reactor’s structural characteristics by incorporating reaction kinetics and thermodynamic mechanisms. This reactor model is then integrated with compression and separation units. To ensure computational efficiency, surrogate models are developed to approximate the ammonia synthesis and flash separation units. A case study of an ammonia plan","au":["Peng Ni","Xudong Zhou","Yi Wang","Xu Ji","Li Zhou"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"宽负荷范围内绿色合成氨循环的建模与优化","zb":"针对可再生能源间歇性导致的负荷波动问题，开发了基于反应动力学和热力学的高保真反应器模型，并结合压缩分离单元进行仿真优化。以10万吨/年氨厂为例，结果表明随着系统负荷降低，反应器可行操作区域显著变窄，优化了从30%到100%额定容量范围内的入口温度、压力及分离温度，建议随负荷降低提高入口温度以补偿压力降低导致的热释放减少。"},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.6c10038","t":"Spatially Separated Activation-Conversion Nitride Catalysts for Accelerated Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c10038","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2026-06-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Ammonia synthesis is a cornerstone of the modern chemical industry and emerging energy technologies, yet its catalytic efficiency remains fundamentally limited by the intrinsic linear scaling relationships. Here, we address this challenge by constructing a triphase heterostructure comprising a Ni2Mo3N host integrated with Mo2N domains and metallic Ni nanoparticles via a solid-solution reaction. Mechanistic studies reveal that metallic Ni activates H2 and supplies spillover hydrogen to the Ni2Mo3N host, thereby promoting surface hydrogenation and generating nitrogen vacancies within the host lattice. These vacancies drive lattice nitrogen migration from the Mo2N reservoir to the host, simultaneously creating surface vacancies on Mo2N that serve as efficient N2 activation centers. Through this spatially separated activation-conversion pathway, the catalyst effectively decouples conflicting","au":["Yu Ji","Xingda An","Shuang Liu","Kaiqi Nie","Liu Cao","Yuqing Xu"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"空间分离活化-转化氮化物催化剂加速合成氨","zb":"构建了Ni2Mo3N基三元异质结构催化剂，通过固溶反应引入Mo2N域和金属Ni纳米颗粒。研究发现金属Ni活化H2并溢流至Ni2Mo3N，促进表面氢化并产生晶格空位，驱动氮迁移；Mo2N表面空位高效活化N2。该空间分离路径使催化剂在500 °C和1.0 MPa下氨合成速率达32.5 mmol·gNi2Mo3N-1·h-1，接近Ni2Mo3N参考值的3倍。","ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨"},{"id":"10.1039/d6cc02221a","t":"Plasma-assisted ammonia synthesis utilizing water as a hydrogen source: progress, challenges, and prospects","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6cc02221a","s":"Chemical Communications","d":"2026-06-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This review summarizes plasma-based ammonia synthesis using water as a hydrogen source, covering advanced catalyst design, reactor optimization, and electro/photocatalysis coupling to boost green ammonia's efficiency and selectivity.","au":["Hongjun Li","Qian Xiao","Di Li","Jian Qi","Jiawei Wan","Dan Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"ob":"等离子体制氨｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1038/s41467-026-74820-4","t":"Creation of an air-stable surface electrene and its application to ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-026-74820-4","s":"Nature Communications","d":"2026-06-23","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":40,"ab":"Electrenes are unique materials characterized by a surface floating electron layer, which results in an ultra-low work function, making them ideal candidates for catalyzing chemical reactions via electron donation. However, these materials are extremely sensitive to air and moisture, thereby limiting their potential applications. Here, we demonstrate that oxygen-doped BaSiN2 is an air-stable surface electrene. Its highly active surface, with an ultra-low WF of approximately 1.5 eV, can donate surface floating electrons to adsorbed N2, forming an N2-passivated surface, which can be constantly regenerated through hydrogenation of surface-activated N2. This alternating pathway, particularly with the assistance of Ru loading, effectively produce ammonia: the Ru/BaSiN2:O catalyst exhibits high ammonia synthesis rate of 43 mmol gcat−1 h−1 at 300 °C and 0.9 MPa, and much superior air stability ","au":["Zhujun Zhang","Shiyao Wang","Jiang Li","Masato Sasase","Masaaki Kitano","Hideo Hosono"],"o":"回填","w":["Hideo Hosono"],"why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"空气稳定表面电烯的制备及其在合成氨中的应用","zb":"报道了氧掺杂BaSiN2作为首个空气稳定的表面电烯材料，其表面功函数约为1.5 eV，能向吸附的N2提供表面浮游电子。在Ru负载下，该催化剂通过氢化表面活化N2不断再生N2钝化表面，在300 °C和0.9 MPa下氨合成速率达43 mmol gcat−1 h-1，且相比目前报道的活性最高的电负氢化物基催化剂表现出优异的空气稳定性。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系","top":1},{"id":"10.1038/s41467-026-74661-1","t":"Facile Synthesis of Primary Amines via Nitrogen Fixation in Charged Microdroplets","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-026-74661-1","s":"Nature Communications","d":"2026-06-23","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":32,"ab":"Primary amines are one of the most versatile synthetic intermediates, but current methods rely on protecting groups in multistep reactions or corrosive reducing agents. Herein, we report an innovative synthetic method for primary amines based on accelerated microdroplet chemistry. The electrospray process allows in-situ ammonia generation from atmospheric nitrogen, reacting with alcohols of various properties (aliphatic and aromatic) to produce the corresponding amine. The alcohol to amine conversion rate improves (> 10×) when hydrazine is introduced as an ammonia source. Electronic and steric effects are also investigated. Overall, three spray conditions are investigated: (1) co-axial spray with hydrazine, (2) single emitter spray without hydrazine at high flowrates, and (3) single emitter spray without hydrazine at low flowrates. Material collection allowed NMR characterization of prod","au":["Rebekah Erin Strong","Owen L. Looker","Abraham K. Badu-Tawiah"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrogen Fixation"],"zt":"带电微液滴中固氮合成伯胺的简便方法","zb":"报道了一种基于加速微液滴化学的创新方法，利用电喷雾过程从大气氮气原位生成氨，与各类醇反应合成伯胺。引入肼作为氨源可将醇到胺的转化率提高10倍以上。该方法在温和条件下无需保护基团或腐蚀性还原剂即可获得伯胺，为合成化学提供了一种有价值的替代方案。","top":1},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzI4Njk3MDQ4Nw==&mid=2247796267&idx=6","t":"唯一通讯！上海交通大学「国家高层次人才」叶天南最新Nature子刊丨富电子双阴离子空位高效化学链合成氨！","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI4Njk3MDQ4Nw%3D%3D&mid=2247796267&idx=6","s":"微算云平台","d":"2026-06-23","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:59Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"近日，上海交通大学叶天南在Nature Communications发表了题为“Electron-rich dianion vacancies boost diazenide intermediates for efficient chemical looping ammonia synthesis”的研究论文，Jiaqi Wang、Bo Dai、Zichuang Li、Jiang Li为论文第一作者，叶天南为论文通","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨","wx":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.6983090","t":"Effect of combustion agent mass on the microstructure of Al2O3–YAG eutectic ceramic fabricated by rapid heating of combustion synthesis chemical furnace","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6983090","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-06-23","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Al2O3–Y3Al5O12 (Al2O3–YAG) eutectic ceramic with a three-dimensionally continuous interpenetrating network structure was successfully fabricated via a rapidly heated combustion synthesis chemical furnace. The effects of combustion agent mass on the microstructural evolution and solidification behavior of Al2O3–YAG eutectic ceramics were systematically investigated. The results indicate that the combustion agent mass determines the undercooling degree, melt viscosity and solidification velocity, thereby regulating the eutectic morphology from conventional ”Chinese script” structure to uniform cellular structure. When the combustion agent mass is 180 g, the inter-lamellar spacing of Al2O3–YAG eutectic reaches 1.19 μm, and the growth rate of Al2O3–YAG eutectic is up to 70.62 μm/s. Meanwhile, the Al2O3–YAG eutectic ceramic achieves excellent comprehensive mechanical properties, with a Vicker","au":["Aiyang Wang","Shulin Wang","Li Zhu","Man Xu","Weimin Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["rapid heating"],"zt":"燃烧剂质量对燃烧合成化学炉快速加热制备的 Al2O3–YAG 共晶陶瓷微观结构的影响","zb":"Al2O3–Y3Al5O12 (Al2O3–YAG) 共晶陶瓷通过快速加热的燃烧合成化学炉成功制备。系统地研究了燃烧剂质量对 Al2O3–YAG 共晶陶瓷微观结构演变和凝固行为的影响。结果表明，燃烧剂质量决定了过冷度、熔体粘度和凝固速度，从而调节共晶形貌从传统的“汉字”结构到均匀的蜂窝结构。当燃烧剂质量为 180 g 时，Al2O3–YAG 共晶的层间间距达到 1.19 μm，Al2O3–YAG 共晶的生长速率高达 70.62 μm/s。同时，Al2O3–YAG 共晶陶瓷具有优异的综合力学性能，维氏硬度为 21.58 GPa，断裂韧性为 3.36 MPa·m1/2。这归因于超细均匀的微观结构和多种协同增韧机制，包括裂纹偏转、裂纹桥接和裂纹阻滞。这项工作表明，燃烧合成快速加热方法是一种制备高性能 Al2O3–YAG 共晶陶瓷的有效方法，为快速制备细结构高温结构陶瓷提供了一种可行策略。","pre":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.6985010","t":"Structural and Morphological Effects of Cu-Based Alloy Nanoparticles on Electrochemical Nitrogen Reduction under Ambient Conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6985010","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-06-23","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Copper-based alloy nanoparticle catalysts, including Cu-Ni, Cu-Zn, Cu-Fe, and Cu-Pd systems, were synthesized and evaluated for electrochemical nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) under ambient conditions. The alloy nanoparticles were prepared using hydrothermal and thermal decomposition methods and characterized by X-ray diffraction (XRD), extended X-ray absorption fine structure (EXAFS), and transmission electron microscopy (TEM). The synthesized nanoparticles exhibited spherical morphologies with particle sizes ranging from 5.6 to 33.4 nm depending on alloy composition and preparation conditions. Electrochemical NRR measurements were conducted in 0.1 mol L⁻¹ Na₂SO₄ electrolyte using an H-type electrochemical cell under continuous N₂ flow. Among the investigated catalysts, Cu₁Fe₃ exhibited enhanced catalytic performance, achieving an NH₃ yield rate of 29.13 μg mg⁻¹cat h⁻¹ with a Faradaic","au":["Kaichao Zhang","Takehiko Sasaki"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Cu 基合金纳米粒子对环境条件下电化学氮还原的结构和形态效应","zb":"合成了包括 Cu-Ni、Cu-Zn、Cu-Fe 和 Cu-Pd 系统在内的铜基合金纳米粒子催化剂，并在环境条件下评估了它们对电化学氮还原反应 (NRR) 的性能。合金纳米粒子通过水热和热分解方法制备，并通过 X 射线衍射 (XRD)、扩展 X 射线吸收精细结构 (EXAFS) 和透射电子显微镜 (TEM) 进行表征。合成的纳米粒子表现出球形形态，粒径范围为 5.6 至 33.4 nm，取决于合金组成和制备条件。在 0.1 mol L⁻¹ Na₂SO₄ 电解质中使用 H 型电化学池在连续 N₂ 流下进行电化学 NRR 测量。在所研究的催化剂中，Cu₁Fe₃ 表现出增强的催化性能，在 -0.3 V 下实现了 29.13 μg mg⁻¹cat h⁻¹ 的 NH₃ 产率率和 2.94% 的法拉第效率 (FE)。此外，Cu₁Pd₂ 实现了 5.23% 的最高 FE，伴随 24.57 μg mg⁻¹c","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"10.1039/d6sc02866g","t":"Visible-Light-Driven Ruthenium-Catalyzed Hydrogenation of Man-ganese-Nitride Complexes to Ammonia under Ambient Conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6sc02866g","s":"Chemical Science","d":"2026-06-23","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"In recent years, photocatalytic hydrogenation of metal-nitrides to ammonia using solar energy as a renewable energy source and dihydrogen as both an electron and a proton source has been intensively investigated to achieve one of the most desirable next-generation scientific techniques, i.e., atom-economical ammonia production from dinitrogen and dihydrogen, thereby contributing to a carbon-neutral society. In this study, we have successfully developed visi-ble-light-driven photocatalytic hydrogenation of manganese-nitride complexes to ammonia at room temperature un-der 1 atm of dihydrogen in the presence of diruthenium complexes as dihydrogen oxidation catalysts and iridium complexes as photosensitizers. The turnover numbers based on the catalyst and the yield of ammonia based on the manganese-nitride complex reached up to 150 equiv. and 91%, respectively, indicating the high durability","au":["Yasuomi Yamazaki","Qiubo Wang","Yoshiaki Tanabe","Yoshiaki Nishibayashi"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"在环境条件下可见光驱动的钌催化锰氮化物复杂物氢化为氨","zb":"近年来，利用太阳能作为可再生能源源，并以氢气作为电子和质子供体，对金属氮化物进行光催化氢化以氨为目标的原子经济性氨生产，作为实现碳中和社会的最令人向往的下一代科学技术之一，已被广泛研究。本研究成功开发了在室温下、1 atm 氢气存在下、由双钌配合物作为氢气氧化催化剂、铱配合物作为光敏剂驱动的可见光驱动光催化氢化锰氮化物复杂物为氨。基于催化剂的周转数和基于锰氮化物复杂物的氨产率分别达到 150 当量和 91%，表明该光催化系统具有高耐久性和效率。此外，该氢化反应在 0.05 atm 氢气下（与其他研究组报道的其他系统相比，这是一个低压）也能光催化进行。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系｜光驱动","pp":"ChemRxiv"},{"id":"wx:__biz=Mzk2NDM1MjIwOA==&mid=2247497022&idx=1","t":"合成氨技术：哈伯法合成氨技术背后的故事","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk2NDM1MjIwOA%3D%3D&mid=2247497022&idx=1","s":"博创氢能","d":"2026-06-22","f":"2026-09-30T19:10:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"工业合成氨的历史，确实比课本上那几行字复杂得多。它不仅是一条化学工艺的进化之路，更纠缠着科学争论、人性纠葛与深刻的伦理悖论。8%的转化率：一场争论催生的突破","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["合成氨"],"wx":1},{"id":"10.1039/d6mh00812g","t":"Recent progress and perspectives of catalytic ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6mh00812g","s":"Materials Horizons","d":"2026-06-22","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"This critical review presents the recent progress of efficient catalysts and reaction mechanisms on ammonia synthesis, identifies key challenges and recommends the novel way to move forward.","au":["Fan Feng","Hongjie Cui","Linlin Hou","Lunqiao Xiong","Muyao Liu","Liuhao Mao"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"催化合成氨的最新进展与展望","zb":"综述了高效催化剂和反应机制的最新进展，识别了关键挑战并提出了未来的发展方向。"},{"id":"10.1007/s11244-026-02315-z","t":"Ammonia Synthesis through a Pulse Feeding Strategy Provides Insight into Catalytic Reactor Dynamics","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11244-026-02315-z","s":"Topics in Catalysis","d":"2026-06-22","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Abstract The role of NH 3 adsorption and diffusion in the pores of the catalyst on the ammonia synthesis rates at elevated temperatures is investigated through pulse feeding of the reactants over two different catalysts. One of the catalysts was a 1 wt% Ru/SBA-15, offering a very high and porous surface area. The second catalyst was a very low surface area Co 3 Mo 3 N catalyst with well-defined bulk and surface properties. By sending alternative pulses of H 2 and N 2 mixed with Ar, it was possible to differentiate the role of a porous support and observe surface events. Through a pulse feeding strategy, both reactor hydrodynamics and some of the surface events could be monitored. The transients of Ar in an empty reactor and a reactor packed with Co 3 Mo 3 N exhibited similar behaviours. On the other hand, delayed signals as tails in the derivative response curves over Ru/SBA-15 packed re","au":["Deniz Üner","Mustafa Yasin Aslan","Justin S. J. Hargreaves"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"脉冲进料策略合成氨揭示催化反应器动力学","zb":"通过在两种不同催化剂上对H2和N2混合气进行脉冲进料，研究了高温下NH3吸附和扩散对反应速率的影响。在Ru/SBA-15催化剂上观察到明显的拖尾信号，表明存在孔扩散效应；而在低比表面积的Co3Mo3N催化剂上，NH3信号与脉冲一致，表明其不受孔内吸附扩散影响。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系","pp":"Research Square"},{"id":"10.1039/d6cc03157a","t":"Joule-heating-assisted construction of RuNiFeO x /Ni foam for highly active and durable oxygen evolution","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6cc03157a","s":"Chemical Communications","d":"2026-06-22","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The self-supported RuNiFeO x electrocatalyst on nickel foam synthesized via rapid pulsed Joule-heating exhibits excellent activity and durability for oxygen evolution reaction in alkaline electrolyte.","au":["Xinxing Shi","Tongming Sun","Minmin Wang","Jinli Zhu","Miao Wang","Xiaohai Li"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule-heat"],"zt":"焦耳热辅助构建 RuNiFeO x /Ni 基板用于高效耐用的析氧","zb":"在镍泡沫上合成的自支撑 RuNiFeO x 电催化剂通过快速脉冲焦耳热处理表现出在碱性电解质中优异的析氧反应活性和耐久性。","ob":"焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.1002/cey2.70278","t":"Beyond Furnaces: Harnessing In Situ Joule Heating for Efficient C 1 Catalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cey2.70278","s":"Carbon Energy","d":"2026-06-22","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"ABSTRACT The catalytic conversion of C 1 molecules (CO, CO 2 , CH 4 , CH 3 OH, CH 2 O, etc.) is a pivotal route toward carbon neutrality and a sustainable energy future. Traditional thermocatalysis relies on fossil‐fuel combustion to supply heat, but this approach suffers from low heat‐transfer efficiency, high energy consumption, and catalyst deactivation. In contrast, Joule‐heated catalysis directly energizes conductive catalysts with electric current, enabling in situ, spatially uniform heating and the coupling of electric and thermal fields, thereby enhancing C 1 molecule conversion and overall energy efficiency. This review systematically elucidates the fundamental principles of Joule‐heated catalysis and highlights recent advances in its application to CO 2 methanation, hydrogen production via reforming, and the oxidation of formaldehyde and CO. From the viewpoints of enhanced heat","au":["Xue Kong","Tiantian Su","Faiza Meharban","Shengbin Cao","Jingsan Xu","Chao Lin"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"超越炉子：利用原位焦耳热实现高效的 C1 催化","zb":"C1 分子（CO、CO2、CH4、CH3OH、CH2O 等）的催化转化是通往碳中和和可持续能源未来的关键途径。传统的热催化依赖于化石燃料燃烧来供热，但这种方法存在传热效率低、能耗高和催化剂失活等问题。相比之下，焦耳热催化直接用电流激励导电催化剂，实现原位、空间均匀加热，并耦合电场和热场，从而提高 C1 分子转化率和整体能源效率。本综述系统地阐明了焦耳热催化的基本原理，并重点介绍了其在 CO2 甲烷化、重整制氢以及甲醛和 CO 氧化方面的应用进展。从增强传热、电子动力学和能带结构调控的角度，全面分析了电热协同作用的机制。此外，从理论理解、材料设计和工业应用等方面讨论了焦耳热催化的现有挑战和未来前景。这项工作旨在为推进焦耳热催化技术的根本研究和大规模应用提供见解和指导。","ob":"其他催化反应｜反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热"},{"id":"10.20944/preprints202606.1516.v1","t":"Direct Ammonia Synthesis from Air and Water Driven by Ultra-Fast Laser at Ambient Conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.20944/preprints202606.1516.v1","s":"Preprints.org","d":"2026-06-22","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The Haber-Bosch process dominates industrial ammonia synthesis but incurs massive energy consumption and carbon emissions. Here, we demonstrate a catalyst-free approach for direct ammonia synthesis from atmospheric nitrogen and water under ambient temperature and pressure, leveraging ultra-fast laser-induced plasma at the gas-liquid interface. By optimizing irradiation parameters (irradiation time, pulse energy, number of beams) and implementing a concentric laser scanning strategy, we achieved a maximum ammonia concentration of 0.624 μmol/20mL. This method bypasses the need for high temperature/pressure or catalysts, offering a sustainable path for distributed ammonia production. Our work underscores the potential of strong optical fields in activating inert molecules like N2 and H2O, with implications for decarbonizing chemical synthesis.","au":["Xinyu Hu","Yuxi Pang","Yu Wang","Longwang Xiu","Yanfei Liu","Xiangdong Cao"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"从空气和水出发在环境条件下通过超快激光驱动直接合成氨","zb":"研究对象为直接合成氨，采用无催化剂方法，利用超快激光诱导气液界面等离子体，在环境温度和压力下进行。通过优化照射参数（照射时间、脉冲能量、光束数量）和实施同心激光扫描策略，实现了0.624 μmol/20mL的最大氨浓度。该方法避免了高温/高压或催化剂的需求，为分布式氨生产提供了一条可持续路径。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动","pre":1},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzkyMzUyODU2Mg==&mid=2247498272&idx=1","t":"上海交通大学叶天南，最新Nature子刊！富电子双阴离子空位促进二氮烯中间体用于高效化学链合成氨！王佳琪/戴博/李自闯/李江一作","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkyMzUyODU2Mg%3D%3D&mid=2247498272&idx=1","s":"Gaussian","d":"2026-06-20","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:59Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"2026年06月19日，上海交通大学叶天南团队在Nature Communications期刊发表题为“Electron-rich dianion vacancies boost diazenide intermediates for efficient chemical looping ammonia synthesis”的研究论文，上海交通大学王佳琪/戴博/李自闯、东京科学大学李江","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨","wx":1},{"id":"wx:__biz=Mzk1Nzg1NTIzMQ==&mid=2247497875&idx=1","t":"叶天南Nat Commun | 富电子双阴离子空位强化二氮烯中间体助力高效化学链合成氨","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk1Nzg1NTIzMQ%3D%3D&mid=2247497875&idx=1","s":"研途创见","d":"2026-06-20","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:59Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"通讯作者：叶天南.1上海交通大学化学化工学院，变革性分子前沿科学中心、聚烯烃催化技术与高性能材料全国重点实验室 2东京科学大学综合研究所，元素战略MDX研究中心 3重庆大学材料科学与工程学院，国家镁合金材料工程技","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["合成氨"],"ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨","wx":1},{"id":"10.1038/s41467-026-74563-2","t":"Electron-rich dianion vacancies boost diazenide intermediates for efficient chemical looping ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-026-74563-2","s":"Nature Communications","d":"2026-06-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":40,"ab":"Activating the nitrogen molecule under mild conditions remains a great challenge in ammonia synthesis. Electron-rich active sites are highly sought after to lower the activation barrier and enable efficient ammonia formation. In this work, we engineer electron-rich dianion vacancies using rare-earth carbide (LaC2) as a platform, where N2 undergoes horizontal adsorption and lattice embedding at the C2 dianion vacancy sites. In situ experimental characterization, combined with computational calculations, reveals that the adsorbed N2 molecules accept electrons from the C2 dianion vacancies, forming highly reactive (N = N)δ− intermediates. These species are crucial for promoting ammonia synthesis via an associative pathway. Utilizing the chemical looping ammonia synthesis process, LaC2 emerges as an optimal candidate for N2 activation and the Ni/LaC2 catalyst demonstrates exceptional perform","au":["Jiaqi Wang","Bo Dai","Zichuang Li","Jiang Li","Xiaojun Lu","Wen-Qian Li"],"o":"回填","w":["Hideo Hosono","Tian-Nan Ye"],"why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"富电子二阴离子空位促进化学循环氨合成","zb":"利用稀土碳化物平台构建富电子二阴离子空位，通过水平吸附和晶格嵌入活化N2，形成高活性(N=N)δ−中间体。Ni/LaC2催化剂在400 °C和0.1 MPa下实现6.9 mmol·g⁻¹·h⁻¹的产率，性能优于现有金属催化剂。","ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨","top":1,"rb":["X-MOL资讯"]},{"id":"10.69997/sct.181169","t":"Exploring the Thermal Coupling of Solid Oxide Electrolysis and Ammonia Synthesis: A Plantwide Energy Integration Assessment","u":"https://doi.org/10.69997/sct.181169","s":"Systems and Control Transactions","d":"2026-06-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"The transition toward low-carbon ammonia production increasingly relies on highly efficient routes for renewable hydrogen generation, with Solid Oxide Electrolysis (SOE) representing a particularly promising solution. SOEs, operating with steam at elevated temperatures, offer intrinsic thermodynamic advantages and are attractive when integrated with processes that can effectively utilize or supply high-grade heat. This context opens the possibility for advanced energy coupling between hydrogen production and the exothermic ammonia synthesis process. This work investigates such an energy integration strategy by simulating a small-scale ammonia plant where hydrogen is produced through an SOE system thermally coupled to the ammonia synthesis loop. Specifically, high-grade heat available in the Haber-Bosch (HB) reactor outlet is recovered via a “Heat Recovery Steam Generator” (HRSG) to provi","au":["Alessandra Macchi","Federica Longobardi","Régis Anghilante","Andrea Isella","Davide Manca"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"固体氧化物电解与氨合成热耦合：全厂能量集成评估","zb":"研究通过模拟小规模氨厂，利用 Haber-Bosch 反应器出口的高温热能通过余热蒸汽发生器为固体氧化物电解槽提供 55 wt% 的蒸汽。结果表明，集成配置显著降低了蒸汽生成的外部电耗 84%，系统级电效率从 57% 提升至 62%，电-氢比从 45.9 降至 42.1 kWh/kg，使氨的平准化成本降低 4-5%。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨"},{"id":"10.69997/sct.173047","t":"Dynamic Operation of a Haber-Bosch Loop with Quench-Cooled Converter for Power-to-Ammonia Systems","u":"https://doi.org/10.69997/sct.173047","s":"Systems and Control Transactions","d":"2026-06-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"This work presents a preliminary application of a developing methodology for assessing the operational flexibility of ammonia synthesis loops. Part of this methodology involves systematic dynamic testing in the synthesis loop. In the present case, a synthesis loop equipped with a two-bed, quench-cooled converter operating under variable feed conditions was considered. A high-fidelity model of the converter was developed in gPROMS Process using two-dimensional reactor models from its fixed-bed catalytic reactor library, and a synthesis loop configuration was modeled and designed in the same environment. A series of dynamic tests varied the make-up flow rate across four disturbance amplitudes (±25% and ±50%) and four disturbance durations (10 s, 600 s, 1800 s, 3600 s). The results showed that disturbances of ±50% magnitude led to the violation of one process operational constraint. These f","au":["José M. Pires","Diogo A. C. Narciso","Carla I. C. Pinheiro"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"淬冷式变换器哈伯-博施循环的动态运行","zb":"在gPROMS Process中建立高保真模型，测试合成回路在±25%和±50%进料扰动下的动态响应。结果表明±50%扰动会违反操作约束，为构建初步运行图和确定过程边界提供了依据。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨"},{"id":"10.69997/sct.126160","t":"Structural Constraints with the P-graph Framework: Application to an Ammonia Synthesis Process","u":"https://doi.org/10.69997/sct.126160","s":"Systems and Control Transactions","d":"2026-06-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"An optimized flowsheet can be generated by numerous approaches. Process optimization via superstructure is one of the methods used to provide solutions that consider the interactions between different decision layers. A process simulator-based optimization is considered in this work, as it offers a reliable and rigorous modeling environment. It is then coupled with a P-graph-based framework to reduce the tedious mathematical writing of the logical constraints to guarantee the structural coherence of a sequence of unit operations.The developed framework consists of three algorithms. The first algorithm transforms the superstructure flowsheet into a P-graph. The second algorithm gets process sub-structures from the superstructure by searching for active units corresponding to a set of decisions made, for example, by an optimizer. The third one checks structural feasibility by verifying tha","au":["Darrick Hillaby","Andrés Piña Martinez","Jean-François Portha","Laurent Falk"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"P图框架下的结构约束：应用于氨合成过程","zb":"提出一种结合P图框架与过程模拟器的优化方法，通过三个算法将超结构转化为P图并检查结构可行性。应用于氨合成过程，在减少逻辑约束的同时实现了与先前研究等效的结果。"},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.6964498","t":"Potential for sustainable ammonia synthesis from glycerol waste valorization: Energy management and hydrogen self-sufficiency","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6964498","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-06-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"The conventional Haber-Bosch process for ammonia production faces significant sustainability challenges, including high CO2 emissions, substantial external energy requirements, and dependence on fossil fuel-derived hydrogen. To address these limitations, this study explores a sustainable pathway for ammonia production by valorizing glycerol waste. In this regard, a novel heat-integrated reactor concept that couples aqueous-phase glycerol reforming (APGR) with ammonia synthesis (AS) is proposed. Glycerol, a renewable waste by-product of biodiesel production, serves as the hydrogen feedstock for AS, while the heat released by the AS reaction drives the endothermic APGR reaction. A rigorous mathematical model is developed, comprising a one-dimensional pseudo-homogeneous model for the AS-side and a two-phase model for the APGR-side, and validated against experimental data from the literature","au":["Ahmad Salmabadi-Farahani","Mohammad Hasan Khademii","Mahboubeh Toghyani"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"利用甘油废料制氨的可持续潜力：能量管理与氢自给","zb":"提出耦合水相甘油重整与氨合成的热集成反应器概念，通过三管式结构解决热冲突，实现68%甘油转化率和33%氮转化率。分析表明220 atm以上压力收益递减，维持H2O/glycerol比3和N2/H2比高于0.42可确保氢自给。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨","pre":1},{"id":"10.69997/sct.125437","t":"A Framework for Flexible Start/Stop Operation of Electrified Chemical Processes","u":"https://doi.org/10.69997/sct.125437","s":"Systems and Control Transactions","d":"2026-06-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"A flexible start-stop operating policy that involves full shut-down and start-up may be beneficial for electrified plants under certain grid conditions, such as dispatchable demand response. This paper introduces a multi-period Hamilton-Jacobi reachability framework to explore the space of state trajectories for plant shut-down and start-up. Shut-down is defined in terms of operations leading to a stand-by state with no material flows or energy inputs, and variables within safety constraints. Candidate stand-by states are identified by constructing backwards reachability tubes from the desired steady-state operating point. The candidate shut-down/stand-by state is partitioned in fast and slow regions. Admissible control input trajectories are determined for the fast region, from which the minimum time trajectory is selected as optimal for fast start-up. A proof-of-concept simulation usin","au":["Samuel Mercer","Michael Baldea"],"o":"回填","why":["Electrified Chemical"],"zt":"用于电化学化工过程的灵活启停操作框架","zb":"涉及完全关闭和启动的灵活启停操作策略在某些电网条件下（如可调度需求响应）可能对电化学工厂有益。本文介绍了一种多周期哈密顿-雅可比可达性框架，用于探索工厂关闭和启动的状态轨迹空间。关闭定义为导致无物质流或能量输入的待机状态的操作，以及安全约束内的变量。通过从期望的稳态操作点构建反向可达性管来识别候选待机状态。候选关闭/待机状态在快速和慢速区域之间被划分。为快速区域确定了允许的控制输入轨迹，从中选择最小时间轨迹作为快速启动的最优解。使用反应/分离/回收工厂的概念验证模拟。"},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.6967300","t":"Spatial Control of Trace TiO₂ by Atomic Layer Deposition to Tune Co–TiOₓ Interfaces for Fischer–Tropsch Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6967300","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-06-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Atomic Layer Deposition (ALD) enables the atomic precision to engineer metal–support interfaces, yet the influence of promoter spatial distribution on catalytic performance remains insufficiently understood. In this work, trace amounts of TiO₂ were deposited on mesoporous Al₂O₃, and the variation of precursor dose and exposure time were used to decouple Ti loading from its spatial distribution. A low-dose/high-exposure strategy led to preferential TiO₂ enrichment at the external surface as confirmed by XPS, HAADF-STEM-EDS, H₂-TPR, and WDS. Although CO chemisorption shows a decrease in total exposed cobalt surface area, the modified catalyst exhibit a significant increase in turnover frequency (TOF), CO conversion, hydrocarbon yield, and C₅₊ selectivity in Fischer-Tropsch Synthesis (FTS) application. CO-DRIFTS analysis reveals a pronounced red-shift in the CO adsorption band, indicating e","au":["Ann Charise Cariño","Martí Biset-Peiró","Elena Martín Morales","Jordi Llorca","Eduardo Domínguez Ojeda","Alba Garzón Manjón"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积的空间控制用于调节 Co–TiOₓ 界面以用于费托合成","zb":"原子层沉积 (ALD) 能够以原子精度设计金属-载体界面，但促进剂空间分布对催化性能的影响尚未充分理解。在介孔 Al₂O₃ 上沉积微量 TiO₂，并使用前驱体剂量和暴露时间的不同来将 Ti 负载与其空间分布分离。低剂量/高暴露策略导致 TiO₂ 在外表面富集，由 XPS、HAADF-STEM-EDS、H₂-TPR 和 WDS 确认。尽管 CO 吸附显示总暴露钴表面积减少，但改性催化剂在费托合成 (FTS) 应用中表现出 TOF、CO 转化率、碳氢化合物产率和 C₅₊ 选择性的显著增加。CO-DRIFTS 分析揭示了 CO 吸附带的明显红移，表明通过 Co-TiOx 界面的电子扰动增强了 CO 活化。这些发现突出了促进剂空间分布在高效金属-氧化物催化剂设计中的重要性。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积｜表征温程（TPR/TPD/TPO 等，不等于反应供热）","pre":1},{"id":"10.69997/sct.120107","t":"Multi-Scale Design for Clean Energy Systems: Industrial Electrification and Flexible Operation of Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.69997/sct.120107","s":"Systems and Control Transactions","d":"2026-06-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Flexible, electrified systems for chemical and energy production are promising alternatives to traditional, hydrocarbon-based processes. Flexible systems have the potential to reduce costs and emissions, but the interconnection between design and operation makes these systems challenging to implement. We use an operation-informed design framework to model a flexible, electrified ammonia synthesis system. We examine the levelized cost and carbon intensity of ammonia in response to different grid emissions (0-420 kg/MWh). We find levelized costs from 700-1200 $/ton-NH3 and observe non-monotonicity in carbon-intensity with respect to grid emissions. We rationalize this trend as a design transition from large, grid-reliant systems to smaller, flexible designs that are grid independent. We then study how synergies in demand and unit-operation flexibility can lower both the price and carbon-in","au":["Nicholas N. Kalamaris","Christos T. Maravelias"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.76580","t":"Partial Disruption of Coordination Bonds Triggers MOF Amorphization for Efficient Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.76580","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-06-19","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT Amorphous metal‐organic frameworks ( a ‐MOFs) hold great promise for expanding the functional and structural landscape of traditional MOFs, yet their fabrication and local structural investigations remain a significant challenge. Herein, we propose a partial coordination bond disruption strategy for preparing a ‐MOFs from mixed‐ligand complexes. The M 2 (trz) 2 sq family ( M = Co, Zn, Cd; trz = 1,2,4‐triazolate; sq = squarate) features two different types of linkage: stronger M–trz–M connections that assemble into a flexible “wine‐rack” framework, and comparatively weaker M–sq–M connections that act as the supporting pillars. A comprehensive analysis combining synchrotron‐based powder X‐ray diffraction, X‐ray absorption fine structure (XAFS) spectroscopy, pair distribution function (PDF) analysis, and density functional theory (DFT) calculations reveals that, under thermal dehyd","au":["Zhanning Liu","Yufei Shan","Longlong Fan","Yili Cao","Chen Wang","Yue Chen"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"部分破坏配位键触发 MOF 晶态化以实现高效的电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为非晶态金属有机框架（a-MOFs）的制备和局部结构研究。采用混合配体复合物制备 a-MOFs，M 2 (trz) 2 sq 系列（M = Co, Zn, Cd; trz = 1,2,4-三唑olate; sq = 草酸酯）具有两种不同的连接方式：较强的 M–trz–M 连接形成灵活的“酒架”框架，较弱的 M–sq–M 连接作为支撑柱。通过同步辐射粉末X射线衍射、X射线吸收精细结构（XAFS）光谱、配分函数（PDF）分析和密度泛函理论（DFT）计算，发现热脱水时 M–sq–M 连接被选择性地断裂，酒架 M–trz–M 框架发生几何畸变，最终导致长程有序的丧失。a-Co 2 (trz) 2 sq 因丰富的钴空位位点，在硝酸盐还原反应（NO 3 RR）到氨的电催化中表现出高达96.32%的法拉第效率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.69997/sct.185245","t":"Modeling and Simulation of Nitrogen Generation by Pressure Swing Adsorption for Power-to-Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.69997/sct.185245","s":"Systems and Control Transactions","d":"2026-06-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Power-to-ammonia (P2A) provides a carbon-free alternative to conventional ammonia production by replacing fossil-based feedstocks with electrolytic hydrogen and nitrogen from air separation. For decentralized P2A systems, pressure swing adsorption (PSA) offers a flexible alternative to cryogenic air separation. However, its industrial implementations are largely proprietary, and open, first-principles models capable of simulating its cyclic, nonlinear transport are scarce in literature. This work presents a first-principles, dynamic, one-dimensional model of a PSA superstructure for nitrogen generation, formulated with thermodynamically consistent equations of state, coupling multicomponent mass, energy, and momentum balances with kinetically limited adsorption on carbon molecular sieves. The resulting system of partial differential-algebraic equations is semi-discretized using the finit","au":["Marcus J. Schytt","Lorenz T. Biegler","John B. Jørgensen"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"基于压力摆动吸附的氮气生成建模与仿真：用于制氨的电力系统","zb":"研究对象为制氨电力系统中的压力摆动吸附（PSA）技术，关键方法为建立基于热力学一致性状态方程的一维动态模型，模拟PSA超结构中的氮气生成过程，结合多组分质量、能量和动量平衡与碳分子筛上的动力学限制吸附。模型采用有限体积法半离散化， diagonally implicit Runge-Kutta 方法积分，并通过基于射击的求解方法计算循环稳态（CSS）。框架在Julia中实现，结合解析导数与自动微分，利用稀疏线性代数高效求解大型非线性系统。研究比较了空气分离两床PSA循环中的空间和时间离散化策略、CSS求解方法以及理想气体与真实气体热力学对预测氮气纯度和回收率的影响。"},{"id":"10.69997/sct.117762","t":"Towards the Decarbonization of a Conventional Ammonia Plant by the Gradual Incorporation of Green Hydrogen and Air-Separated Nitrogen","u":"https://doi.org/10.69997/sct.117762","s":"Systems and Control Transactions","d":"2026-06-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"As economies advance towards decarbonization, industry follows suit. The ammonia (NH3) sector heavily relies on the energy- and carbon-intensive Haber-Bosch (HB) process, which accounts for nearly 2% of global CO2 emissions due to its reliance on fossil fuels. Emerging technologies are paving the way for fully renewable NH3 production, although the most mature green process still relies on the HB process, entirely replacing fossil fuels with electrolytic green hydrogen (H2). This work introduces the first developments towards the gradual incorporation of green H2 and air-separated nitrogen (N2) into a conventional NH3 production plant. Using Aspen Plus® V14 for modelling and simulation of Steam Methane Reforming (SMR), different scenarios incorporating 0 to 40 % of these alternative feedstocks were analyzed. An economic objective function is used in each scenario's optimization. To impro","au":["João Fortunato","Diogo A. C. Narciso","Henrique A. Matos"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"通过逐步引入绿氢和空气分离氮实现传统氨厂脱碳","zb":"利用Aspen Plus® V14模拟蒸汽甲烷重整过程，分析将0至40%绿氢和空气分离氮引入传统氨厂。结果显示40%替代原料可使碳排放减少29.4%，天然气节省30.1%，但运营成本增加52%。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨"},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.6967045","t":"Lithium Nitrate-Mediated Interfacial Engineering for Stable Anode-Free Lithium Metal Batteries","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6967045","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-06-19","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Constructing lithium metal batteries by pre-storing lithium in the cathode and in-situ plating Li on copper has emerged as a promising architecture. Anode-free designs enhance energy density, reduce cost, and simplify fabrication with improved safety. Yet, lithium plating often leads to mossy or whisker-like dendrites due to uneven deposition and weak adhesion on copper. To address this, we demonstrate rechargeable in-situ plated lithium metal batteries using copper foil anodes and LiFePO4 (LFP) cathodes. The electrolyte consists of 1 M LiTFSI in ether-based solvent with 4 wt% LiNO3 additives. Reduction of LiNO3 produces lithium nitrite and nitride, enabling a robust solid electrolyte interface (SEI) with high stability. The resulting Cu||LFP cell, with cathode mass loading of ~12 mg cm⁻², delivers an areal discharge capacity of ~1.6 mAh cm⁻² in the first cycle at 0.17 mA cm⁻² (","au":["Addisu Alemayehu Assegie","Wei-Nien Su","Addis Mekonnen Adamu","Bing Joe Hwang"],"o":"回填","zt":"硝酸锂介导的界面工程用于稳定的无负极锂金属电池","zb":"研究对象为通过在正极预储锂和在铜上原位沉积锂构建锂金属电池。电解液由1 M LiTFSI 在基于醚的溶剂中添加4 wt% LiNO3 组成。LiNO3 还原产生亚硝酸锂和氮化锂，形成具有高稳定性的坚固固体电解质界面（SEI）。Cu||LFP 电池（正极质量负载约12 mg cm⁻²）在0.17 mA cm⁻² (0.1C) 下首次循环的面积放电容量为~1.6 mAh cm⁻²。此外，石墨复合 LFP 正极和铜箔负极的硬币电池在0.2 mA cm⁻² 下循环100次后保留65%的初始容量，200次后保留33%。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.6966067","t":"Ammonia-selective catalytic ozonation for nitrogen production: The crucial role of electron Janus-type defect sites in the process of generating surface atomic oxygen","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6966067","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-06-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The treatment of ammonia nitrogen in urban overflow sewage requires efficient and stable technologies. Here, we report a cobalt doping strategy to modulate the electronic structure of iron oxides, creating Janus-type asymmetric Fe-Ov-Co defect sites. The distinct d-electron configurations of Co²⁺ (d⁷) and Fe³⁺ (d⁵) induce intrinsic charge polarization, forming a local built-in electric field. Using time-resolved in situ Raman spectroscopy, we directly observed surface atomic oxygen (*O, 909 cm⁻¹) as the dominant reactive species, confirming a shift from radical to non-radical oxidation pathway. The optimized Fe-8%Co catalyst achieves approximately 90% ammonia removal and 77.3% nitrogen selectivity within 30 minutes at room temperature, with negligible metal leaching over 12 cycles. This work not only demonstrates a high-performance catalyst but also provides atomic-scale insights into as","au":["Wanting He","Jianzhong Wang","Jianming Han","Yongchao Zhou","Mingze Tang","Shijie Wang"],"o":"回填","zt":"氨选择性催化臭氧氧化用于氮气生产：电子 Janus 型缺陷位在表面原子氧生成过程中的关键作用","zb":"研究对象为钴掺杂策略调节氧化铁的电子结构，创建 Janus 型不对称 Fe-Ov-Co 缺陷位。Co²⁺ (d⁷) 和 Fe³⁺ (d⁵) 的不同 d 电子构型导致内在电荷极化，形成局部内建电场。通过时间分辨原位拉曼光谱，直接观察到表面原子氧（*O, 909 cm⁻¹）作为主要活性物种，确认了从自由基到非自由基氧化途径的转变。优化的 Fe-8%Co 催化剂在室温下30分钟内实现约90%的氨去除和77.3%的氮选择性，12个循环内金属浸出可忽略不计。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）；涉及Fe/铁体系","pre":1},{"id":"10.21203/rs.3.rs-9846962/v1","t":"Study on the Carrier Effect and Structure-Activity Relationship of Cobalt-Based Hydrogen Production Catalysts by Ammonia Reforming","u":"https://doi.org/10.21203/rs.3.rs-9846962/v1","s":"Research Square","d":"2026-06-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract To break through the bottleneck in hydrogen storage and transportation and advance the industrial application of the \"ammonia-hydrogen\" energy route, this study focuses on the carrier effect of cobalt-based non-precious metal ammonia decomposition catalysts. Through the deposition-precipitation method, cobalt-based catalysts loaded on different oxide carriers (CeO 2 , La 2 O 3 , SiO 2 , etc.) were prepared. Combined with XRD, TEM, XPS and other methods for characterization, the regulatory mechanism of the physical and chemical properties of the carriers on the structure and ammonia decomposition performance of the catalysts was systematically explored, and kinetic analysis and stability tests were carried out. The activity test shows that the chemical effect of the carrier has a much greater impact on the catalytic efficiency than the physical specific surface area. The cobalt-b","au":["Bin Guan","Zhongqi Zhuang","Lei Zhu","Chenyu Zhu","Tiankui Zhu","Shiying Chang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"通过氨分解研究钴基氢生产催化剂的载体效应和构效关系","zb":"研究对象为钴基非贵金属氨分解催化剂的载体效应。通过沉积-沉淀法，制备了负载在不同氧化物载体（CeO 2 、La 2 O 3 、SiO 2 等）上的钴基催化剂。结合XRD、TEM、XPS等方法表征，系统探索了载体的物理化学性质对催化剂结构和氨分解性能的调控机制，并进行动力学分析和稳定性测试。活性测试表明，载体的化学效应对催化效率的影响远大于物理比表面积。负载纳米 CeO 2 (Co/CeO 2 (N)) 的催化剂表现最佳，450℃时氨转化率为46.3%，550℃时接近完全分解（94.2%），显著优于传统的 Al 2 O 3 和 TiO 2 载体催化剂。","ob":"氨分解制氢","pre":1},{"id":"10.1002/advs.76184","t":"Controllable Carbon Shell Encapsulation via Rapid Joule Heating Calcination for High‐Performance Asymmetric Supercapacitor With Suppressed Self‐Discharge and Robust Cycling Stability","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/advs.76184","s":"Advanced Science","d":"2026-06-18","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"ABSTRACT Asymmetric supercapacitors (ASCs) comprising two different pseudocapacitive electrodes offer a promising route toward higher energy density, yet the serious self‐discharge behavior and poor cycle life hinder their wider applications. This work proposes a controllable carbon shell encapsulation strategy based on rapid Joule heating calcination to construct high‐performance ASC with suppressed self‐discharge and robust cycling stability. As a result, the as‐assembled ASC (H‐Fe 3 O 4 @C‐15//H‐NiCo 2 S 4 @C‐40) exhibits a maximum energy density of 105.6 W h kg −1 at a power density of 749 W kg −1 , and long cycling lifespan with 93.7% capacitance retention after 25 000 cycles. Furthermore, current ASC also demonstrates moderated self‐discharge, with its open‐circuit voltage decaying from 1.48 to 0.75 V over 31102 s. Theoretically, the density functional theory (DFT) results adequate","au":["Qiang Zhou","Zheng Yang","Zhen Cao","Xulan Zheng","Xiao Yan","Yunsong Li"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"通过快速焦耳热煅烧实现可控碳壳包覆用于具有抑制自放电和稳健循环稳定性的高性能非对称超级电容器","zb":"包含两种不同赝电容电极的非对称超级电容器 (ASC) 为提高能量密度提供了有希望的途径，但严重的自放电行为和较差的循环寿命阻碍了其更广泛的应用。本文提出了一种基于快速焦耳热煅烧的可控碳壳包覆策略来构建具有抑制自放电和稳健循环稳定性的高性能 ASC。结果，组装的 ASC (H‐Fe 3 O 4 @C‐15//H‐NiCo 2 S 4 @C‐40) 在 749 W kg −1 的功率密度下表现出 105.6 W h kg −1 的最大能量密度，并在 25 000 次循环后保留了 93.7% 的电容。此外，当前 ASC 还表现出温和的自放电，其开路电压在 31102 s 后从 1.48 降至 0.75 V。理论上，密度泛函理论 (DFT) 结果充分揭示了自放电性能的显著改善应源于电极与电解质离子之间吸附能的增加。有意义的是，这种可控碳壳包覆策略代表了一种通用的可行方法，可有效抑制自放电并延长 A","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d6ee01570k","t":"Breaking the performance trade-offs in ammonia synthesis via spontaneous proton supply","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ee01570k","s":"Energy & Environmental Science","d":"2026-06-18","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Anodic activation creates a specific CoFe-(oxy)hydroxide interface on spinel CoFe 0.25 Cr 1.75 O 4 , enabling spontaneous lattice-proton supply for fast nitrate hydrogenation and broad-window ammonia electrosynthesis.","au":["Qian Wu","Songzhu Luo","Pengfei Song","Chencheng Dai","Leonhard Tannesia","Longcheng Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1039/d6gc02381a","t":"Long-Term Efficient Ammonia Synthesis by Cu–Co Tandem Active Sites at High Current Density","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6gc02381a","s":"Green Chemistry","d":"2026-06-18","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO3RR) holds significant promise for both sustainable ammonia (NH3) synthesis and industrial wastewater treatment. However, its efficiency in neutral electrolytes is severely limited by the insufficient...","au":["Dongqi Liu","Chunqi Yang","Chuqian Xiao","Sheng Hu","Shaoyan Wang","Xiuming Bu"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"高电流密度下Cu–Co串联活性位点长期高效氨合成","zb":"研究对象为电催化硝酸盐还原反应（NO3RR）在碱性电解质中的效率，关键方法为研究Cu–Co串联活性位点对氨（NH3）合成的催化性能，但摘要未提供具体方法和结果。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d6fd00090h","t":"Electrolyte and gas flow rate balance in flow cells for lithium-mediated ammonia electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6fd00090h","s":"Faraday Discussions","d":"2026-06-18","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This work presents a gas-diffusion-electrode cell for studying the cathodic interface in Li-mediated N 2 reduction. High, balanced electrolyte and gas flow rates improve Faradaic efficiency and gas-phase NH 3 recovery while maintaining stable operation.","au":["Anna Mangini","Giulia Zagatti","Julia Amici","Sara Garcia-Ballesteros","Federico Bella"],"o":"回填","why":["lithium-mediated ammonia"],"zt":"流电池中电解质和气体流速平衡：锂介导的氨电合成","zb":"研究对象为锂介导的N 2 还原电合成流电池，关键方法为研究阴极界面，通过调节电解质和气体流速平衡，提高法拉第效率和气相NH 3 回收率，同时保持稳定操作。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsaem.6c01033","t":"Ultrasmall Hematite Nanocrystals Interfaced Multilayered Carbon Onions To Synergistically Promote Selective Nitrogen Reduction to Ammonia under Ambient Conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsaem.6c01033","s":"ACS Applied Energy Materials","d":"2026-06-18","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Simultaneous adsorption and activation of N 2 molecules on the surface of an electrocatalyst are crucial for electrochemical N 2 fixation. To harness rapid electron transfer, a higher surface area characteristic of onion-structured carbon (OLCs), and the inherent oxygen deficiency in Fe 2 O 3 nanocrystals that provide optimal active sites for N 2 activation, ultrasmall Fe 2 O 3 nanocrystals (3.57 ± 0.03 nm) decorated OLCs (45.98 ± 1.08 nm) with varied loading concentrations have been synthesized. The FTIR peak detected at 546 cm −1 signifies the formation of an Fe−O−C bond, suggesting a chemical interaction between α-Fe 2 O 3 and OLC. Furthermore, the increased I D / I G ratio arising from the enhanced sp 3 hybridization, along with HRTEM analysis, confirms their synergistic coupling. The optimized α-Fe 2 O 3 coupled OLC exhibits N 2 reduction to NH 3 (NRR) activity with 2- and 10-fold e","au":["Sweta Bastia","Smrutirekha Swain","Niharika Kumar","Rajashree P. Mishra","Asish K. Dehury","Rakhi R. Biswas"],"o":"回填","why":["NRR"],"zt":"超小赤铁矿纳米晶体与多层碳洋葱界面协同促进环境条件下选择性氮还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为超小Fe 2 O 3 纳米晶体（3.57 ± 0.03 nm）修饰的洋葱结构碳（OLC，45.98 ± 1.08 nm）的协同催化体系，关键方法为合成Fe 2 O 3 装饰OLC，并通过FTIR、HRTEM等表征确认Fe−O−C键形成和协同耦合。优化后的α-Fe 2 O 3 装饰OLC对N 2 还原为NH 3（NRR）活性比裸OLC和裸α-Fe 2 O 3 分别提高2倍和10倍，NRR通过关联途径进行，由 15 N 标记实验证实产物NH 3 仅来自N 2 气体。催化剂在24小时内电流密度无显著变化，表现出良好稳定性。活性提升归因于协同效应：增加电化学表面积（0.24 mF cm −2 ）、电子密度（1.25 × 10 25 cm −3 ）、降低电子转移电阻和负的平坦带电位，使费米能级更接近导带，改善电荷分离。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.6c06515","t":"Beyond Geometric Effects: Particle Size-Dependent Electronic Promotion in Ru Catalysts for Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c06515","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2026-06-17","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":32,"ab":"Abstract Metal particle-size effects in heterogeneous catalysis are commonly interpreted in geometric terms, where catalytic trends arise from variations in the density of active surface ensembles while the intrinsic properties of the sites are generally assumed to remain unchanged. Here we demonstrate that metal particle size also governs the intrinsic properties of active sites via size-dependent electronic promotion, beyond conventional geometric effects. Using well-defined Ru catalysts supported on multiwalled carbon nanotubes for ammonia synthesis, we separate the geometric contribution of B5-like site density from changes in the intrinsic properties of the sites induced by electronic promotion. Without promoters, the adsorption and catalytic properties of these sites remain essentially invariant with particle size, consistent with classical geometric interpretations. In contrast, w","au":["Yaejun Baik","Seunghyuck Chi","DongHwan Oh","Susung Lee","Kyeongjin Lee","Chanyoung Oh"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"超越几何效应：Ru 催化剂氨合成中粒子尺寸依赖的电子促进","zb":"利用负载于多壁碳纳米管的 Ru 催化剂，研究分离了几何贡献与电子促进效应。发现添加 BaO 后，小尺寸 Ru 颗粒因高表面体积比能积累更多电子密度，通过增强 π-背键作用强化 N2 活化并缓解氢中毒，从而显著提升 B5 位点的本征活性。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系、碳材料","top":1},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzI3NzUwMzM3OQ==&mid=2247667335&idx=2","t":"【动态】The Innovation：钾助剂在铁基合成氨催化剂中的活性氢新机制","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3NzUwMzM3OQ%3D%3D&mid=2247667335&idx=2","s":"科学温故","d":"2026-06-17","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:57Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"陈萍研究团队长期致力于氢化物催化研究，前期在温和条件下固氮方向取得系列进展（Nat. Chem.，2017；Nat. Energy，2018；Nat. Catal.，2021；Nat. Chem.，2024）。","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["合成氨"],"ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系","wx":1},{"id":"10.1002/adhm.71329","t":"Atomic Layer Deposition Processes: Versatile Platforms for Engineering ZnO‐Chitosan Biointerfaces","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adhm.71329","s":"Advanced Healthcare Materials","d":"2026-06-17","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"ABSTRACT This study explores zinc‐functionalized chitosan (CS) for engineering bio‐multifunctional interfaces via three atomic‐scale techniques: vapor phase metalation (VPM), multiple pulsed vapor phase infiltration (MPI), and O2 plasma‐enhanced atomic layer deposition (PEALD). X‐ray photoelectron spectroscopy (XPS) analysis and scanning electron microscopy (SEM) with integrated energy‐dispersive X‐ray (EDX) elemental mapping confirmed homogeneous Zn distribution in all regimes, while AFM revealed a topographical transition from planarization in VPM (Rq = 5.6 nm) to high‐surface‐area nucleation in MPI (Rq = 123.9 nm). X‐ray diffraction (XRD) analysis demonstrated structural reconfiguration, with VPM reducing the hydrated phase crystallite size (7.4 to 4.6 nm) and MPI achieving the finest nanocrystallinity (1.83 nm). Notably, PEALD‐modified interfaces exhibited the highest interfacial ene","au":["Mabel Moreno","Anjana Devi","David Zanders","Miryam Arredondo","Davide Mariotti","Ruairi McGlynn"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积过程：用于工程 ZnO–壳聚糖生物界面的多功能平台","zb":"本研究探索了锌官能化的壳聚糖 (CS) 通过三种原子级技术（蒸汽相金属化 (VPM)、多次脉冲蒸汽相浸润 (MPI) 和 O2 放电增强原子层沉积 (PEALD)）工程生物多功能界面。X 射线光电子能谱 (XPS) 分析和集成的能量色散 X 射线 (EDX) 元素映射的扫描电子显微镜 (SEM) 确认了所有范围内 Zn 分布的均匀性，而原子力显微镜 (AFM) 揭示了从 VPM 中的平面化（Rq = 5.6 nm）到 MPI 中的高表面积成核（Rq = 123.9 nm）的形貌转变。X 射线衍射 (XRD) 分析表明结构重新配置，VPM 减少了水合相晶粒尺寸（7.4 到 4.6 nm），而 MPI 实现了最细的纳米晶粒度（1.83 nm）。值得注意的是，PEALD 改性的界面表现出最高的界面能（0.102 J/m 2 ）和增强的溶胀。物理化学表征表明，功能化方法决定了半导体特性，而生物实验","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzA3ODU2NTgzNA==&mid=2667030546&idx=1","t":"【动态】大连化物所揭示钾助剂在铁基合成氨催化剂中的活性氢新机制","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA3ODU2NTgzNA%3D%3D&mid=2667030546&idx=1","s":"中国科学院大连化物所","d":"2026-06-17","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:57Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"近日，大连化物所氢能与先进材料研究部氢化物能源化学研究中心（DNL1901组群）陈萍研究员、郭建平研究员团队与化学与精细化工广东省实验室王培坤副研究员团队在合成氨催化钾助剂作用机制研究中取得新进展。 近日，大连化物所氢能与先进材料研究部氢化物能源化学研究中心（DNL1901组群）陈萍研究员、郭建平研究员团队与化学与精细化工广东省实验室王培坤副研究员团队在合成氨催化钾助剂作用机制研究中取得新进展，揭示了氢化钾（KH）与氢氧化钾（KOH）中活性氢在铁基催化剂合成氨过程中的作用，为高效合成氨催化剂的理性设计提供了新思路。 钾是工业铁基合成氨催化剂中常用的助剂，其提升催化活性的现象已被发现逾百年，但钾在催化过程中的真实化学态与作用机理长期存在争议。传统观点多认为钾通过向铁提供电子促进氮气解离，而钾前驱体在反应条件下的存在形式、氢物种如何参与氮活化与氨生成等核心科学问题尚未清晰阐明。 针对上述问题，研究团队聚焦钾的不同化学态，系统对比研究了KH与KOH作为助剂时对碳纳米管负载铁催化剂（Fe/CNTs）合成氨性能的影响，从活性氢视角解析钾的促进机制。研究发现，KH与KOH 均可提升铁基催化剂的合成氨活性，但作用路径与效果存在差异。在 300℃、1MPa 条件下，KH体系活性较纯 Fe/CNTs 提升约两个数量级，是KOH体系的近6倍；其TOF约为 KOH 体系的3倍。机理研究表明，两种钾助剂中的氢均直接参与氨的生成：KH 中的负氢（H⁻）具有强还原性，可与铁氮化物发生氧化还原，生成KNH₂中间体并释放活性铁位点，后续经氢气氢化高效生成氨；KOH 中的质子氢（H⁺）则通过质子化表面吸附氮，经K‑Fe‑O与KNH₂中间体路径实现氨合成。同位素示踪实验直接证实，KH 与 KOH 中的晶格氢优先参与初始氨生成，不同于钾仅作为电子助剂的传统认知。 该工作明确了钾化合物中的活性氢是合成氨催化的关键参与者，为重新认识工业合成氨催化剂中碱金属助剂的作用提供了实验依据，也为温和条件下高效合成氨催化剂的设计开辟了新方向。 陈萍研究团队长期致力于氢化物催化研究，前期在温和条件下固氮方向取得系列进展（Na","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["NH3 synthesis"],"ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","wx":1},{"id":"10.3390/pr14121973","t":"Emerging and Conventional Pathways for Sustainable Ammonia Production: Technology Readiness, Economics, and Environmental Performance","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/pr14121973","s":"Processes","d":"2026-06-17","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia is an essential high-volume chemical for fertilizer production and other industrial applications, and it is increasingly considered a potential energy carrier; however, its conventional manufacture remains highly energy- and carbon-intensive because it relies predominantly on fossil-based Haber–Bosch (HB) synthesis. This review compares sustainable ammonia-production pathways through the linked dimensions of technology readiness, environmental performance, and economic plausibility across renewable-H2 HB, biomass- and waste-derived HB routes, electrochemical pathways, photocatalytic and photoelectrochemical systems, plasma-assisted synthesis, biological routes, and chemical looping ammonia synthesis. The analysis reveals a clear divide between pathways that benefit from established industrial infrastructure and those that still depend on unresolved catalytic, materials, or system","au":["Yasaman Amirhaeri","Hamed Hadavi","Ivan Kantor"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.jchemed.6c00111","t":"A Simplified Haber-Bosch Experiment for the Chemistry Laboratory: A Low-Cost Approach to Teaching Ammonia Synthesis and Green Hydrogen Concepts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jchemed.6c00111","s":"Journal of Chemical Education","d":"2026-06-17","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"High Resolution Image Download MS PowerPoint Slide Reducing greenhouse gas emissions is one of the major global challenges and involves rethinking established industrial processes. Ammonia synthesis using the Haber-Bosch process is fundamental to modern agriculture, but it is also one of the largest sources of CO 2 emissions. This is mainly due to one of the steps in the process in which hydrogen is obtained from fossil fuels. A promising alternative is to replace this step with the use of green hydrogen, obtained by water splitting with renewable energy sources. However, accessible experimental practices addressing this topic are still limited. Here, we describe a low-cost experiment in which students produce hydrogen by water splitting and use it, in combination with nitrogen, to simulate ammonia synthesis by a simplified Haber-Bosch process. This approach enables students to explore t","au":["Luís Gustavo Marcolan","Mariana B. Silva","Lillia I. L. M. Gama","Nayane B. A. da Silva","Juliano A. Bonacin"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"简化的哈伯-博施实验：低成本教学氨合成和绿色氢概念","zb":"研究对象为简化哈伯-博施实验，关键方法为学生通过水分解产生氢气，并与氮气结合模拟氨合成，实验在简单加热反应器中进行，产物用pH指示剂鉴定。实验旨在推广绿色氢作为可持续工业氢生产替代方案，并讨论热力学、化学平衡、动力学和催化等基本概念，以及与可持续性相关的当代问题，如绿色氢在减少氨生产碳足迹中的作用。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨"},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.6959998","t":"Inter-site distance in single-atom catalyst regulating C–N coupling for urea electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6959998","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-06-17","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The direct coupling of carbon dioxide and nitrates into urea powered by renewable electricity offers a promising alternative to the conventional Bosch-Meiser process, enabling integrated carbon reduction, energy storage, and high-value nitrates conversion. However, the intrinsically complex multi-step reaction pathways and kinetically demanding C–N bond formation result in limited urea activity and selectivity. Herein, we propose a distance-regulated cooperative C–N coupling strategy in urea electrosynthesis by tuning the inter-site spacing of atomically dispersed iron catalysts supported on carbon nitride (Fe1/C3N4). The interatomic distance of Fe/Fe sites is precisely controlled from 103.1 to 6.3 Å. Excessive separation (≥14.2 Å) impedes the second C–N coupling step, whereas overly short distances (≤1.8 Å) alter the adsorption of *CO and *NH from linear to bridged configurations, hinde","au":["Junrong Zou","Shaohua Cheng","Fangfang Wu","Fenglin Xie","Ruijie Zhou","Shuang Zhao"],"o":"回填","zt":"单原子催化剂中位点间距离调控尿素电合成中的 C-N 耦合","zb":"研究对象为单原子铁催化剂负载在碳氮材料上，关键方法为通过调节 Fe/Fe 位点间距离（103.1-6.3 Å）进行尿素电合成，并使用原位光谱和理论计算进行表征。研究发现 Fe/Fe 距离为 8.3 Å 时效率最佳，尿素产率速率为 46.1 mmol g-1 h-1，法拉第效率为 38.6%。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"10.1038/d41586-026-01914-w","t":"The Haber–Bosch fertilizer production process should be taught through a social-ecological lens","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/d41586-026-01914-w","s":"Nature","d":"2026-06-16","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":32,"ab":"","au":["Jianjun Wu"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"哈伯-博施肥料生产过程的社会生态学视角教学","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨","bt":1,"top":1},{"id":"10.1039/d6cc02017h","t":"Joule-heating synthesis of high-entropy oxides as efficient catalysts for electrochemical methanol oxidation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6cc02017h","s":"Chemical Communications","d":"2026-06-16","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"High-entropy oxide electrocatalysts synthesized via ultrafast Joule heating successfully replace the sluggish oxygen evolution reaction with efficient methanol oxidation, leveraging multi-metal synergies for energy-efficient biomass upgrading.","au":["Jiqiang Ding","Obeylaw Moyo","Kai Jia","Jiaqiao Yang","Zhiwei Wei","Mujia Sun"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule-heat"],"zt":"焦耳热合成高熵氧化物作为高效的电化学甲醇氧化催化剂","zb":"通过超快焦耳热合成的高熵氧化物电催化剂成功地用高效的甲醇氧化反应取代了缓慢的析氧反应，利用多金属协同作用进行能量高效的生物质升级。","ob":"其他催化反应｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.21203/rs.3.rs-10014372/v1","t":"Molybdenum-catalysed electrochemical green ammonia synthesis from dinitrogen and water","u":"https://doi.org/10.21203/rs.3.rs-10014372/v1","s":"Research Square","d":"2026-06-16","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia (NH3) synthesis is central to the chemical industry, but its production still depends on the energy-intensive Haber–Bosch process. Electrochemical reduction of dinitrogen (N2) offers a possible route to green ammonia synthesis under ambient conditions; however, most reported systems are limited to half-reactions coupled to sacrificial anodic processes. Here we report an electrocatalytic system based on a flow battery architecture that couples molybdenum complexes promoted catalytic NH3 synthesis from N2 at the cathode with anodic oxidation. This architecture enables the separate design of cathodic and anodic processes within a full electrochemical cell. Using alcohol oxidation at the anode, the system avoids the need for stoichiometric reductants and proton sources and enables catalytic NH3 formation in a stable full-reaction operation under ambient conditions. Under opt","au":["Yoshiaki Nishibayashi","Ryoichi Kanega","Kazuya Arashiba","Erika Ishida","Chieko Suzuki","Mika Kusaba"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"钼催化电化学绿色氨合成从氮气和水中","zb":"研究对象为基于流动电池架构的钼配合物催化体系，关键方法为将氮气在阴极进行氨合成与阳极氧化耦合，使用醇氧化避免牺牲阳极过程。在优化条件下，每摩尔钼原子可产生超过 100 当量氨，最高法拉第效率为 63%。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"10.1039/d6cc01564f","t":"A Co–peptoid electrocatalyst for nitrite reduction that enables selective production of ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6cc01564f","s":"Chemical Communications","d":"2026-06-16","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"An intramolecular bio-inspired Co( iii ) peptoid complex acts as a stable and efficient molecular electrocatalyst for selective nitrite reduction to ammonia in neutral phosphate buffer, with a Faradaic efficiency of 90%.","au":["Suraj Pahar","Galia Maayan"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrite reduction"],"zt":"一种 Co-肽段电催化剂用于亚硝酸还原选择性生产氨","zb":"研究对象为 Co( iii ) 肽段配合物，关键方法为在中性磷酸缓冲液中用于亚硝酸还原为氨，法拉第效率为 90%。","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.6c03459","t":"Photoelectrocatalytic NO x Reduction to Ammonia: Advances and Challenges","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c03459","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2026-06-16","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Ammonia (NH3) is an essential chemical for agriculture and an emerging carbon-free energy carrier, yet its conventional Haber-Bosch synthesis remains energy-intensive and carbon-emissive. Photoelectrochemical (PEC) NOx reduction (NOxRR), encompassing the conversion of nitrate (NO3-), nitrite (NO2-), and related NOx species (NO, N2O, etc.), offers a sustainable alternative by coupling solar energy conversion with the valorization of nitrogenous pollutants into NH3 under ambient conditions. This topical review summarizes recent progress in PEC NOxRR, with particular emphasis on interfacial engineering strategies for photocathode design and mechanistic insights into multielectron, proton-coupled reduction pathways. We first outline the fundamental electrochemical and photophysical principles governing NOxRR, highlighting key challenges such as sluggish kinetics, intermediate control, and co","au":["Laura Collado","Víctor A. de la Peña O’Shea","Miguel García-Tecedor"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"光电催化 NOx 还原为氨：进展与挑战","zb":"研究对象为光电催化 NOx 还原为氨，关键方法为综述光电阴极设计中的界面工程策略和机理研究，包括铜基氧化物、铋钒酸盐和缺陷工程二氧化钛等材料。讨论了纯光电化学配置和光伏-电化学耦合系统，以及面临的挑战如光腐蚀和产物定量。","ob":"光催化硝酸盐转化｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.6c01546","t":"Ammonia Synthesis by a Supported Iron-Lithium Hydride Precatalyst: Silicon Nitride Support Enabled Synthesis and Nitrogen Reservoir Dynamics","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.6c01546","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2026-06-15","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":32,"ab":"Amorphous silicon nitride (Si 3 N 4 ) is an unconventional support for the chemisorption of organometallic complexes and offers potential improvements in active site stability and reactivity through enhanced metal-nitrogen covalency and orbital overlap in bonding interactions with the nitride framework. In this study, we show that silicon nitride-supported iron mesityl complexes display divergent reactivity compared to their silica-supported homologues, resisting metallic particle formation under reducing pretreatment conditions (exposure to excess organolithium reagents) and maintaining active iron/lithium speciation under ammonia synthesis conditions that is absent on the oxide support. When the organometallic iron complex on silicon nitride is exposed to excess n -butyllithium, iron remains isolated, catalyzing the conversion of butyllithium to lithium hydride, resulting in a divalent","au":["Kaixi Deng","Meaghan A. Bruening","Jacklyn N. Hall","Andrew B. Norris","Fulya Dogan","Benjamin E. R. Snyder"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"负载 Fe-LiH 前驱体的氨合成：氮化硅载体促进合成与氮气储层动力学","zb":"在氮化硅支撑下，铁-锂氢化物前驱体在 300–400 °C 和 10 bar 下表现出高活性，产率可达 46 mol NH3/mol Fe/h。X 射线吸收光谱研究了催化剂活化及 LiH/LiNHx 氮库动力学。","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系","top":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.6945723","t":"Phase evolution and nucleation control of continuous and ultrathin ruthenium films via oxidant-controlled atomic layer deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6945723","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-06-15","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Ru is a promising material for ultrathin interconnects and capacitor electrodes. However, achieving ultrathin, continuous metallic films with minimal surface roughness remains challenging in atomic layer deposition (ALD) due to nucleation limitations on dielectric surfaces. In this study, we demonstrate an ALD process for Ru films using a tricarbonyl(trimethylenemethane)ruthenium [Ru(TMM)(CO)3] precursor and O3. The O3-based process at 220 °C exhibits a high growth per cycle of 0.17 nm/cycle with a negligible incubation period on SiO2. In particular, electrical continuity is achieved even at sub-nanometer thicknesses, indicating a high nucleation density and effective suppression of island coalescence. This leads to ultra-smooth surface morphology even as the film scales toward practical thicknesses. Furthermore, we identify that phase evolution is critically governed by the instantaneou","au":["Minseok Kim","Taehwan Lee","Seungwan Ye","Sung-Chul Kim","Sung Ok Won","Ryosuke Harada"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"连续和超薄钌膜的相演变与成核控制：通过氧化剂控制的原子层沉积","zb":"Ru 是一种很有前景的超薄互连和电容器电极材料。然而，由于介电表面上的成核限制，在原子层沉积 (ALD) 中实现超薄、连续的金属膜且表面粗糙度最小仍然具有挑战性。本研究展示了使用 [Ru(TMM)(CO)3] 前驱体和 O3 进行的 Ru 膜的 ALD 过程。基于 O3 的工艺在 220 °C 下表现出 0.17 nm/周期的生长速率，在 SiO2 上的潜伏期可以忽略不计。特别是，即使在亚纳米厚度下也实现了电连续性，表明成核密度高且有效地抑制了岛状物融合。这导致即使在膜扩展到实际厚度时也具有超光滑的表面形貌。此外，研究发现相演变受瞬时 O3 分压的关键控制。高 O3 分压抑制与 RuO4 等挥发性物种形成相关的膜生长，而中等通量下的延长脉冲持续时间促进逐步氧化形成 RuO2。这些发现表明，相演变不仅受总氧化剂剂量控制，还受氧化剂供应条件控制，为控制基于 Ru 的 ALD 中的成核、表面形貌","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及Ru/钌体系、原子层沉积","pre":1},{"id":"10.1038/s41467-026-74205-7","t":"Active nitrogen mediated selective ruthenium migration on ceria for high pressure ammonia decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-026-74205-7","s":"Nature Communications","d":"2026-06-15","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Precise stabilization of atomic structures under reaction environments remains a central challenge in heterogeneous catalysis. Here, we demonstrate that ammonia (NH 3 ) serves as a chemically active nitrogen source to derive the selective migration of ruthenium (Ru) atoms onto ceria (CeO 2 ) domains, forming a durable atomically dispersed structure. During ammonia decomposition, nitrogen-containing intermediates promote atomic redistribution of Ru and anchor the atoms selectively at CeO 2 , yielding stable Ru-ceria interfaces. The resulting catalyst exhibits high activity in high-pressure ammonia decomposition for hydrogen production, attributed to its lowered activation energy and mitigated hydrogen poisoning. Furthermore, both the catalytic performance and the atomic Ru structure are preserved during long-term high-pressure operation, confirming the exceptional structural stab","au":["Gunjoo Kim","Gahong Kim","Hyunsik Hwang","Eunseong Yoo","Jae-eon Hwang","Jae Won Lee"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"活性氮介导的二氧化铈上钌迁移实现高压氨分解","zb":"研究对象为高压氨分解反应，关键方法为利用氨（NH3）作为化学活性氮源，通过活性氮介导的钌（Ru）原子迁移至二氧化铈（CeO2）表面，形成稳定的单原子分散结构。研究发现氮中间体促进 Ru 原子重新分布并锚定在 CeO2 上，形成稳定的 Ru-二氧化铈界面。该催化剂在高压氨分解中表现出高活性，归因于降低的活化能和减轻的氢中毒。长期高压操作下催化性能和 Ru 原子结构保持稳定，证实了设计的结构稳定性。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系","top":1},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv.15004730/v1","t":"Technoeconomic and Geospatial Analysis of Biogas Utilization for Enhancing Ammonia Production Competitiveness of the United States","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv.15004730/v1","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2026-06-15","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The US ammonia industry faces vulnerabilities, including volatility in the prices of natural gas – the primary feedstock for ammonia – and geopolitical risks, given that the US is a net importer of ammonia. This paper presents detailed studies on the prospect of partially offsetting these risks by boosting local ammonia production from waste-derived biogas, such as landfill gas and agricultural waste. Rigorous process design in Aspen Plus and technoeconomic evaluation were used to contrast emerging technologies (autothermal reforming, catalytic partial oxidation, methane pyrolysis, chemical looping) with the conventional technology, steam methane reforming (SMR), for hydrogen generation to produce biogas-derived ammonia. The results show that the energy efficiency of producing ammonia from biogas feed ranges from 33.6 to 67.7% on a methane basis, encompassing the reported value for natur","au":["Damian T Agi","Ikenna J Okeke","Alexander W Dowling","Sachin U Nimbalkar"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Production"],"zt":"生物天然气利用的技术经济与地理空间分析，提升美国氨生产竞争力","zb":"研究对象为美国氨工业，关键方法为通过 Aspen Plus 软件进行工艺设计和技术经济评估，对比生物天然气（如垃圾填埋气和农业废弃物）与传统蒸汽甲烷重整（SMR）制备氨的技术路径。结果显示生物天然气制氨能量效率为 33.6-67.7%（甲烷基准），低于天然气基准（57%）。生产成本差异显著，原料成本和资本投资分别占 40%+ 和 22%。生物天然气 SMR 显示最低的最低氨售价（MASP，$510 t⋅NH3-1），化学链重整次之（$568 t⋅NH3-1）。德克萨斯州 MASP 最低，加利福尼亚州受电价影响显著。","ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨；涉及碳材料","pre":1},{"id":"10.1021/acssuschemeng.6c03768","t":"Histidine-Stabilized Cobalt Nanoparticles on Silica for Efficient Ammonia Cracking","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssuschemeng.6c03768","s":"ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering","d":"2026-06-15","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia cracking is a key reaction for hydrogen storage and release, offering a promising route toward a hydrogen economy. Herein, a robust silica-supported cobalt (Co) catalyst is developed using a histidine-assisted dispersion strategy to mitigate sintering. Histidine (His), a naturally occurring amino acid, is codissolved with the Co(II) precursor to produce uniformly dispersed Co nanoparticles on silica via incipient wetness impregnation (2, 6, and 10 wt %). The resulting particles exhibit sizes of ∼2−3 nm, significantly smaller than those prepared without histidine. Thermogravimetric analysis confirms complete removal of histidine after treatment at 250 °C for 48 h. Synchrotron powder X-ray diffraction reveals that the histidine-assisted method suppresses Co3O4 formation, favoring smaller CoO species during the initial synthesis stage. H2 temperature-programmed reduction co","au":["Harry Cahyanto","Hernan G. Mazzei","Angie F. J. Tan","Qinfen Gu","Laura Torrente-Murciano","Alex C. K. Yip"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Cracking"],"zt":"组氨酸稳定二氧化硅负载钴纳米颗粒用于高效氨分解","zb":"研究对象为氨分解反应，关键方法为采用组氨酸辅助分散策略制备二氧化硅负载钴（Co）催化剂，通过浸渍法将 Co(II) 前驱体与组氨酸共溶解，制备粒径约 2-3 nm 的 Co 纳米颗粒。该方法抑制 Co3O4 形成，促进 CoO 物种生成。10 wt% Co-His/SiO2 催化剂在 500 °C 下氨分解活性优于未使用组氨酸的样品，氨转化率达 30.5% 对比 13.5%。该研究证实组氨酸可作为生物可降解配体制备抗烧结的负载金属催化剂，在可持续反应中保持催化活性。","ob":"氨分解制氢｜表征温程（TPR/TPD/TPO 等，不等于反应供热）"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.74219","t":"Spatial Proximity in Single Atomic Co Sites Boosts Water‐Derived Active Hydrogen for Efficient Neutral Nitrate‐to‐Ammonia Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.74219","s":"Small","d":"2026-06-15","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT Single‐atom catalysts (SACs) are promising for nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) to ammonia (NH 3 ), given their high atomic efficiency and tunable, well‐defined structures. Yet, interactions between proximate atomic sites in NO 3 RR are poorly understood. Here, we demonstrate the spatial proximity effect over N, P coordinated Co single atomic centers to boost NO 3 RR catalytic activity. The adjacent configuration with CoN 4 ‐P‐CoN 4 atomic structures of the closest inter‐site distance of ∼4.5 Å balance the water dissociation and NO 3 RR via a dual‐driven cascade mechanism in a neutral electrolyte. P site located at the shared second coordination shell dissociates water molecules to supply ample *H for the following hydrogenation process, while Co single site with optimized electronic state adsorbs and converts NO 3 − to NH 3 . This study underscores the critical role of spat","au":["Xin Wang","Ying Chen","Panjie Guo","Yun Han","Boyu Huang","Kang Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"空间邻近性增强单原子 Co 位点水衍生活性氢，促进高效中性硝酸盐至氨电合成","zb":"研究对象为硝酸盐还原反应（NO3RR）至氨（NH3）的单原子催化剂（SACs），关键方法为制备具有 N、P 配位的 Co 单原子中心，通过空间邻近效应提升催化活性。研究发现 CoN4-P-CoN4 原子结构（最近原子间距离约 4.5 Å）在中性电解质中平衡水裂解和 NO3RR，通过双驱动级联机制促进反应。P 位点位于共享的第二配位层，裂解水分子提供充足的 *H，Co 单位点优化电子状态吸附并转化 NO3- 至 NH3。该研究强调空间邻近性在 SACs 中对 NO3RR 的关键作用，并可能扩展至其他电化学转化。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/cptc.70198","t":"Synthesis of Zinc Germanium Oxynitride Photocatalysts Using Solid Nitrogen Sources","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cptc.70198","s":"ChemPhotoChem","d":"2026-06-15","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"ZnGeN 2 :ZnO, a solid solution of ZnGeN 2 and ZnO, functions as a photocatalyst active for overall water splitting under visible light. The absorption edge wavelength of ZnGeN 2 :ZnO shifts toward longer wavelength with increasing ZnO content. However, the conventional synthesis by nitridation under an NH 3 flow causes the reduction and volatilization of Zn species, which inherently restricts the maximum absorption edge wavelength to 460 nm. In this study, ZnGeN 2 :ZnO with a ZnO content of 66 mol% and an absorption edge of around 540 nm was synthesized using Zn 3 N 2 as a solid nitrogen source in a sealed evacuated tube. The obtained ZnGeN 2 :ZnO, when loaded with hydrogen and oxygen evolution cocatalysts, exhibited activity for overall water splitting under visible light irradiation. The photocatalytic activity was enhanced by post‐nitridation treatment. This work demonstrates a novel ","au":["Shintaro Abe","Natsutogi Iwasa","Takashi Hisatomi","Kazunari Domen"],"o":"回填","zt":"使用固体氮源合成锌锗氮氧化物光催化剂","zb":"研究对象为 ZnGeN 2 :ZnO 固溶体，关键方法为使用 Zn 3 N 2 作为固体氮源在真空密封管中合成，获得 ZnO 含量为 66 mol%、吸收边长波移至 540 nm 的材料。负载析氢和析氧助催化剂后，在可见光下表现出整体水分解活性，通过后氮化处理可进一步提高活性。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1002/cnl2.70181","t":"Deciphering Catalytic Reaction Mechanisms for Low‐Temperature Ammonia Synthesis: Mechanism‐Guided Rational Design of Active Sites","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cnl2.70181","s":"Carbon Neutralization","d":"2026-06-14","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"ABSTRACT Ammonia serves as a dual‐purpose nitrogen and hydrogen carrier, essential for global food security and the ongoing renewable energy transition. The century‐old industrial Haber‐Bosch process, however, is limited by considerable energy consumption and massive carbon emissions, necessitating efficient catalysts for low‐temperature ammonia synthesis. Despite recent progress in diverse catalytic systems, including electrides, nitrides, hydrides, and engineered transition‐metal sites, differences in active‐site architecture give rise to distinct reaction routes, and a unified mechanistic framework remains absent. This review systematically summarizes recently developed catalytic systems based on a mechanism‐driven classification covering dissociative, hydrogen‐assisted, and associative routes, with emphasis on structure–activity relationships and mechanistic insights revealed through","au":["Jinshu Tian","Yukun Bai","Chi Wang","Tao Jin","Bing Lu","Yongpeng Ren"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"低温合成氨催化反应机理解析：机理导向的活性位点理性设计","zb":"综述了基于机理分类（解离、氢辅助、缔合路径）的各类催化体系，总结了结构-活性关系及先进表征揭示的机理洞察，为下一代合成氨催化剂的理性设计提供了战略原则。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.jpcc.6c02324","t":"Stabilizing Monoclinic CuWO 4 by Zn Substitution and Oxygen Vacancies for Boosted Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpcc.6c02324","s":"The Journal of Physical Chemistry C","d":"2026-06-13","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia (NO 3 RR) offers a promising route to couple nitrate remediation with sustainable NH 3 production, but practical implementation remains limited by sluggish charge transfer, parasitic hydrogen evolution, and insufficient catalyst durability. Here, we report a phase/defect codesign strategy in which Zn substitution stabilizes the monoclinic CuWO 4 framework while simultaneously enriching oxygen vacancies, creating a vacancy-rich and structurally robust heterometal oxide catalyst for efficient NO 3 RR. This dual-control approach differs fundamentally from doping-only or defect-only strategies because it not only tunes the local electronic structure and intermediate binding, but also preserves the catalytically favorable framework under prolonged electrolysis. The optimized Zn 1.0 -CuWO 4 -140 delivers an NH 3 yield of 51.8 mg h –1 mg cat –1 with","au":["Rong Guo","Hui Su","Youdong Le","Weize Chen","Jing Tang","Yi Li"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"通过 Zn 替代和氧空位稳定单斜 CuWO4 用于增强硝酸盐至氨还原","zb":"研究对象为硝酸盐还原反应（NO3RR），关键方法为通过 Zn 替代和氧空位设计策略制备单斜 CuWO4 催化剂，形成富含氧空位且结构稳定的异金属氧化物。该方法不仅调节局部电子结构和中间体结合能，还保持催化有利框架。优化后的 Zn1.0-CuWO4-140 在 -1.3 V vs RHE 下氨产率为 51.8 mg h-1 mg cat-1，法拉第效率（FE）为 84.2%，60 小时内保持稳定性能和单斜相。DFT 计算显示 Zn 替代降低关键氢化步骤的能量需求，并动力学上有利于 *H 加氢而非 *N/N2 形成。该研究提出相/缺陷协同设计策略，适用于 NO3RR 等多步电催化反应。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acssuschemeng.6c02576","t":"Joule-Heated Ag Nanoparticle Functionalization of Lignin-Derived Carbon Fibers Enables Uniform Sodium Deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssuschemeng.6c02576","s":"ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering","d":"2026-06-12","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract Sodium metal anodes promise high theoretical capacity (1166 mA h g−1) and a low redox potential, yet practical use is limited by poor coulombic efficiency and dendrite-induced safety risks. Herein, we engineer a silver-nanoparticle-decorated, lignin-derived carbon fiber host (Ag@LCF) via ultrafast Joule heating (≤1s, &gt;1500 °C), which deepens graphitic ordering of the carbon matrix (IG/ID = 0.815) and uniformly seeds sodiophilic Ag sites. The Ag nanoparticles play a dual role: they catalyze Na nucleation and furnish a percolated conductive network that lowers interfacial impedance. Density-functional theory reveals that Ag@LCF enables thermodynamically stable Na adsorption (down to –1.73 eV) with a minimized energy gap between dendritic and planar growth pathways (0.27 eV). This is attributed to Ag-C orbital hybridization, which modulates the local electronic environment, ensu","au":["Guosheng Jia","Hengxue Xiang","Haoxuan Liu","Xue Li","Jingwei Xue","Fulei Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule-Heat"],"zt":"焦耳加热 Ag 纳米粒子功能化的木质素衍生碳纤维实现均匀钠沉积","zb":"钠金属负极具有高理论容量 (1166 mA h g−1) 和低氧化还原电位，但实际应用受库仑效率和枝晶引起的安全生产风险限制。本研究通过超快焦耳加热 (≤1s, &gt;1500 °C) 设计了装饰有银纳米粒子的木质素衍生碳纤维载体 (Ag@LCF)，深化了碳基质中的石墨化程度 (IG/ID = 0.815)，并均匀种下了亲钠 Ag 位点。Ag 纳米粒子起双重作用：它们催化 Na 成核，并提供降低界面阻抗的渗透导电网络。密度泛函理论揭示 Ag@LCF 实现了热力学稳定的 Na 吸附 (低至 –1.73 eV)，并最小化了枝晶和平面生长路径之间的能隙 (0.27 eV)。这归因于 Ag-C 轨道杂化，它调节了局部电子环境，确保了适度的电荷转移和稳定结合 (ICOHP = 0.877 eV)，从而消除了形成枝晶的电子驱动力。这导致了无枝晶的钠沉积、长循环寿命 (对称电池 &gt;250 h，全","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热"},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.6926205","t":"Rapid and green recovery of iron resources from red mud based on flash joule heating: Stepwise phase evolution and magnetic separation","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6926205","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-06-12","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Red mud (RM), a hazardous byproduct of alumina production, constitutes a vast stockpile of underutilized secondary resources that are notably rich in iron. Nevertheless, conventional methods for iron recovery from RM are often constrained by high energy consumption and the risk of secondary pollution. This study introduces a flash Joule heating (FJH) technology to rapidly transform the weakly magnetic Fe2O3 in RM into strongly magnetic iron concentrate, enabling efficient magnetic separation. The results demonstrate that the FJH technology can rapidly transform weakly magnetic Fe2O3 into strongly magnetic iron concentrates from RM. Physicochemical tracking reveals a rapid stepwise reduction sequence Fe2O3→Fe3O4→FeO→Fe and Fe3C driven by the electrothermal shock. These strong magnetic minerals contribute to the separation of iron resources. Furthermore, it was determined that enhancing th","au":["Bin Wang","Lei Guo","Yinbo Zhang","Rui He"],"o":"回填","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"基于闪蒸焦耳热快速绿色回收红泥中铁资源：逐步相变与磁分离","zb":"研究对象为红泥（RM）中铁资源回收，关键方法为采用闪蒸焦耳热（FJH）技术，将 RM 中弱磁性的 Fe2O3 快速转化为强磁性铁精矿，实现高效磁分离。研究发现 FJH 技术通过电热冲击驱动 Fe2O3→Fe3O4→FeO→Fe 及 Fe3C 的逐步还原，形成强磁性矿物。增强放电电压和频率可显著提高铁精矿回收率和品位，铁含量和回收率最高达 81.35% 和 83.32%。该方法提供低能耗、低环境污染的红泥高纯度铁回收路径，促进铝业循环低碳发展。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Fe/铁体系｜焦耳热用于制备","pre":1},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.6c07459","t":"A High-Performance Bimetallic Ru 1 Mo 6 Active Site for Thermal Ammonia Synthesis under Mild Conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c07459","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2026-06-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":40,"ab":"Ammonia (NH3) synthesis is among the greatest discoveries in human history. While dinitrogen (N2) is converted in nature under ambient conditions to NH3 through an associative mechanism at the FeMoco active site of nitrogenase, the industrialized Haber-Bosch process involves an N2 dissociative mechanism on the C7 site of iron or the B5 site of ruthenium, which requires harsh conditions of high temperatures (430-500 °C) and high pressures (10-30 MPa). Here, we report a new active site of Ru1Mo6 bimetallic single-cluster anchored on Mo2CTx MXene for efficient NH3 synthesis. This highly stable catalyst can achieve N2-to-NH3 thermal synthesis under mild conditions (T = 50 °C and P = 0.1 MPa). An exceptionally high NH3 production rate of 3230 mmol gRu-1 h-1 with >1000 h of long-term stability has been achieved at 400 °C and 1 MPa, which is roughly three times higher than those of highly dispe","au":["Yanliang Zhou","Cong Zhang","Kailin Su","Jin-Xia Liang","Congying Wang","Tianhua Zhang"],"o":"回填","w":["Lilong Jiang"],"why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"温和条件下热合成氨的高性能双金属 Ru1Mo6 活性位点","zb":"报道了锚定在 Mo2CTx MXene 上的 Ru1Mo6 双金属单团簇活性位点。该催化剂在 400 °C 和 1 MPa 下表现出 3230 mmol gRu-1 h-1 的极高产氨率及 >1000 h 的长期稳定性，比分散 Ru 催化剂高出约三倍。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/anie.7866851","t":"Ammonia‐Resistant Carbon‐Encapsulated Cobalt Catalyst for Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Volatile Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.7866851","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2026-06-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"ABSTRACT Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia presents a promising route for sustainable nitrogen utilization; however, current efforts remain largely confined to optimizing synthesis efficiency, with insufficient attention paid to the concurrent challenge of ammonia separation—a key bottleneck for scalable deployment. Here, we report carbon‐shell‐encapsulated cobalt nanoparticles (Co@C), which uniquely enable integrated ammonia synthesis and in situ gas‐phase purification under strongly alkaline conditions. In both sequencing batch and continuous‐flow electrolyzers, Co@C delivers a robust nitrate‐to‐ammonia Faradaic efficiency of 92.4%, maintaining performance even in the presence of exogenous ammonia. Critically, the high‐pH environment shifts the NH 3 /NH 4 + equilibrium toward volatile NH 3 , enabling spontaneous volatilization and direct gaseous collection. Combined experim","au":["Jingwen Ba","Ali Luo","Tingting Lian","Guoyu Hou","Yu Zhang","Wensheng Yang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"抗氨碳包覆钴催化剂用于电催化硝酸盐还原到挥发性氨","zb":"研究对象为碳壳包覆的钴纳米颗粒（Co@C）用于电催化硝酸盐还原到氨，关键方法为碳壳包覆和强碱性条件下的氨气分离，主要结果为在序批式和连续流电解槽中，Co@C 的硝酸盐到氨的法拉第效率为 92.4%，碳壳物理抑制钴浸出并电子调节表面吸附以减弱氨结合和加速解吸。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.3390/cleantechnol8030092","t":"Predictive Gate-to-Gate Life Cycle Assessment of an Early-Stage Plasma-Based Ammonia Synthesis Technology","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/cleantechnol8030092","s":"Clean Technologies","d":"2026-06-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"A predictive gate-to-gate life cycle assessment (LCA) of plasma-assisted ammonia synthesis at TRL 4 is presented according to ISO 14040/44 standards. General plasma-assisted synthesis was evaluated through a mini-review‚ sensitivity analysis‚ and predictive LCA. The specific DBD needle-to-plate configuration LCA is performed using previously published experimental data. Two distinct scenarios were investigated. In the literature-based baseline scenario derived from sensitivity analysis, electricity consumption was 533 kWh/kg NH3, giving a carbon footprint of 26.65–639.60 kg CO2-eq/kg NH3; electricity contributed 98.5% of total emissions, and impacts remained about 2.05 times higher than conventional Haber–Bosch. In contrast, the experimental DBD case study required 63,450 kWh/kg NH3, showing reactor efficiency as the dominant driver of environmental performance. The BCS (≈1.39 kWh/kg NH3","au":["Novita Wiwoho","Doonyapong Wongsawaeng","Phannee Saengkaew","Phachirarat Sola","Deni Swantomo"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"早期阶段等离子体辅助氨合成技术的端到端生命周期评估","zb":"研究对象为 TRL 4 等离子体辅助氨合成技术，关键方法为根据 ISO 14040/44 标准进行预测端到端生命周期评估，主要结果为文献基准情景下，氨合成电耗为 533 kWh/kg NH3，碳足迹为 26.65–639.60 kg CO2-eq/kg NH3，实验 DBD 案例电耗为 63,450 kWh/kg NH3，优化等离子体系统可能超越传统哈伯-博施工艺。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.1007/s11581-026-07257-w","t":"Hierarchical porous carbon confined Cr2ZnS4 nanosheets as an efficient electrocatalyst for electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11581-026-07257-w","s":"Ionics","d":"2026-06-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yan Ling","Jing Wang","Yihao Yuan","Lin Ma","Xian Wang","Jinyi Sun"],"o":"回填","why":["electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction"],"zt":"分级多孔碳限域的 Cr2ZnS4 纳米片作为高效的电催化剂用于电催化氮还原","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/adsc.70580","t":"Rational Design of Cu‐Based Catalysts for Nitrate to Ammonia Electroreduction: A Structure–Limitation–Strategy Perspective","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adsc.70580","s":"Advanced Synthesis & Catalysis","d":"2026-06-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Cu‐based catalysts have emerged as promising candidates for electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (eNO 3 RR), offering an energy‐efficient alternative to the Haber–Bosch process while enabling the remediation of nitrate‐containing wastewater. However, eNO 3 RR on Cu remains limited by coupled thermodynamic and kinetic challenges, including scaling‐constrained intermediate adsorption, insufficient control over hydrogen supply and selectivity, and increasingly severe interfacial bottlenecks under high‐current‐density operation. Rational catalyst design is therefore required to address distinct but coupled limitations, including nitrate activation, intermediate hydrogenation, hydrogen availability, HER competition, and interfacial mass/charge transport. In this work, we summarize the mechanistic basis of Cu‐based eNO 3 RR and discuss how multiscale structural strategies alleviate thes","au":["Yiping Wu","Xuefei Lei","Rui Guo","Xuanwen Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"基于 Cu 的催化剂用于硝酸盐到氨的电还原：基于结构-限制-策略的视角","zb":"研究对象为电催化硝酸盐还原反应（eNO3RR）的 Cu 基催化剂，关键方法为结构-限制-策略分析，主要结果为通过多尺度结构策略缓解 eNO3RR 的瓶颈，包括硝酸盐活化、中间体加氢、氢气供应、HER 竞争和界面质量/电荷传输。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3390/en19122807","t":"Optimal Scheduling of Weak-Grid Green Ammonia Systems Based on ALK–PEM Electrolyzer Coordination","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/en19122807","s":"Energies","d":"2026-06-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Green ammonia systems provide an important pathway for converting fluctuating renewable electricity into transportable chemical products. To address the coupled challenges of renewable power variability, heterogeneous electrolyzer dynamics, hydrogen storage constraints, and continuous ammonia synthesis under weak-grid conditions, this paper develops a mixed-integer linear programming scheduling model considering the coordination and start–stop characteristics of ALK–PEM hybrid electrolyzers. The model uses a 15 min resolution over a two-day horizon and integrates renewable power supply, grid electricity purchase, electrolysis, hydrogen storage, and flexible ammonia synthesis in a unified framework. The off, hot-standby, and running states of ALK and PEM electrolyzers are explicitly represented. The case results show that, under the high-renewable-resource scenario, ammonia production rea","au":["Limin Cheng","Xu Ji"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"基于 ALK-PEM 电解槽协调的最优调度弱电网绿色氨系统","zb":"研究对象为 ALK-PEM 混合电解槽协调的弱电网绿色氨系统，关键方法为开发考虑协调和启停特性的混合整数线性规划调度模型，主要结果为高可再生能源情景下，氨产量达 494.93 t，弃电率为 3.23%，电网电力份额为 0.68%，低可再生能源情景下，氨产量降至 180.09 t，电网电力份额增至 40%。"},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzkzOTY5OTE0NA==&mid=2247485848&idx=1","t":"【科研动态】Chem：化学电离质谱“在线追踪”常温常压合成氨反应","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkzOTY5OTE0NA%3D%3D&mid=2247485848&idx=1","s":"大连化物所质谱研发中心","d":"2026-06-10","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:57Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"2021年，与陈萍研究员团队合作，在《Nature Catalysis》上发表三元钌配合氢化物催化合成氨的研究（Wang et al.， Nat. Catal. 2021， 4， 959–967），再次采用CTI-TOFMS实现了低至50°C下约2 ppm出口氨浓度的准确定量。","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["合成氨"],"ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系","wx":1},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv.15004581/v1","t":"Theoretical Insights into the Influence of Surface Charge Modulation on the Intrinsic Reactivity for Ruthenium-Catalyzed Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv.15004581/v1","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2026-06-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Ammonia is a foundational molecule important for manufacturing fertilizers, chemicals, and fuels. Its rates of synthesis and decomposition, however, are limited by the considerable barriers to activate the strong N2 bond and break the strong NHx-metal surface bonds. As a result, the maximum rates for these systems require an optimal balance of bonding to the catalyst surface which is controlled by the catalyst that is used. Dynamic modulation of the electronic structure of the catalyst under operating conditions offers a unique way to tune the reactivity without changing the metal catalyst or altering its composition. Catalytic condensers that use an electronic gating mechanism to control the charge have recently demonstrated the ability to rapidly alter the charge of supported catalytic particles between -0.17 |e-|/metal atom to +0.17 |e-|/metal atom and potentially control the kinetics","au":["Ulrick R. Gaillard","Rajat Daga","Rachel B. Getman","Lars C. Grabow","Matthew Neurock"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"表面电荷调制对钌催化氨合成本征反应性的理论洞察","zb":"基于DFT计算，研究了表面电荷在-0.17到+0.17 |e-|/金属原子范围内振荡对Ru(0001)表面氨合成关键步骤吸附能、反应能和活化能的影响。结果表明，表面带电显著改变了NHx中间体与金属表面的键合强度，正电荷显著增强了NH、NH2和NH3的吸附，且吸附增强程度随氮原子上的质子数增加而增加。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨；涉及Ru/钌体系","pre":1},{"id":"10.31603/mesi.14658","t":"<b>Flash joule heating synthesis of porous graphene oxide from banana leaf waste for high-performance supercapacitor electrodes<\/b>","u":"https://doi.org/10.31603/mesi.14658","s":"Mechanical Engineering for Society and Industry","d":"2026-06-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"This study investigates the synthesis of porous graphene oxide (GO) derived from banana leaf waste using the Flash Joule Heating (FJH) method for supercapacitor electrode applications. Carbonization was conducted at input voltages of 5, 10, and 15 VA for 2 s, followed by activation with 0.3 M KOH. Structural characterization (SEM, EDX, FTIR, and XRD) confirmed the formation of hierarchical porous carbon with oxygen-containing functional groups. Electrochemical evaluation revealed that the sample synthesized at 10 VA exhibited the best performance, achieving a specific capacitance of 345 F g⁻¹, low internal resistance of 0.65 Ω, and capacitance retention of 95% after 500 cycles. In contrast, the 5 VA sample showed lower conductivity due to its amorphous structure, while the 15 VA sample exhibited reduced capacitance due to excessive macropore formation. These results demonstrate that cont","au":["Ikhwanul Qiram","Dewi Sartika","Wisnu Kuncoro","Willy Satrio Nugroho","Abdul Mudjib Sulaiman Wahid"],"o":"回填","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"闪光焦耳加热合成香蕉叶废弃物中的多孔氧化石墨烯用于高性能超级电容器电极","zb":"本研究调查了使用闪光焦耳加热 (FJH) 方法从香蕉叶废弃物中合成的多孔氧化石墨烯 (GO) 用于超级电容器电极应用。在输入电压 5、10 和 15 VA 下进行 2 s 的碳化，然后用 0.3 M KOH 进行活化。结构表征 (SEM、EDX、FTIR 和 XRD) 确认形成了分级多孔碳，具有含氧官能团。电化学评估表明，在 10 VA 下合成的样品表现出最佳性能，实现了 345 F g⁻¹ 的比电容、0.65 Ω 的低内阻和 500 次循环后的 95% 电容保持率。相比之下，5 VA 样品由于其非晶结构表现出较低的导电性，而 15 VA 样品由于其过多的宏观孔形成而表现出降低的电容。这些结果表明，控制的 FJH 电压在优化孔结构和电化学性能方面起着关键作用，突出了香蕉叶衍生的 GO 作为高性能超级电容器电极材料的潜力。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.1039/d6ta02240e","t":"Enhancing ammonia decomposition in a LaCeO x /Ni inverse catalyst by tuning lattice strain and oxygen vacancies","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ta02240e","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2026-06-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:23:23Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This study successfully prepared a novel LaCeO x /Ni catalyst with an inverse structure using a stepwise precipitation method.","au":["Junjie Lu","Lu Cheng","Jingchong Yan","Weidong Zhang","Zhiping Lei","Zhanku Li"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"通过调节晶格应变和氧空位增强 LaCeO x /Ni 逆催化剂中的氨分解","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.1021/acsnano.6c05545","t":"Mechanoluminescence-Enhanced Ammonia Synthesis via Mechanochemical Nitrate Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsnano.6c05545","s":"ACS Nano","d":"2026-06-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The Haber–Bosch process remains the dominant method for ammonia (NH3) synthesis, but it is highly energy-intensive and environmentally burdensome. Nitrate reduction to ammonia (NRA) presents a promising dual-function alternative, enabling both sustainable NH3 production and environmental remediation. However, current NRA methods, primarily photocatalytic and electrocatalytic, depend heavily on external energy inputs (light or electricity), limiting their deployment in off-grid or distributed settings. Here, we report a mechanoluminescence (ML)-enhanced mechanocatalysis strategy for mechanically driven NRA using Mn-doped CaZnOS (Mn–CaZnOS) as an efficient mechano-catalyst. Under mechanical stimulation, Mn–CaZnOS generates a synergistic cascade of piezoelectric and photoexcitation effects that facilitate the NRA process. This ML-enhanced system achieves a notable NH3 yield rate of","au":["Chunfeng Wang","Gaofeng Lai","Xingyue Yang","Deyu Ruan","Deliang Zhu","Ying Guo"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"基于机械发光的硝酸还原合成氨","zb":"研究对象为氨合成，采用机械化学硝酸还原法，关键方法是使用 Mn 掺杂的 CaZnOS (Mn–CaZnOS) 作为机械催化剂，通过机械刺激产生压电和光激发协同效应促进硝酸还原，主要结果为氨产率速率达到 5.4 μmol g–1 h–1，稳定性超过 100 小时。","ob":"机械化学制氨｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1002/cssc.70788","t":"Synergistic Coupling of Iron Single Atoms and Nanoscale Clusters for Enhanced Nitrate Electroreduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cssc.70788","s":"ChemSusChem","d":"2026-06-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Developing efficient electrocatalysts for nitrate reduction to ammonia is critical for both environmental remediation and energy conservation, yet it demands highly active and selective catalysts to overcome competing pathways and sluggish kinetics. Herein, we report a Fe single‐atom–cluster coupled catalyst synthesized via a controlled pyrolysis strategy, which features atomically dispersed Fe–N 4 sites coexisting with subnanometer Fe clusters embedded in a nitrogen‐doped carbon matrix. This unique architecture significantly enhances the electrocatalytic NO 3 RR performance, achieving a high NH 3 yield rate of 12.5 mg h −1 and a Faradaic efficiency of ≈92% at –0.5 V versus reversible hydrogen electrode, substantially outperforming Fe 3 O 4 nanoparticle and bare carbon paper benchmarks. Combined experimental characterizations and density functional theory calculations reveal that the adj","au":["Muhammad Yasir","Jianjun Fu","Beiping Zhang","Shensong Wang","Xianhuai Huang","Xinyi Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"铁单原子和纳米尺度团簇的协同耦合用于增强硝酸盐电还原到氨","zb":"研究对象为铁单原子-团簇耦合催化剂，关键方法为控制热解策略合成，主要结果为在 -0.5 V vs RHE 下，实现 12.5 mg h−1 的氨产率率和 ≈92% 的法拉第效率，Fe 纳米团簇电子调节 Fe-N4 位，增强硝酸盐吸附并促进 *NO 到 *NOH 步，催化剂在 24 h 内表现出优异的长期稳定性和循环性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1088/1361-6668/ae7033","t":"Phase formation and crystallization of Ba 1− x K x Fe 2 As 2 under ultrafast joule heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1088/1361-6668/ae7033","s":"Superconductor Science and Technology","d":"2026-06-09","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract Ultrafast joule heating (UJH) has emerged as a powerful non-equilibrium processing strategy for rapid ceramic synthesis, yet its applicability to superconducting materials remains largely unexplored. Here, we systematically investigate the ultrafast sintering behavior of Ba 1− x K x Fe 2 As 2 (BaK122) precursor bulks under extreme heating rates (10 3 –10 4 °C s -1 ) and sub-minute processing times. By precisely controlling the input energy and peak temperature, we reveal a distinct temperature-dependent evolution of phase formation, microstructure, elemental redistribution, and superconducting properties. High-purity BaK122 can be synthesized within only 20 s at temperatures as low as 500 °C–600 °C. Further thermal input primarily promotes grain coarsening without improving phase purity. However, excessive temperatures above ∼900 °C induce potassium evaporation, leading to BaK12","au":["Hao Zhou","Zhenguo Zhang","Chiheng Dong"],"o":"回填","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"Ba 1− x K x Fe 2 As 2 的相形成和结晶：超快焦耳加热","zb":"超快焦耳加热 (UJH) 已成为快速陶瓷合成的强大非平衡处理策略，但其对超导材料的应用仍 largely unexplored。本研究系统地调查了 Ba 1− x K x Fe 2 As 2 (BaK122) 前驱体块在极端加热速率 (10 3 –10 4 °C s -1 ) 和亚分钟处理时间下的超快烧结行为。通过精确控制输入能量和峰值温度，揭示了相形成、微观结构、元素重新分布和超导性能的温度依赖性演变。可以在仅 20 s 内合成高纯度的 BaK122，温度低至 500 °C–600 °C。进一步的热输入主要促进晶粒粗化，而未提高相纯度。然而，超过 ~900 °C 的过高温度会导致钾蒸发，导致 BaK122 分解和 FeAs 沿晶界偏析。超导性能对烧结温度表现出非单调依赖性，在平衡快速相形成和化学稳定性的狭窄动力学窗口内实现了更好的超导性。这些结果建立了 UJH 作为铁基超导体快速合成可行","ob":"材料制备/结构调控"},{"id":"10.1007/s13762-026-07306-x","t":"Preparation of visible light-activated molybdenum-doped TiO2 thin films by atomic layer deposition for environmental photocatalytic applications","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s13762-026-07306-x","s":"International Journal of Environmental Science and Technology","d":"2026-06-09","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["A. M. Maksumova","I. M. Abdulagatov","M. N. Gafurova","A. M. Pashaeva"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"通过原子层沉积制备可见光激活的钼掺杂 TiO2 薄膜用于环境光催化应用","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积","bt":1},{"id":"10.1038/s41467-026-74322-3","t":"Ammonia mediated electrostatic adsorption synthesis of paired subnanoclusters with enhanced hydrogen oxidation performance","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-026-74322-3","s":"Nature Communications","d":"2026-06-09","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Sub-nanoclusters (sub-NCs) hold promise for the alkaline hydrogen oxidation reaction yet struggle with precise atomic dispersion and structural stability. Here, we report an ammonia-mediated electrostatic adsorption strategy that enables the synthesis of tunable paired metal-metal oxide sub-NCs, exemplified by PtSARuRh-MOx (SA represents single-atom sites, M = Cr, Mo, V, Ti, Ta, Zr). Electrostatic interactions between cationic PtRuRhδ+ and oxo-/fluoro-anions (e.g., CrO42−, MoO42-, VO3−, TiF62-, TaF72− and ZrF62−) control phase pairing during pyrolysis. The optimized PtSARuRh-CrOx demonstrates competitive mass activity (13.81 A mg−1, 58-fold that of commercial Pt/C) and delivers a peak power density of 1.43 W cm−2 in an alkaline membrane fuel cell, with stable operation exceeding 200 h. In situ spectroscopy and simulations reveal that the synergistic Ru/Rh sites, electronically modulated ","au":["Xinwei Li","Xin Zhang","Changhong Zhan","Tao Gan","Yuchao Wang","Shangyi Ma"],"o":"回填","zt":"氨介导的静电吸附合成对偶亚纳米团簇以增强氢氧化性能","zb":"研究对象为碱性氢氧化反应，采用氨介导的静电吸附策略合成对偶金属-金属氧化物亚纳米团簇 PtSARuRh-MOx，关键方法是利用静电相互作用控制团簇在热解过程中的配对，主要结果为 PtSARuRh-CrOx 表现出优异的质活性（13.81 A mg−1）和功率密度（1.43 W cm−2），稳定性超过 200 小时。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）；涉及Ru/钌体系、碳材料","top":1},{"id":"10.1093/bulcsj/uoag080","t":"Iron-modified mesoporous MOFs for enhanced electrochemical nitrate-to-ammonia conversion","u":"https://doi.org/10.1093/bulcsj/uoag080","s":"Bulletin of the Chemical Society of Japan","d":"2026-06-09","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction is a sustainable alternative to the Haber–Bosch process, yet balancing activity with selectivity remains challenging. Herein, we developed a Fe-incorporated mesoporous UiO-66-NH2 (Fe-mUiO-66-NH2) catalyst using a hierarchical mesopore-confinement strategy. Structural analysis confirmed that the coral-like mesoporous architecture remains intact after Fe incorporation. XPS and electrochemical analyses show that the Fe sites within the mesoporous framework facilitate efficient charge transfer, which is key to the improved catalytic activity. Consequently, Fe-mUiO-66-NH2 achieves a superior ammonia yield rate of 160 μmol h−1 cm−2 and a Faradaic efficiency of 75%, representing a significant improvement over the performance of the pristine MOF. This work demonstrates the synergy between efficient mass transport and optimized intrinsic activity, offer","au":["Xiangyang Liu","Yongqi Yin","Yusuke Asakura","Yingji Zhao","Yusuke Yamauchi"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"铁改性介孔 MOFs 增强电化学硝酸盐至氨的转化","zb":"研究对象为电化学硝酸盐还原，采用 Fe 掺杂的介孔 UiO-66-NH2 (Fe-mUiO-66-NH2) 催化剂，关键方法是利用分级介孔孔道限制策略，主要结果为 Fe-mUiO-66-NH2 实现了 160 μmol h−1 cm−2 的氨产率速率和 75% 的法拉第效率，显著优于原始 MOF。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.procir.2026.05.275","t":"Design of a Modular Additively Manufactured Reactor for Ammonia Cracking for Hydrogen Production: Catalyst Testing and Real-Time Thermal Monitoring","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.procir.2026.05.275","s":"Procedia CIRP","d":"2026-06-09","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Efficient catalytic ammonia (NH₃) cracking is essential for sustainable hydrogen production, yet existing test platforms often lack adaptability and real-time process monitoring, slowing catalyst development. This paper presents a modular reactor manufactured using additive manufacturing (AM) techniques, enabling rapid and flexible testing of powder, porous, and multi-material catalyst samples. The reactor body and modular components were produced via laser powder bed fusion of metals (PBF-LB/M), ensuring thermal robustness, configurability, and integrated thermocouple ports for localized temperature monitoring. Its fully AM-based design allows straightforward variation in size, supporting both laboratory-scale testing and scale-up. The modular architecture facilitates efficient catalyst screening, improved thermal control, and continuous monitoring–key requirements for optimizing perfor","au":["Sohan Acharya","Sunil Kwon","Peter Kraus","Adrian Fried","Hans-Christian Möhring"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Cracking"],"zt":"为氨分解制氢设计的模块化增材制造反应器：催化剂测试和实时热监测","zb":"研究对象为氨分解制氢，关键方法是设计并制造了模块化增材制造反应器，用于测试不同催化剂样品，反应器通过激光粉末床熔融技术制造，具有热鲁棒性、可配置性和集成热电偶端口，主要结果为验证了反应器在氨分解和热监测方面的有效性，并展示了其灵活性和可扩展性。","ob":"氨分解制氢"},{"id":"10.54254/2755-2721/2026.ad34258","t":"Comparative Review and Future Outlook for Ammonia Production from Conventional to Emerging Technologies","u":"https://doi.org/10.54254/2755-2721/2026.ad34258","s":"Applied and Computational Engineering","d":"2026-06-08","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Ammonia, a crucial chemical in global industrial production, plays an indispensable role in agricultural fertilizers as well as in emerging energy areas. The conventional Haber-Bosch method converts nitrogen and hydrogen into ammonia under high temperatures and high pressures, but it depends heavily on fossil fuels together with high operational conditions which results in large amounts of energy being consumed and serious carbon emissions. To overcome this issue, alternative production methods are required. This study explored the use of zeolite to advance the production method of ammonia. Zeolite is a molecular sieve and is widely used in various applications: as a catalyst in the chemical industry owing to its pore size, as a soil conditioner in agriculture, and as a water softener through ion exchange. However, these properties do not make it incompatible with modern sustainable deve","au":["Shien Yan"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"从传统到新兴技术的氨生产：比较综述与未来展望","zb":"综述了从传统哈伯-博施法到新兴技术的氨生产方法，探讨了沸石在氨生产中的应用潜力。文章分析了传统方法对化石燃料的依赖及高能耗问题，并展望了利用沸石分子筛等材料实现可持续氨生产的未来发展方向。"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.76424","t":"Joule Heating Triggered Interfacial Engineering of Biomass Hard Carbon for High‐Performance Sodium‐Ion Batteries","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.76424","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-06-08","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"ABSTRACT Biomass‐derived hard carbon (HC) has emerged as a promising low‐cost anode material for sodium‐ion batteries (SIBs). However, conventional pyrolysis typically results in narrow graphene interlayer spacing and disordered microstructures, which impede Na + diffusion kinetics and restrict low‐voltage plateau capacity. Herein, we develop an iron‐mediated Joule heating strategy to precisely engineer the microstructure of bamboo‐derived HC on ultrafast timescales. Rapid carbon atom reconstruction, combined with Fe‐catalyzed graphitization, simultaneously achieves enlarged interlayer spacing, well‐developed closed pores, and extended graphite microcrystals with long‐range order, collectively promoting faster Na + diffusion and storage. Notably, trace residual Fe further modulates interfacial chemistry by reducing the electrolyte decomposition barrier, facilitating the formation of a th","au":["Limin Zhou","Gaoyue Zhang","Jiayuan Li","Yang Li","Jianxin Jiang","Zihao Li"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"焦耳加热触发的生物质硬碳界面工程用于高性能钠离子电池","zb":"生物质衍生的硬碳 (HC) 已成为钠离子电池 (SIBs) 的有前景的低成本负极材料。然而，传统的热解通常导致较窄的石墨层间距和无序的微观结构，这阻碍了 Na + 扩散动力学并限制了低电压平台容量。本研究开发了一种铁介导的焦耳加热策略，以超快时间尺度精确设计竹衍生 HC 的微观结构。快速碳原子重构，结合 Fe-催化的石墨化，同时实现了增大的层间距、发育良好的封闭孔隙和具有长程有序的扩展石墨微晶，共同促进了更快的 Na + 扩散和存储。值得注意的是，微量的残留 Fe 通过降低电解液分解势垒来调节界面化学，促进形成薄、均匀且富含无机物的固体电解质界面。受益于这种微观结构和界面化学的双重调节，所得 HC 交付 395 mAh g −1 的可逆容量 (在 0.05 A g −1 下)，包括 297 mAh g −1 的高平台容量，并在 5000 次循环后保留了 84% 的初始容量，优于报道的生物质","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzUxMDMzODg2Ng==&mid=2247821251&idx=1","t":"上海交通大学叶天南团队JACS: Mo催化N-H活性物种介导流动相氮气直接合成胺","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUxMDMzODg2Ng%3D%3D&mid=2247821251&idx=1","s":"研之成理","d":"2026-06-08","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:59Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"由于Mo作为合成氨的常用催化剂，前人已经对Mo的氮化反应有充分研究，因此该工作主要聚焦于对胺化反应的研究。作者首先用飞行时间二次离子质谱（TOF-SIMS）确定了Mo-Mo2NxHy表面存在着四种含N物种，分别为N（m/z = 14）、NH （m/z","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["合成氨"],"wx":1},{"id":"10.1021/acssuschemeng.6c01024","t":"Reduction Kinetics of NO 3 – vs NO 2 – toward Ammonia Synthesis on a Magnesium Single-Atom Electrocatalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssuschemeng.6c01024","s":"ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering","d":"2026-06-08","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia is an essential chemical and an emerging carbon-free hydrogen carrier, yet its conventional Haber–Bosch synthesis is energy-intensive and CO 2 -emitting. Electrochemical reduction of nitrogen oxyanions offers a sustainable alternative; however, achieving high selectivity toward ammonia while suppressing the competing hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) has been predominantly realized using transition-metal-based catalysts. In contrast, alkaline-earth metals remain largely unexplored due to their intrinsic instability and the long-standing challenge of stabilizing them as single-atom catalysts. Herein, we demonstrate the catalytic potential of an alkaline-earth single-atom system by developing a chlorophyll-derived magnesium single-atom catalyst (Mg 1 /N–C-650) featuring atomically dispersed Mg–N 4 centers, synthesized via a simple, environmentally benign, and cost-effective route. ","au":["Kanhai Kumar","Pragyan Tripathi","Omeshwari Yadorao Bisen","Dova Kalyan","Gokul Raj","Demudu Babu Gorle"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"硝酸根离子与亚硝酸根离子向氨合成的还原动力学在镁单原子电催化剂上的研究","zb":"研究对象为镁单原子电催化剂，关键方法为电化学还原氮氧化物，表征为电解质依赖性动力学差异，结果显示亚硝酸根离子还原动力学显著增强，氨生产速率为1851.07 ± 62.87 μmol h –1 mg –1 cat. (−0.25 V)。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/tcr.70173","t":"Entropy‐Engineered Catalysts for Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/tcr.70173","s":"The Chemical Record","d":"2026-06-08","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Medium‐entropy alloys (MEAs) and high‐entropy alloys (HEAs) have recently emerged as promising electrocatalysts, owing to their compositional complexity, electronic tunability, and configurational entropy. They offer a diverse array of active sites, favorable adsorption energies, and enhanced structural stability, enabling efficient and selective multielectron nitrate reduction. Herein, we critically examine the recent advances in MEA/HEA‐based electrocatalysts for nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR), detailing their synthetic strategies, phase behaviors, structure and property relationships, and mechanistic pathways. Mechanistic insights into NO 3 RR, with emphasis on proton‐coupled electron transfer, intermediate stabilization, and hydrogen evolution suppression, are also discussed. A comparative assessment with monometallic and bimetallic systems is presented to highlight the advanta","au":["Aqsa Dildar","Walija Maqsood","Muhammad Ismail","Urva‐Tul‐ Wusqa","Nadia Tahir","Muhammad Akmal"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"熵工程催化剂用于电化学硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为电化学硝酸盐还原，综述了中等熵合金 (MEAs) 和高熵合金 (HEAs) 作为电催化剂的进展，关键方法是讨论了其合成策略、相行为、结构与性能关系以及反应机理，主要结果为强调了熵驱动设计的优势，并提出了未来发展方向。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.74149","t":"Hydrogen Spillover Synergistically Enhances Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia on SnO 2 ‐CuO Heterointerfaces","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.74149","s":"Small","d":"2026-06-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT The electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) offers an ideal solution to addressing nitrogen cycle imbalances and energy challenges. However, the competing hydrogen evolution reaction and limited efficient catalysts result in unsatisfactory NO 3 RR efficiency. Herein, SnO 2 ‐CuO hollow nanofibers with hierarchical heterointerfaces were prepared via an electrospinning and calcination strategy. Experimental and theoretical calculations demonstrate that Sn sites in the SnO 2 ‐CuO hierarchical heterojunction can effectively promote water splitting to provide active hydrogen ( * H), while Cu sites facilitate the adsorption and reduction of NO 3 − , which accelerates the hydrogenation reaction of * NO x intermediates. Furthermore, charge redistribution at the SnO 2 ‐CuO interface generates a built‐in electric field, significantly reducing the diffusion energy barrier of *","au":["Hongze Liu","Zhibiao Cui","Shouyuan Zhong","Weiqi Kuang","Jinshan Wei","Ji Zhou"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"SnO 2 ‐CuO 异质界面上的氢溢流协同增强电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为 SnO 2 ‐CuO 异质界面，关键方法为电化学硝酸盐还原反应，结果显示 Faradaic 效率为 94.89%，氨产率为 628.14 µmol h −1 cm −2。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adma.73603","t":"Machine Learning Accelerated Computational Design of Bio‐Inspired Catalysts in the Nitrogen Reduction Reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.73603","s":"Advanced Materials","d":"2026-06-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"ABSTRACT The development of efficient catalysts for nitrogen conversion to ammonia is critical for a sustainable alternative to the energy‐intensive Haber–Bosch process. Yet, rational catalyst design remains highly challenging, compounded by complex structure–function relationships within realistic conditions. Herein, we present an integrated computational framework combining quantum chemical calculations with 27 machine learning models to predict experimental catalytic metrics in metal–ligand complexes. The models are trained and validated on a large experimental database and demonstrate high predictive accuracy across multiple tasks. For classification, family 1 and family 2 catalysts achieved test accuracies up to 1. Regression models yield test R 2 values of 0.91 and 0.88 for turnover frequency (TOF) and turnover number (TON) predictions in family 1, and 0.96 and 0.99 in family 2. No","au":["Leonardo Di Ciano","Zihan You","Haoran Chen","Qifan Zhong","Rong‐Zhen Liao","Shaoqi Zhan"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"机器学习加速计算的仿生催化剂在氮还原反应中的设计","zb":"研究对象为金属-配体复合物，关键方法为量子化学计算与机器学习模型，结果显示模型对 TOF 和 TON 预测的测试 R 2 值分别为 0.91-0.99。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.6886853","t":"Process-level energy assessment of sorption-enhanced ammonia separation in distributed Haber–Bosch synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6886853","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-06-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Small-scale, renewable-powered Haber–Bosch (HB) synthesis is constrained by inefficient ammonia separation at reduced operating pressures, where conventional condensation removes less than 10% of NH₃ per pass due to vapor–liquid equilibrium limitations. Sorption-based separation offers a potential alternative by selectively removing NH₃ from the synthesis loop, enhancing equilibrium conversion.This work develops an integrated framework combining sorbent screening, dynamic cycle simulation, and process-level energy assessment for distributed ammonia production.Five sorbent classes (activated carbons, zeolites, metal halides, hydrides, and borohydrides) were evaluated using a multi-criteria decision methodology based on working capacity, regeneration requirements, kinetics, stability, cost, and safety. Zeolite 13X was identified as the most suitable candidate and implemented in a three-ste","au":["Elvira Spatolisano","Anton A. Kiss"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"分布式哈伯-博施合成中吸附增强的氨分离的过程级能量评估","zb":"研究对象为吸附剂筛选与动态循环模拟，关键方法为 Aspen Adsorption® V14 模拟，结果显示 Zeolite 13X 在三步压力摆动吸附循环中可将循环 NH₃ 浓度从 2.4 mol% 降至 0.033 mol%。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","pre":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.6886851","t":"Investigation of Heat Transfer and Reaction Characteristics as a Function of Catalyst Geometry in a Low Temperature Ammonia Decomposition Reactor","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6886851","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-06-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This study presents a computational fluid dynamics (CFD) framework for analyzing coupled heat transfer, flow distribution, and catalytic reaction in low temperature ammonia decomposition fixed bed reactors packed with Ru/Al₂O₃ catalysts. Unlike conventional porous medium approaches, the present model explicitly resolves catalyst packing geometries generated using Blender based rigid body packing simulations. To improve model reliability, kinetic parameters of the Temkin-Pyzhev ammonia decomposition model were estimated using experimental data through a one-dimensional (1D) gPROMS model and implemented into ANSYS Fluent through a user defined function (UDF).The developed CFD framework was applied to sphere, 1-hole, and 7-hole catalyst geometries to investigate the effects of catalyst shape on heat transfer, flow distribution, and ammonia decomposition performance. The sphere catalyst exhi","au":["Wansik Yu","Byeonggyu Jeon","Woosol Jeon","Kee Young Koo","Unho Jung","Yongha Park"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"作为催化剂几何形状函数的传热和反应特性在低温氨分解反应器中的研究","zb":"研究对象为 Ru/Al₂O₃ 催化剂，关键方法为计算流体动力学框架，结果显示球状催化剂的氨转化率为 83%，而 7-hole 和 1-hole 催化剂分别为 73% 和 66%。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系","pre":1},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.76353","t":"Dynamic Interfacial Microstructure for Lithium‐Mediated Ammonia Synthesis: Advances and Mechanistic Insights","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.76353","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-06-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT Ammonia acts as a pivotal platform chemical in industry and an ideal hydrogen carrier in renewable energy sector. Lithium‐mediated nitrogen reduction (Li‐NRR) is a highly promising electricity‐driven ammonia synthesis route intrinsically compatible with intermittent renewable energy. Distinguished from electrocatalytic processes, Li‐NRR process integrates both electrochemical and thermochemical reaction steps, where the collective effects of their kinetics and mass transports on the overall Li‐NRR performance are ambiguous. Moreover, the complex interfacial structure dynamics and the interplay between each individual reaction step remain less understood. These knowledge gaps severely hinder further improvements in reaction performance and long‐term stability. In this review, the Li‐NRR process is decoupled first to identify the bottlenecks of individual reaction steps and overal","au":["Jiaqi Zhu","Lijun Han","Xi Cheng","Yuanyuan Wang","Miao Qi","Ruijia Huan"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzkxNjY3OTE3Ng==&mid=2247511955&idx=2","t":"Angew Chem.中科院大连化物所陈萍研究员团队与四川大学袁绍军教授合作开发高效氢化物负载原子级分散Mn催化剂用于合成氨！","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxNjY3OTE3Ng%3D%3D&mid=2247511955&idx=2","s":"氢能加","d":"2026-06-05","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:57Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"氨是一种重要的化工原料和有前景的氢能载体，这推动了高效氨合成催化剂的发展。然而，比例关系从根本上限制了传统的过渡金属基催化剂，使得锰等强N结合能力的金属因加氢动力学缓慢而效果不佳。","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["合成氨"],"wx":1},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzAxMjg3NjA5NA==&mid=2247489255&idx=1","t":"突破经典催化理论！中科院大连化物所开发新型单原子锰基高效合成氨催化剂","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxMjg3NjA5NA%3D%3D&mid=2247489255&idx=1","s":"横渠网","d":"2026-06-05","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:57Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"本研究来自中科院大连化物所DNL1901氢化物能源化学课题组，陈萍研究员团队深耕氢化物能源转化二十余年，已在Nature、Nature Chemistry、Nature Energy等顶级期刊发表系列氢化物活化氮气标志性成果。","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["合成氨"],"wx":1},{"id":"10.1039/d6qi00745g","t":"Scalable engineering of the active NiMoO 4 /MoO 2 catalyst by rapid Joule heating for industrial pre-treated seawater electrolysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6qi00745g","s":"Inorganic Chemistry Frontiers","d":"2026-06-05","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"This work explores a scalable Joule heating method enabling high-performance, stable RO seawater electrolysis via optimized NiMoO 4 /MoO 2 heterostructures, achieving industrial current density with lower voltage and energy consumption.","au":["Yiming Chen","Zhan Zhao","Yuanyuan Liu","Kelei Huang","Xiangchao Meng"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"快速焦耳热可扩展工程NiMoO4/MoO2催化剂用于工业预处理海水电解","zb":"该研究探索了一种可扩展的焦耳热方法，通过优化的NiMoO4/MoO2异质结构实现高性能、稳定的RO海水电解，在较低电压和能耗下达到工业电流密度。"},{"id":"10.1021/acsanm.6c01356","t":"Boosting Alkaline Hydrogen Evolution by Pulse Joule-Heating Activated PtRu Nanoclusters on N-Doped Mesoporous Carbon","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsanm.6c01356","s":"ACS Applied Nano Materials","d":"2026-06-05","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The precise construction of bimetallic sites and the regulation of interfacial environments are crucial for accelerating the sluggish kinetics of alkaline hydrogen evolution. Transient thermochemical processing provides a unique pathway to modulate heterogeneous coordination and metal–support interaction. Herein, we report a pulse Joule-heating (PJH) strategy to activate mixed-valence PtRu nanoclusters on nitrogen-doped mesoporous carbon. The resulting PtRu/NMC-JH exhibits exceptional hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) activity in 1.0 M KOH, delivering an overpotential of only 50.4 mV to reach 100 mA cm –2 and an ultralow Tafel slope of 30.8 mV dec –1, with superior stability exceeding 100 h. Furthermore, the alkaline water electrolysis (AWE) device integrated with this cathode delivers a current density of 0.5 A cm –2 at a cell voltage of 1.59 V with robust stability over 800 h. The rema","au":["Kenan Shen","Yang Qin","Heyong Zhu","Zheming Wang","Zhenshun Mo","Yanan Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule-Heat"],"zt":"脉冲焦耳热激活的N掺杂介孔碳上PtRu纳米团簇促进碱性析氢","zb":"利用脉冲焦耳加热策略在氮掺杂介孔碳上激活混合价态PtRu团簇，构建双金属位点。所得PtRu/NMC-JH在1.0 M KOH中表现出卓越的析氢反应性能，过电位为50.4 mV，塔菲尔斜率为30.8 mV dec–1，稳定性超过100 h。集成该阴极的碱性水电解装置在1.59 V电压下电流密度达0.5 A cm–2，且800 h内保持稳定。","ob":"析氢反应；涉及碳材料｜反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热"},{"id":"10.1039/d6ta03045a","t":"Fe 3 C/Fe nanoparticles embedded in N-doped carbon as catalysts for electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ta03045a","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2026-06-05","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The synergistic effects between N-doped carbon and Fe 3 C/Fe enable Fe 3 C/Fe@NC to overcome NRR's trilemma, delivering a high NH 3 yield, remarkable faradaic efficiency, and good stability, thereby providing a viable heterostructure strategy for NRR.","au":["Song Zhang","Ling-Ling Shan","Jing-Jing Liang","Ze-Zheng Xiao","Shao-Wei Bian"],"o":"回填","why":["NRR"],"zt":"嵌入N掺杂碳中的Fe3C/Fe纳米颗粒作为电催化氮还原为氨的催化剂","zb":"N掺杂碳和Fe3C/Fe之间的协同效应使Fe3C/Fe@NC能够克服NRR的三重困境，提供高NH3产率、显著的法拉第效率和良好的稳定性，从而为NRR提供了一种可行的异质结构策略。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsaenm.6c00493","t":"Microporous Polyamine (PIM-EA-TB) Modified with Hydrated NiMoO4 Enhances the Photocatalytic Reduction of Nitrogen to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsaenm.6c00493","s":"ACS Applied Engineering Materials","d":"2026-06-05","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The earth-abundant photocatalyst NiMoO4, readily produced by hydrothermal microwave synthesis, was tested for the light-driven production of ammonia in N2-purched water. In blue LED light (λ = 385 nm; 6 mW cm–2) and under pH-neutral conditions, ammonia is formed as detected via the indophenol blue method and confirmed by 15N isotope experiments. Thermal treatment lowers hydration and affects defect populations in NiMoO4 (detected by photoluminescence) as well as suppressing catalysis. Adding methanol as a sacrificial hole quencher increases the ammonia production rate. In exploratory experiments, a surface coating of the NiMoO4 photocatalyst with a molecularly rigid microporous polyamine (PIM-EA-TB with pKA ∼ 4) is shown to more than double the ammonia production rate. This is tentatively assigned here to a localized pH storage effect, allowing protons from photoanodic processes","au":["Lara K. Ribeiro","Ana Beatriz Cardile","Laura O. Libero","Mariolino Carta","Neil B. McKeown","Lucia H. Mascaro"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"含孔聚胺(PIM-EA-TB)修饰的水合NiMoO4增强光催化氮还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为地球丰产光催化剂NiMoO4，通过水热微波合成制备，用于光驱动N2纯化水中的氨生产。在蓝光LED(λ=385 nm; 6 mW cm–2)和pH中性条件下，通过靛酚蓝法检测到氨生成，并通过15N同位素实验确认。热处理降低了水合度并影响了NiMoO4的缺陷种群（通过光致发光检测）以及抑制了催化作用。添加甲醇作为牺牲空穴淬灭剂增加了氨生产速率。探索性实验表明，用分子刚性微孔聚胺(PIM-EA-TB，pKA ∼ 4)对NiMoO4光催化剂进行表面包覆，可以将氨生产速率提高一倍以上。这被初步归因于局部pH储存效应，允许来自光阳极过程的质子被聚合物主链中的Tröger碱捕获并重新用于光阴极氨生产。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.3390/plasma9020020","t":"Influence of Different Catalysts on Ammonia Synthesis Performance in Coaxial DBD Plasma","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/plasma9020020","s":"Plasma","d":"2026-06-04","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"In the renewable energy-driven “green electricity–green hydrogen–green ammonia” pathway, the development of low-temperature and low-energy-consumption ammonia synthesis technologies is of great significance. In this work, a plasma-catalytic ammonia synthesis system was established using a coaxial dielectric barrier discharge (DBD) reactor. The effects of different catalysts, including Ag, Cu, γ-Al2O3, BaTiO3 and Co/BaTiO3, Ni/BaTiO3 on ammonia synthesis performance were systematically investigated. The reaction process was analyzed using voltage–current waveforms, Lissajous figures, and optical emission spectroscopy (OES). The results show that different catalytic systems have a significant influence on ammonia synthesis performance, with the promotional effect ranked as follows: Ni/BaTiO3 > Co/BaTiO3 > BaTiO3 > Ag > γ-Al2O3 > Cu. Among them, Ni/BaTiO3 exhibited the best performance. Und","au":["Fangcheng Qiu","Xin Zhang","Shuai Jiang","Huilin Zhou","Lin Wang","Yufeng Song"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"不同催化剂对同轴DBD等离子体中氨合成性能的影响","zb":"在可再生能源驱动的“绿色电力-绿色氢气-绿色氨”途径中，开发低温和低能耗的氨合成技术具有重要意义。本文中，使用同轴介电屏障放电(DBD)反应器建立了一个等离子体催化氨合成系统。系统地研究了不同催化剂（包括Ag、Cu、γ-Al2O3、BaTiO3和Co/BaTiO3、Ni/BaTiO3）对氨合成性能的影响。通过电压-电流波形、利萨茹图形和光发射光谱(OES)分析了反应过程。结果表明，不同的催化体系对氨合成性能有显著影响，促进作用排名如下：Ni/BaTiO3 > Co/BaTiO3 > BaTiO3 > Ag > γ-Al2O3 > Cu。其中，Ni/BaTiO3表现出最佳性能。在N2:H2=1:1和气体流量为2.5 L/min的条件下，NH3合成速率达到259.48 μmol/min，最大能量效率达到1.40 g-NH3/kWh。催化剂表征结果表明，BaTiO3载体保持了稳定的晶体结构，而负","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.jpclett.6c01088","t":"Boosting Nitrogen Selectivity in Photocatalytic Nitrate Reduction via Radical-Mediated Pathway over Cu–Ag Alloy Nanoclusters","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpclett.6c01088","s":"The Journal of Physical Chemistry Letters","d":"2026-06-04","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Photocatalytic nitrate (NO3-) reduction in aqueous systems is an attractive strategy for water remediation; however, directing the reaction toward benign nitrogen gas (N2) rather than ammonium (NH4+) remains a major challenge. Herein, subnanometer Cu-Ag alloy nanoclusters (ANCs) were anchored on TiO2 by stepwise photodeposition to achieve efficient and highly selective denitrification. Compared with their monometallic counterparts, the optimized Cu0.2Ag0.8/TiO2 catalyst delivered 94.3% NO3- removal and 92.7% N2 selectivity within 2 h. Combined spectroscopic characterization and density functional theory (DFT) calculations reveal a pronounced alloy synergy in which Ag-rich sites stabilize NO3- adsorption, whereas Cu-rich sites promote interfacial electron transfer and activation of nitrogenous intermediates. Mechanistic investigations, including in situ EPR and 15N isotope labeling, furth","au":["Ye Liu","Xiaoqian Xiang","Guoqiang Wang","Xiaojun Lv"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"通过自由基介导的途径在Cu-Ag合金纳米团簇上增强光催化硝酸盐还原的氮选择性","zb":"光催化水系中的硝酸盐(NO3-)还原是一种吸引人的水处理策略；然而，将反应导向无害的氮气(N2)而不是铵(NH4+)仍然是一个主要挑战。本文中，亚纳米Cu-Ag合金纳米团簇(ANCs)通过逐步光沉积锚定在TiO2上，以实现高效和高度选择性的反硝化。与它们的单金属对应物相比，优化的Cu0.2Ag0.8/TiO2催化剂在2小时内实现了94.3%的NO3-去除和92.7%的N2选择性。结合光谱表征和密度泛函理论(DFT)计算揭示了一种强烈的合金协同效应，其中富Ag位点稳定NO3-吸附，而富Cu位点促进界面电子转移和氮族中间体的活化。机理研究，包括原位EPR和15N同位素标记，进一步证明了自由基介导的途径，其中甲酸盐氧化产生·CO2-自由基。这些自由基加速了亚硝酸盐中间体的选择性转化为N2，从而抑制了过度还原为氨。这项研究强调了合金纳米团簇工程与自由基化学相结合作为控制水系光催化硝酸盐还原产物选择","ob":"光催化硝酸盐转化｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1002/cjoc.70586","t":"Unlocking Ambient Electrochemical Lithium–Mediated Nitrogen Reduction: Mechanisms, Classifications, Components and Perspectives","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cjoc.70586","s":"Chinese Journal of Chemistry","d":"2026-06-04","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Comprehensive Summary Electrochemical lithium–mediated nitrogen reduction (LiNR) offers a sustainable alternative to the Haber‐Bosch process for ammonia synthesis but faces hurdles in reaction mechanisms and component optimization. This review critically analyzes recent advancements of LiNR, categorizing them into intermittent (ILiNR) and continuous (CLiNR) modes based on the operational strategies of proton sources. CLiNR is further classified by anode mechanisms: electrolyte oxidation, H 2 oxidation (HOR), and Li oxidation (LiOR). Integrating the lithium–nitrogen cell (Li–N 2 ) concept into LiNR highlights its distinct advantages, particularly in lithium sourcing, side reaction suppression, and lithium cycling. We comprehensively examine electrode materials, cell configurations, and electrolytes. The relationship between Li–N 2 and LiNR is analyzed. Divergences in cell design, operatin","au":["Xingyu Ma","Hui Sun","Changjian Liu","Xiaotao Bai","Qiang Liu","Lixiang Li"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/ece2.70078","t":"Locking Fe Single Atoms Into the Lattices of Mesoporous TiO 2 Promotes Nitrogen Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/ece2.70078","s":"EcoEnergy","d":"2026-06-04","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"ABSTRACT Single‐atom catalysts (SACs) have been extensively explored for electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction (NRR). However, reported NRR SACs often exhibit limited activity and selectivity. This highlight presents a lattice‐confinement strategy to construct a mesoporous Fe 1 S x @TiO 2 catalyst with excellent NRR performance, in which isolated Fe atoms are embedded in the TiO 2 lattice and stabilized as sulfur‐coordinated single‐atom sites. The open and ordered mesoporous architecture further facilitates mass transport and maximizes the exposure of active sites, leading to enhanced NRR activity. This work offers an effective pathway toward designing efficient NRR electrocatalysts under ambient conditions.","au":["Danli Liang","Ruicong Wang","Yujuan Zhao","Zaiwang Zhao"],"o":"回填","why":["NRR"],"zt":"将Fe单原子锁定在介孔TiO2晶格中促进氮还原","zb":"单原子催化剂(SACs)已被广泛探索用于电催化氮还原(NRR)。然而，报道的NRR SACs通常表现出有限的活动性和选择性。本文提出了一种晶格限制策略来构建具有优异NRR性能的介孔Fe1Sx@TiO2催化剂，其中孤立的Fe原子嵌入TiO2晶格中并作为硫配位的单原子位点稳定。开放的有序介孔结构进一步促进了质量传输并最大限度地暴露了活性位点，从而提高了NRR活性。这项工作为在环境条件下设计高效的NRR电催化剂提供了一种有效途径。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.4927761","t":"Hydrogen Radical‐Mediated Nitric Oxide Reduction to Ammonia Over Synergistic Pd 0 /Pd 2+ Dual Sites","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.4927761","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2026-06-03","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"ABSTRACT The photocatalytic nitric oxide reduction reaction (NORR) to NH 3 offers a promising route for ammonia (NH 3 ) synthesis, addressing environmental issues and mitigating the carbon footprint associated with the energy‐intensive Haber‐Bosch process. However, conventional sluggish multi‐proton‐coupled electron transfer (PCET) and poor regulation of valence states at active sites hinder the efficiency of NORR. Herein, we propose a hydrogenation pathway driven by hydrogen radicals ( • H) utilizing ethylene glycol (EG) as a hydrogen donor, which effectively bypasses the limitations of the conventional PCET process. By precisely modulating the valence states of Pd cocatalysts, we construct synergistic Pd 0 /Pd 2+ dual active sites, where Pd 2+ sites facilitate the dissociation of C‐H bonds from EG to supply adsorbed H species (*H), which are subsequently activated into highly reactive ","au":["Wei Wu","Keying Wu","Jielin Wang","Chunling Zhang","Yanjuan Sun","Jieyuan Li"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"氢自由基介导的 Pd 0 /Pd 2+ 双位点协同 NO 还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为 Pd 0 /Pd 2+ 双位点协同催化的 NO 还原反应。关键方法为利用乙二醇作为氢供体，通过氢自由基（•H）驱动反应，并精确调控 Pd 催化剂的价态。主要结果为 Pd 0 /Pd 2+ 双位点协同效应保证了 •H 的稳定产生，实现了 31.61 ± 1.61 mmol∙g cat −1 ∙h −1 的氨产率，NO 转化率为 91.54% ± 1.82%，氨选择性为 90.14% ± 1.38%。","ob":"光驱动","top":1},{"id":"10.64898/2026.06.01.728985","t":"ProNotch converts extracellular protease activity into programmable transcriptional outputs","u":"https://doi.org/10.64898/2026.06.01.728985","s":"预印本","d":"2026-06-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"ABSTRACT Synthetic receptors that convert extracellular protease activity into programmable transcriptional outputs would expand the toolkit of mammalian cell biology and cell engineering, yet modular platforms for directly coupling extracellular proteolysis to gene expression remain limited. Here we introduce ProNotch, a receptor architecture that harnesses protease-gated derepression of a mutant Notch1 negative regulatory region (NRR) to drive user-defined gene expression. ProNotch tethers destabilized NRR mutants to inhibitory anti-NRR single-chain variable fragments (scFvs) via protease-cleavable linkers. NRR engagement by high-affinity scFvs simultaneously rescues surface trafficking of mutant receptors and suppresses basal signaling until linker cleavage releases the inhibitory scFv module, permitting the destabilized NRR to initiate ligand-independent signaling. Linker substitutio","au":["Jeremy C. Tran","Christopher J. Kuffner","Aiden C. Reilly","Quan Le","John T. Ngo"],"o":"回填","why":["NRR"],"zt":"ProNotch 将细胞外蛋白酶活性转化为可编程转录输出","zb":"研究对象为 ProNotch 受体架构，该架构利用蛋白酶门控的突变 Notch1 负调控区（NRR）的解除抑制来驱动用户定义的基因表达。关键方法为将不稳定的 NRR 突变体通过蛋白酶可切割连接子连接到抑制性抗 NRR 单链可变片段（scFv）上。主要结果为 ProNotch 能够检测癌细胞系中的内源性 MMP-14 活性，并驱动 C3H/10T1/2 纤维母细胞的蛋白酶依赖性细胞状态转换。","pre":1},{"id":"10.1051/e3sconf/202671501011","t":"Optimization, Characterization, and Ammonia Nitrogen Adsorption Study of Novel PVA-SA-VMT Composite Carrier","u":"https://doi.org/10.1051/e3sconf/202671501011","s":"E3S Web of Conferences","d":"2026-06-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"To address the low ammonia nitrogen removal efficiency of traditional activated sludge processes under low-temperature conditions, this study developed a novel PVA-SA-VMT composite immobilization carrier using polyvinyl alcohol (PVA), sodium alginate (SA), and vermiculite (VMT). The optimal formulation (7% PVA, 2.5% SA, and 2% VMT) was determined through single-factor experiments. The results indicate that the composite carrier possesses high mechanical strength and excellent chemical stability, with a 24-hour TOC leaching amount of only 14.1 mg/L, 72% lower than that of the pure PVA-SA carrier. The interior of the composite carrier features a porous structure, which enhances the effective diffusion coefficient of ammonia nitrogen. Its adsorption mechanism follows second-order kinetics and the Freundlich isotherm, with vermiculite interlayer ion exchange being a spontaneous endothermic p","au":["Wenyuan Ye","Zhijun Ren"],"o":"回填","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1039/d6cc01707j","t":"Flash-Joule heating enables rapid solid-state synthesis of multinary chalcogenides: a case study on Cu 2 Mo 6 S 8","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6cc01707j","s":"Chemical Communications","d":"2026-06-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Achieving rapid, energy-efficient, and scalable synthesis of multinary chalcogenides remains challenging. Here, we demonstrate Flash-Joule Heating (FJH) for the ultrafast synthesis of the model Chevrel phase, Cu2Mo6S8. Step-heating offers controlled and phase-pure synthesis, while flash-heating enables sub-second reaction timescales at temperatures >2000 °C, highlighting complementary routes toward faster and more sustainable solid-state synthesis.","au":["Pranay Ninawe","Cocoro A. Nagasaka","Jesús M. Velázquez"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"闪光焦耳热实现多元硫族化合物快速固态合成：以Cu2Mo6S8为例","zb":"该研究展示了闪光焦耳热（FJH）用于模型切夫rel相Cu2Mo6S8的超快合成。分步加热提供可控和单相合成，而闪光加热在>2000 °C下实现亚秒反应时间尺度，突出了更快、更可持续固态合成的互补途径。","ob":"反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热"},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.5c08350","t":"Designing the protocols for Programmable Ammonia Catalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.5c08350","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2026-06-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Programmable catalysis can provide a more energy-efficient and cost-effective route to enhancing commercial ammonia production, a key process in the advancement of renewable energy technologies and the manufacture of fertilizers and basic chemicals. This work explores the computational discovery of optimal forcing protocols to drive such dynamic catalysis models. By employing matrix-free time-stepper methods, coupled with an optimization approach, that integrates Bayesian optimization with a Bayesian continuation strategy to efficiently discover the periodic steady states of such periodically forced systems, we enable the discovery of complex optimal catalyst strain waveforms, while ensuring robust solver convergence. We demonstrate the flexibility of our approach to discover optimized forcing protocols under varying physical constraints on strain modulation or other catalyst op","au":["Arjun Manoj","Yorgos M. Psarellis","Gerhard R. Wittreich","Michail E. Kavousanakis","Paul J. Dauenhauer","Ioannis G. Kevrekidis"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"设计可编程氨催化的协议","zb":"探索计算发现最优强制协议以驱动动态催化模型。采用无矩阵时间步进方法，结合贝叶斯优化和贝叶斯连续策略的优化方法，高效发现此类周期性受迫系统的周期稳态。展示方法在应变调制或其他催化剂操作参数的物理约束下发现优化强制协议的灵活性。这些协议的时间结构可能比简单的阶跃函数更复杂。通过图论分析研究催化动力学网络形成的动力学，以检测可能关联到整体性能降低的不希望的催化循环。","pp":"ChemRxiv","top":1},{"id":"10.7498/aps.75.20260042","t":"Theoretical Study on Catalytic Ammonia Synthesis by Triatomic Late Transition Metal Clusters with Sumanene Support","u":"https://doi.org/10.7498/aps.75.20260042","s":"Acta Physica Sinica","d":"2026-06-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"为开发高效绿色的电化学氮还原（NRR）电催化剂，本工作采用密度泛函理论，探究苏曼烯（C21H12）负载Fe3、Co3、Ni3三原子团簇的NRR催化机理，并与贵金属 Rh3、前过渡金属X3（X = Ti、Zr、V、Nb）体系对比.研究表明，C21H12的“电子供体-缓冲体”双重效应可调控团簇电子分布，使后过渡金属体系决速步能垒降低0.16 - 0.92 eV，其中C21H12-Co3酶促机理路径决速步能垒仅0.64 eV，性能优于所有前过渡金属体系，实现N2“活化与加氢”双重优化；且借助C21H12基底的模糊效应，可实现非贵金属对贵金属的有效替代.本研究揭示了苏曼烯与后过渡金属团簇的协同催化机制，为理性设计低成本、高活性NRR碳基基底电催化剂提供理论策略与实验指导.","au":["ZOU Haoyu","WANG ShuaiLi","XU Shaopeng","LI Linlin","CHEN Yan","LI Wei"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"苏马烯负载三原子后过渡金属团簇催化氨合成的理论研究","zb":"为开发高效绿色的电化学氮还原（NRR）电催化剂，本工作采用密度泛函理论，探究苏曼烯（C21H12）负载 Fe3、Co3、Ni3 三原子团簇的 NRR 催化机理，并与贵金属 Rh3、前过渡金属 X3（X = Ti、Zr、V、Nb）体系对比。研究表明，C21H12 的“电子供体-缓冲体”双重效应可调控团簇电子分布，使后过渡金属体系决速步能垒降低 0.16 - 0.92 eV，其中 C21H12-Co3 酶促机理路径决速步能垒仅 0.64 eV，性能优于所有前过渡金属体系，实现 N2“活化与加氢”双重优化；且借助 C21H12 基底的模糊效应，可实现非贵金属对贵金属的有效替代。本研究揭示了苏曼烯与后过渡金属团簇的协同催化机制，为理性设计低成本、高活性 NRR 碳基基底电催化剂提供理论策略与实验指导。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d6se00290k","t":"Plasma-coupled electrochemical ammonia synthesis using a solid acid electrochemical cell","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6se00290k","s":"Sustainable Energy & Fuels","d":"2026-06-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Plasma activation of N 2 promotes nitrogen binding to a molybdenum cathode and enables electrochemical reduction toproduction of NH 3 in a solid acid electrochemical cell.","au":["Dylan Bardgett","James Ho","Dayne F. Swearer","Sossina M. Haile"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"ob":"等离子体制氨｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.6c04372","t":"Improving the Longevity of Li-Mediated Ammonia Synthesis via Pulsed Electrolysis under High Current Densities","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c04372","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2026-06-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia synthesis via lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction reaction (Li-NRR) has emerged as a promising electrochemical alternative to the Haber–Bosch process, enabling decentralized, sustainable ammonia production under ambient conditions. Despite this, barriers linger in advancing its efficiency, reaction kinetics, and sustainable operational stability. In this context, we present a high-performance Li-NRR system characterized by a recyclable NiCu1Ru100h foam cathode and a pulsed-voltage operation within a single-cell reactor configuration. Constructed from a Ni foam coated with Cu and Ru, the NiCu1Ru100 electrode presents a large active surface area and catalytic spots, enabling strong lithium plating, nitridation, and protonation functions. Under potentiostatic operation at an optimal cathode potential (−12 V vs Ag/Ag+), the NiCu1Ru100 cathode attained an ammonia yield rate approachin","au":["Ojo Friday Abraham","Brenden M. Arndt","Reza Nazemi"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"通过脉冲电解在高压密度下提高锂介导的氨合成寿命","zb":"锂介导的氮还原反应（Li-NRR）合成氨作为一种有前景的电化学替代方案，能够在环境条件下实现分散式、可持续的氨生产，类似于哈伯-博施过程。尽管如此，提高其效率、反应动力学和可持续运行稳定性仍然存在障碍。在此背景下，我们提出了一种高性能的 Li-NRR 系统，其特点是可回收的 NiCu1Ru100h 泡沫阴极和单电池反应器配置中的脉冲电压操作。由涂有 Cu 和 Ru 的 Ni 泡沫制成的 NiCu1Ru100 电极具有大的活性表面积和催化位点，能够实现强烈的锂沉积、氮化和质子化功能。在最佳阴极电位（−12 V vs Ag/Ag+）下的恒电位操作下，NiCu1Ru100 阴极在电流密度 −80.5 mA cm–2 下实现了氨产率速率约为 24 nmol s–1 cmgeo –2，法拉第效率约为 9%，在恒电位循环后达到 20%。与传统的 H 电池相比，单隔室电池设计表明氨交叉和阳极氨氧化会显著","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Ru/钌体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.74038","t":"Recent Advances in Bimetallic Site Catalysts for Photocatalytic Ammonia Synthesis: Synergistic Effects and Design Strategies","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.74038","s":"Small","d":"2026-06-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT Photocatalytic ammonia synthesis employs photocatalysts to harness solar energy, driving the reduction of N 2 into NH 3 . In recent years, bimetallic active‐site catalysts have become a research focus in the photocatalytic nitrogen fixation field. The synergistic effects of bimetallic active sites are used to overcome limitations of single‐metal systems and optimize electronic structures. In addition to systematically summarizing the latest research advances in this field, this review is intended to delineate the potential design principles of bimetallic active sites for nitrogen fixation. These principles primarily encompass three core dimensions: the rational selection of metal element combinations, the adaptive matching of structural designs with supporting substrates, and the precise regulation of heterostructure construction processes. Notably, a central objective of this r","au":["Haibo Guo","Liying Wang","Jingjing Wang","Zhenzhu Cao","Yongfeng Zhang","Ziwei Tong"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"双金属位点催化剂在光催化氨合成中的应用进展：协同效应与设计策略","zb":"研究对象为光催化氨合成的双金属活性位点催化剂。关键方法为系统总结了该领域的最新研究进展，并阐述了双金属活性位点的潜在设计原则，包括金属元素组合的合理选择、与载体基体的结构设计匹配以及异质结构建过程的精确调控。主要结果为双金属活性位点的协同效应可以克服单金属体系的局限性，优化电子结构，并推动氮固定中的多步级联反应。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1002/ppap.70194","t":"From Plasma Modification to Plasma Catalysis: Discharge Time‐Controlled Tuning of Ni‐MOF‐74 for Enhanced Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/ppap.70194","s":"Plasma Processes and Polymers","d":"2026-06-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT This study employed argon plasma technology for the surface modification of Ni‐MOF‐74, systematically investigating the influence of different treatment durations on the material's structure and catalytic performance. It was found that Ni‐MOF‐74 (Ar 120 s) exhibited an outstanding synergistic effect in the plasma‐catalytic synthesis of ammonia. The ammonia synthesis rate increased to 10.77 mmol·g −1 ·h −1 , with a nitrogen conversion rate of 0.4% and an energy yield of 1.54 g·kWh −1 , representing a 1.9 times improvement compared to the pristine sample. Density functional theory (DFT) simulations revealed the mechanism of plasma‐induced defect formation at the electronic structure level, clarifying the structure−activity relationship between material modification and catalytic performance.","au":["Qinlong Song","Meiting Li","Bowen Liu","Zhongwei Liu","Haibao Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"从等离子体改性到等离子体催化：放电时间控制 Ni-MOF-74 的氨合成增强","zb":"研究对象为氩等离子体技术对 Ni-MOF-74 的表面改性，系统研究了不同处理时间对材料结构和催化性能的影响。关键方法为通过氩等离子体处理 Ni-MOF-74，并使用密度泛函理论（DFT）模拟等离子体诱导缺陷形成的机理。主要结果为 Ni-MOF-74 (Ar 120 s) 在等离子体催化氨合成中表现出优异的协同效应，氨合成速率达到 10.77 mmol∙g −1 ·h −1，氮转化率为 0.4%，能量产率为 1.54 g·kWh −1，比原始样品提高了 1.9 倍。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.1002/cssc.202502349","t":"Synthesis and Evaluation of Novel Ruthenium on Dysprosium‐Praseodymium Oxide Catalysts for Ammonia Synthesis and Decomposition in the Hydrogen Energy Vector Transition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cssc.202502349","s":"ChemSusChem","d":"2026-06-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Currently, there is a push to reduce reliance on hydrocarbon fuels for energy storage by using hydrogen carriers. One solution is ammonia; however, for use in the hydrogen economy, advances must be made for both ammonia synthesis and decomposition. We have studied several dysprosium‐doped praseodymium oxide supports, which were impregnated with ruthenium and tested for ammonia decomposition and ammonia synthesis activities. Some of these dysprosium‐praseodymium oxide supports significantly increased the rate of ammonia decomposition, while improving the stability of the catalyst when compared with the non‐doped samples. Moreover, an optimum was found close to 20 wt.% Dy 2 O 3 in the support, leading to a near tripling in activity for ammonia synthesis. Further, we have used X‐ray diffraction, Raman, UV–vis spectroscopy, temperature programed reduction, CO 2 ‐TPD, and CO‐diffuse reflectan","au":["Samuel M. Drummond","Jennifer Naglic","Thossaporn Onsree","Alexis Allegro","Sarah Stofik","Patrick Holcombe"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"新型钌基钇土-镨土催化剂的合成与评价：氢能转向中的氨合成与分解","zb":"研究对象为掺杂钇土的镨土载体负载钌催化剂，用于氨合成与分解。关键方法为通过浸渍法制备催化剂，并使用 X 射线衍射、拉曼光谱、紫外-可见光谱、程序升温还原、CO2-程序升温脱附和 CO-漫反射红外傅里叶变换光谱进行表征。主要结果为掺杂钇土的镨土载体显著提高了氨分解速率，并提升了催化剂稳定性；20 wt.% Dy 2O3 的载体使氨合成活性接近三倍。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.joc.6c00611","t":"Titanium-Mediated Deoxygenation of Sulfoxides into Sulfides with Ammonia Borane under Mild Conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.joc.6c00611","s":"The Journal of Organic Chemistry","d":"2026-06-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"A facile and selective room-temperature deoxygenation of both aromatic and aliphatic sulfoxides to thioethers has been achieved by using a TiCl4-AB reduction system in good to excellent yields. This first, practical titanium-mediated ammonia borane reduction process is compatible with various potentially sensitive functional groups. The successful execution of a gram-scale reaction confirms the practical utility of this reduction system. Moreover, its effective application to the synthesis and modification of diverse pharmaceutical molecules further demonstrates its versatility. This work also expands the application scope of ammonia borane in the reduction chemistry.","au":["Xincheng Liu","Junzheng Sun","Xuke Liu","Fengshi Sun","Huajie Du","Liyuan Fan"],"o":"回填","zt":"钛介导的亚砜在氨硼烷存在下温和条件下脱氧生成硫醚","zb":"使用 TiCl4-AB 还原系统实现了芳香族和脂肪族亚砜在室温下选择性地脱氧生成硫醚，产率良好至优异。首次实现了实用的钛介导的氨硼烷还原过程，与各种潜在敏感官能团兼容。成功执行的克级反应证实了该还原系统的实用性。此外，将其有效应用于多种药物分子的合成和改性，进一步证明了其多功能性。这项工作还扩展了氨硼烷在还原化学中的应用范围。","ob":"氨硼烷水解"},{"id":"10.3390/app16115481","t":"Selective Adsorption of Ammonia from Nitrogen and Hydrogen Using Zeolite 13X: Isotherm and Breakthrough Studies","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/app16115481","s":"Applied Sciences","d":"2026-06-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":25,"ab":"The separation of synthesised ammonia from unreacted nitrogen and hydrogen is a crucial step in producing high-purity ammonia and enabling the efficient recycling of unreacted gases in the ammonia synthesis process. The separation of ammonia from nitrogen and hydrogen was studied using zeolite 13X. Experiments were performed using a custom-designed experimental apparatus developed specifically for this study. Adsorption isotherm data for ammonia, hydrogen, and nitrogen were obtained over a temperature range of 293–313 K and pressures up to 5 bar. The results show that the adsorption capacity of zeolite 13X for ammonia is significantly higher than for nitrogen and hydrogen. This indicates a substantially stronger affinity toward ammonia molecules, enabling highly selective adsorption. The experimental isotherm data were successfully fitted using the Sips model, which accurately described ","au":["Babak Mokhtarani","Ali Salehabadi","Hamid Reza Rahimpour","Jafar Zanganeh","Behdad Moghtaderi"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"利用13X沸石从氮氢混合气中选择性吸附氨：等温线与突破实验研究","zb":"在293–313 K和5 bar条件下，通过实验装置研究了13X沸石对氨、氮和氢的吸附等温线及突破行为。结果表明，13X沸石对氨的吸附容量显著高于氮和氢，表现出极高的选择性，且氨突破时间随系统压力增加而延长。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨"},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.6864494","t":"Joule heating driven PVDF membrane with synergistically reinforced hydrophilic-oleophilic heterogeneous structure for high-efficiency demulsification","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6864494","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-06-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"AbstractHigh-viscosity oil-water emulsions pose catastrophic environmental and industrial hazards, as their rigid interfacial films and extreme stickiness severely paralyze traditional separation membranes through irreversible pore fouling. To overcome this, we developed an in-situ Joule-heating PVDF composite membrane with a hydrophilic-oleophilic heterogeneous structure via electrospinning and vacuum deposition. By incorporating PEG and a reduced graphene oxide (rGO) conductive network, the membrane exhibits rapid electrothermal responsiveness, reaching 178.8 ℃ within 15 s at 50 V. Rather than relying on passive sieving, demulsification is governed by an active physicochemical mechanism in which localized Joule heating sharply reduces heavy oil viscosity and dynamically lowers the thermodynamic wetting barrier, while the in-situ polarized PVDF matrix intensely compresses the electrical","au":["Shan Peng","Zhao Li","Huanhuan Dong","Xuechan Liu","Pengyuan Niu","Kadirov Sodikjon Uktamovich"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"焦耳热驱动PVDF膜具有协同增强的亲水-疏水异质结构用于高效除沫","zb":"该研究开发了一种原位焦耳热PVDF复合膜，具有亲水-疏水异质结构，通过静电纺丝和真空沉积制造。通过掺入PEG和还原氧化石墨烯（rGO）导电网络，膜表现出快速电热响应，在50 V下15 s内达到178.8 ℃。除沫由主动物理化学机制控制，其中局部焦耳热急剧降低重油粘度并动态降低热力学润湿势垒，而原位极化的PVDF基质强烈压缩带负电液滴的双电层（EDL）。这种热-电-结构协同作用从根本上打破了胶体热力学平衡，驱动小分散液滴快速碰撞和聚结成大油簇以实现瞬时分离，达到98.4%的除沫效率。此外，通过主动减轻界面胶体污染，该膜在100小时连续分离中保持约120 KL/(m2·h)的优异累积通量，为复杂、高粘度废水修复提供了一种高度耐用的范例。","pre":1},{"id":"10.1063/5.0337162","t":"Low-temperature synthesis of gallium nitride thin films using plasma-enhanced atomic layer deposition for nanoelectronics","u":"https://doi.org/10.1063/5.0337162","s":"APL Materials","d":"2026-06-01","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"In this paper, we report on the low-temperature synthesis of gallium nitride (GaN) thin films using plasma-enhanced atomic layer deposition and fabrication of AlN/GaN field-effect transistors for the application of microelectronics. Trimethylgallium [Ga(CH3)3] precursor and trimethylaluminum [Al2(C2H5)6] precursor were used as the Ga source and Al source, respectively, while ammonia (NH3) gas was used as the N source for the growth of semiconducting GaN and AlN thin films. High-resolution transmission electron microscopy was used to analyze the morphology of the GaN thin films, showing polycrystalline structures, and the x-ray diffraction was used to analyze the crystal structures of the GaN thin films, revealing that the GaN film has a dominant (002) hexagonal wurtzite crystal structure. X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy was used to investigate the atomic concentrations in the GaN film, ","au":["Zhigang Xiao","Baraka Chimba","Ibraheem Giwa","Fabian Sanchez","Kim Kisslinger","Fernando Camino"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"利用等离子体增强原子层沉积低温合成氮化镓薄膜用于纳米电子学","zb":"该研究报道了利用等离子体增强原子层沉积低温合成氮化镓（GaN）薄膜，并制造AlN/GaN场效应晶体管用于微电子应用。使用三甲基镓[Ga(CH3)3]和三甲基铝[Al2(C2H5)6]分别作为Ga源和Al源，氨（NH3）气作为N源。高分辨率透射电子显微镜分析显示GaN薄膜具有多晶结构，X射线衍射分析显示GaN薄膜具有主导的(002)六方纤锌矿晶体结构。X射线光电子能谱研究GaN薄膜的原子浓度，表明相对原子浓度与GaN的预期化学计量比密切相关。制造了AlN（4 nm）/GaN（9 nm）场效应晶体管，其中9 nm厚的GaN薄膜作为有源沟道材料，并制造了环形振荡器。制造的AlN/GaN晶体管表现出优异的n沟道场效应晶体管的电学性能，制造的振荡器每级传播延迟（tp）为6.3 ns。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzYzOTQzMDM1NQ==&mid=2247484135&idx=1","t":"⾼通量粉末原⼦层沉积（PALD）技术在工业催化剂中的应⽤","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzYzOTQzMDM1NQ%3D%3D&mid=2247484135&idx=1","s":"复纳原子制造","d":"2026-06-01","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:57Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"引言据统计，95% 的商业化学品在其制造过程的某个阶段需要使⽤⼀种或多种催化剂。多相催化剂对于⽯油炼制、塑料 引言 据统计，95% 的商业化学品在其制造过程的某个阶段需要使⽤⼀种或多种催化剂。多相催化剂对于⽯油炼制、塑料制造、⻝品和⽣物燃料⽣产以及许多化学制造⼯艺⾄关重要。 尽管许多工业催化过程已经取得了显著的进展，但这些催化材料的活性中心结构均质性较差，可能会导致不同的反应并产生不需要的副产物。此外，活性位点的不均匀性也使得催化性能与特定催化结构联系起来极其困难。因此，催化剂成分和结构的调控对提升催化剂性能有积极意义。 原子层沉积技术（ALD ）提供了⼀个创造表⾯活性催化剂位点的⽅式，能够创造出传统合成⽅法⽆法实现的⾼性能催化剂。该技术已被证明具有成本效益，并可以显著提升催化剂的性能。 PART 01 关于 ALD 以及 PALD 技术 原子层沉积（ALD）是一种气相催化剂合成技术，其原理基于两种前驱体蒸汽交替进样并在限制载体表面上发生分子层面上的“自”反应，实现目标材料在载体表面上的精准沉积。利用其分子层面上的“自”反应特性，并通过改变沉积周期数、层次和种类等方法可以实现对催化剂活性位结构的原子级精细控制，为人们提供了一种催化剂“自下而上”精细可控合成型的新策略。 ALD 工艺示意图 利用原子层沉积方法在粉末表面构筑涂层的方式被称为 —— 粉末 / 颗粒原子层沉积（PALD）。使用该法可以制备金属单质，金属氧化物，氮化物，硫化物，磷酸盐，多元化合物以及有机聚合物等涂层。Forge Nano 经过多年研发，已开发出成熟的商业化 PALD 工艺。 针对粉末材料较大的比表面积，传统的原子层沉积方法效率低，处理量少且包覆不均匀。采用流化床或旋转床的方式可以实现 ALD 工艺过程中的粉末分散，保证前驱体的有效利用，获得均匀保形的涂层。 PALD 能解决传统平面 ALD 造成的包覆不均匀缺陷 PART 02 PALD 技术提升催化剂性能 ALD 涂层的作⽤是多⽅⾯的，⼀⽅⾯可以提⾼催化剂的选择性和使⽤寿命，从⽽提⾼催化剂的性能。另⼀⽅⾯可有效减少⾦属催化剂的析出或烧结，从⽽避免","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["ALD"],"ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系、原子层沉积","wx":1,"mt":["10.3866/pku.whxb201804201"]},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.6c02142","t":"Metal Identity and Coordination Environment Modulate Single-Atom Catalyst Stability During Electrocatalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.6c02142","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2026-06-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Abstract A major hurdle to the implementation of single-atom catalysts (SACs) in real-world systems is a poor understanding of their stability under operating conditions, which is particularly relevant due to the high surface free energy of SACs. Here, we evaluated the aggregation behavior of a suite of SACs varied by metal identity (Fe, Co, Ni, and Cu) during electrocatalytic nitrate reduction using in situ X-ray absorption spectroscopy. The metal center had significant influence on reconstruction, where under identical applied reductive potentials, SACs underwent varying levels of reconstruction, ranging from no discernible change to complete reduction into metallic nanoparticles. Such in situ experiments revealed Cu SACs to be the most susceptible to aggregation, prompting a deeper investigation into how coordination environment (O-, B-, and N-graphene) affected Cu SAC aggregation. We","au":["Kali Rigby","Saerom Yu","Leslie Arrazolo","Denis Leshchev","Aidan Meese","Eli Stavitski"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzA3ODU2NTgzNA==&mid=2667030408&idx=1","t":"【动态】大连化物所开发高效氢化物负载原子级分散锰催化剂用于合成氨","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA3ODU2NTgzNA%3D%3D&mid=2667030408&idx=1","s":"中国科学院大连化物所","d":"2026-06-01","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:57Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"近日，大连化物所氢能与先进材料研究部氢化物能源化学研究中心（DNL1901 组群）陈萍研究员团队与四川大学袁绍军教授合作，开发出一种三元氢化物LiBaH3负载原子级分散前过渡金属锰（Mn）的高效合成氨催化剂。 近日，大连化物所氢能与先进材料研究部氢化物能源化学研究中心（DNL1901 组群）陈萍研究员团队与四川大学袁绍军教授合作，开发出一种三元氢化物LiBaH3负载原子级分散前过渡金属锰（Mn）的高效合成氨催化剂。在该催化剂上，氮气（N2）首先在单原子Mn位点进行非解离活化（*N2），随后通过LiBaH3中的负氢（H−）促进N2的解离，形成*N和*NH物种。该机制突破了传统过渡金属合成氨催化剂中普遍存在的“线性标度关系”（Linear Scaling Relations）限制，为设计高效的前过渡金属合成氨催化剂提供了新思路。 传统过渡金属合成氨催化剂通过N2解离活化后逐步加氢的路径，其性能受限于线性标度关系，导致催化活性呈现“火山型曲线”分布。前过渡周期金属（例如Mn）对N2的活化能力过强，使得生成的*N难以进一步加氢，因此文献中鲜有高效的前过渡金属合成氨催化剂报道。 在本工作中，研究团队首先将前过渡金属Mn以单原子形式负载，以减弱Mn对N2的活化强度，避免N2在Mn上直接解离生成过强的Mn-N键。同时，基于团队前期研究发现H−具有富电子和富氢的特性，有利于N2的活化和N-H的生成，团队选择三元氢化物LiBaH3作为负载单原子Mn的载体。 实验结果显示，Mn以单原子形式分散于催化剂中，同位素交换实验结合理论计算表明，N2通过非直接解离路径被活化。将LiBaH3–Mn1负载于高比表面积的MgO上（LiBaH3–Mn1/MgO）后，该催化剂在300℃下的合成氨速率是benchmark催化剂Cs–Ru/MgO的2.5倍，比传统体相MnNx催化剂高出两个数量级以上。此外，该催化剂设计策略具有拓展至其他前过渡周期金属的潜力。 陈萍研究团队长期聚焦氢化物在能源存储与转化方向的研究（Nature，2002；Nature，2023；Nature，2025），前期在氢化物介导氮气活化方向","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Ru/钌体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","wx":1},{"id":"10.1360/csb-2026-0253","t":"Synergistic effects of molybdenum and boron: regulating biological nitrogen fixation and promoteing fertilizer reduction and high yield","u":"https://doi.org/10.1360/csb-2026-0253","s":"Chinese Science Bulletin","d":"2026-06-01","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"我国是世界氮肥单位面积投入量最高的国家，氮肥过量施用造成一系列生态环境问题，减少氮肥施用是我国正在推动的一项重要农业政策。但是如何保障氮肥减施条件下的农作物氮素获取利用及产量维持对农业可持续发展至关重要。本研究选择我国南方典型喀斯特农田土壤，在减少氮肥施用的条件下，研究了钼硼微量元素添加对土壤养分有效性、土壤微生物和酶活、土壤自生固氮和氮素转化过程以及大豆（Glycine max）生物量和产量等的影响。采用随机区组实验设计，包含氮肥施用和微量元素添加两个因子；氮肥施用包含3个处理，分别为常规氮肥量（NF1，180 kg·N/(hm2·a)）、减施20%氮肥（NF2，144 kg·N /(hm2·a)）和不施氮肥（NF3，0 kg·N (hm2·a)）；微量元素添加包含4个处理，分别为不添加微量元素（0）、单加钼肥（Mo，100 g/hm2）、单加硼肥（B，1000 g/hm2）和钼硼配施（Mo+B）。研究结果表明，与常规施氮处理（NF1）相比，减施20%氮肥虽然显著降低了土壤硝态氮含量以及土壤硝化速率，但并未对大豆生物量和产量造成明显影响；不施氮肥显著降低了土壤铵态氮硝态氮含量及土壤硝化和反硝化速率，并降低了大豆地上生物量。添加钼硼微量元素显著提升了生物固氮速率、提高了土壤微生物量、N-乙酰-β-D-葡萄糖苷酶（N-acetyl-β-glucosaminidase，NAG）和亮氨酸氨基肽酶（leucine aminopeptidase，LAP）酶活性、土壤铵态氮和硝态氮含量及相关相关氮素转化速率，并显著提升了大豆生物量和产量。在减施20%氮肥处理下同时添加钼硼微量元素对土壤理化特性和大豆农艺性状的正面影响最强，单独添加钼比单独添加硼的效应稍强。以上结果说明在全国持续推进减施氮肥政策背景下，添加钼硼微量元素可以维持大豆产量和土壤质量，其机理是添加钼硼微量元素可以显著提升土壤生物固氮量，进而影响土壤氮转化过程并提高了土壤氮素有效性，最终促进了大豆生物量和产量的维持与提升。研究结果可以为我国化肥减量化行动和农业可持续发展提供科技支撑。","au":["Jie Zhao","Siqi Wang","Xionghui Liao","Jiangnan Li","Dan Xiao","Wei Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen fixation"],"ob":"生物固氮（非气相热催化）"},{"id":"10.1088/2058-6272/ae6b26","t":"Role of oxygen vacancies in plasma-catalytic ammonia synthesis over MnO x /MgAl layered double hydroxide","u":"https://doi.org/10.1088/2058-6272/ae6b26","s":"Plasma Science and Technology","d":"2026-06-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract This work systematically investigates the role of catalyst Oxygen Vacancies (O V ) in plasma-catalyzed ammonia synthesis over MnO x /MgAl Layered Double Hydroxide (LDH). Experiments show that the MnO x /LDH-500 catalyst (where -500 indicates calcination at 500 °C) with the highest surface oxygen vacancy concentration achieves an ammonia concentration of 12056 parts per million (ppm), which is 1.54 times that obtained with the bare LDH support possessing the lowest vacancy content, 1.27 times that of MnO x /LDH-300 and 1.33 times that of MnO x /LDH-700. Meanwhile, the energy yield increased significantly with increase in oxygen vacancies. The MnO x /LDH-500 catalyst achieved an energy yield of 1.10 g·kWh −1 , which is 1.54 times that of the bare LDH support. In situ optical diagnostics reveal that the key intermediate, excited N 2 , is first generated in the gas phase and then ad","au":["Kai 锴 LI 李","Jiale 佳乐 CHENG 程","Jiahao 佳豪 ZHANG 张","Fangjie 方洁 ZHOU 周","Ying 莹 LIU 刘","Yuzhen 玉珍 JIN 金"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.6c08744","t":"Light–Heat Interactions in Photothermal Ammonia Synthesis: A Diagnostic Framework for Mechanistic Interpretation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c08744","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2026-06-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Photothermal ammonia synthesis has emerged as a promising route to couple nitrogen fixation with solar energy, yet the mechanistic origin of light-assisted activity remains difficult to establish because illumination can contribute through heat generation, photoexcited carriers, or both simultaneously. This Review examines recent photothermal NH3 synthesis systems from a diagnostic perspective. Representative Ru- and Fe-based materials are discussed within four photothermal regimes: photo-driven thermocatalysis, photo-assisted thermocatalysis, photothermal co-catalysis, and thermally assisted photocatalysis; and are evaluated according to two complementary questions: what is the most likely dominant photothermal regime under the reported reaction conditions, and how strong is the mechanistic evidence supporting that assignment? Particular attention is given to temperature-normalized ligh","au":["Javier Fermoso","Meryem Farchado","Laura Collado"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"光-热相互作用在光热氨合成中：机理解释的诊断框架","zb":"光热氨合成作为一种将氮固定与太阳能耦合的潜在途径而出现，但光辅助活性的机理起源难以确定，因为照射可以通过热产生、光激发载体或两者同时实现。本综述从诊断的角度考察了最近的光热 NH3 合成系统。代表性的 Ru-和 Fe-基材料在四个光热体系中讨论：光驱动热催化、光辅助热催化、光热共催化和热辅助光催化；并根据两个互补问题进行评估：在报道的反应条件下最有可能的占主导地位的光热体系是什么，以及支持该分配的机理证据有多强？特别关注温度归一化的光/暗比较、表观活化能和反应级数分析、波长和强度依赖的活性、同位素验证、原位光谱学以及限制局部热梯度的方法。在最强的情况下，当光响应功能性与在催化活性界面处具有动力学相关性的基元步骤重叠时，最清晰的机理效应会出现。分析还表明，光热共催化应比其他体系更严格地分配，并且仅在同时和协同的热光化学贡献得到充分稳健的机理证据支持时才应分配。通过这种基于证据的框架比较 Ru","ob":"光催化固氮；涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1002/adsc.70471","t":"Recent Advances in the Synthesis of Nitrogen‐Containing Heterocycles from o ‐Aminobenzamides: Reactions and Mechanism","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adsc.70471","s":"Advanced Synthesis & Catalysis","d":"2026-06-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Nitrogen‐containing heterocycles constitute a pivotal class of core structural scaffolds, notable for their significant biological activities and functional versatility. Consequently, the development of efficient, green, and atom‐economical methodologies for the construction of N ‐heterocycles represents a central pursuit in modern synthetic chemistry. o ‐Aminobenzamides have emerged as versatile platform molecules in this context. Their molecular architecture, featuring a nucleophilic amino group, an electrophilic amide carbonyl, and a readily modifiable aromatic ring, enables efficient construction of CN and NN bonds via condensation and cyclization reactions, rendering them key starting materials for accessing diverse N ‐heterocycles. This review systematically summarizes research advances from the past decade (2015–2025) on the synthesis of N ‐heterocyclic systems including quinazo","au":["Xiaofeng Hua","Nina Cheng","Shiwei Zhu","Yatang Wang","Yingying Wu","Wei Guo"],"o":"回填","zt":"从 o-苯甲酰胺胺合成含氮杂环：反应和机理","zb":"含氮杂环构成一类核心结构骨架，因其显著的生物活性和功能多样性而备受关注。因此，开发高效、绿色、原子经济的 N-杂环构建方法代表了现代合成化学的一个中心追求。o-苯甲酰胺胺已作为多功能平台分子而出现。其分子结构，具有亲电的氨基、亲核的酰胺羰基和易于修饰的芳香环，通过缩合和环化反应有效地构建 CN 和 NN 键，使其成为获取多种 N-杂环的关键起始材料。本综述系统地总结了过去十年（2015–2025）关于从 o-苯甲酰胺胺与各种“C1 来源”（例如醛、醇、酮、羧酸、酯）、“N1 来源”（例如硝甲烷、叔丁基亚硝酸、硝酸盐）和其他功能试剂合成的 N-杂环体系的研究进展，包括喹唑啉酮、喹唑啉二酮、苯二氮䓬二酮、吲哚酮和苯并三嗪酮。讨论重点在于反应途径的设计策略和支撑关键环化步骤的机理，例如分子内亲核进攻、氧化环化和自由基过程。对不同催化体系（包括过渡金属催化、无催化剂条件、光催化、电化学合成和 ","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.chempr.2025.102884","t":"Ammonia synthesis at metallic Li/Ru interfaces under ambient conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.chempr.2025.102884","s":"Chem","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":32,"ab":"","au":["Ying Hou","Wei Hu","Yunchuan Tu","Hao Lei","Wei Wei","Hao Li"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"室温下金属 Li/Ru 界面氨合成","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系","bt":1,"top":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jece.2026.122360","t":"Superoxide dismutase/peroxidase-like MoS2 quantum dots enhance ammonia synthesis by Klebsiella pasteurii","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2026.122360","s":"Journal of Environmental Chemical Engineering","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Molybdenum disulfide quantum dots (MoS2 QDs) are recognized as noteworthy antibacterial nanomaterials owing to their inherent peroxidase-like properties. In this study, we successfully enhanced the synthesis of ammonia by Klebsiella pasteurii Sb-24 using MoS2 QDs and elucidated the underlying mechanism. Our investigation revealed that the synthesized MoS2 QDs exhibit superoxide dismutase/peroxidase-like activities and when incorporated into K. pasteurii Sb-24, they effectively mitigate intracellular levels of reactive oxygen species. Moreover, the MoS2 QDs nanozymes accelerated the logarithmic growth phase of Klebsiella cells, improved cellular permeability, and enhanced nitrogen fixation activity. Through optimization, the biohybrid system achieved a peak NH4+ production of 0.42±0.01 μg·mL-1, surpassing untreated cells by over 3.2 times. Further investigations unveiled that MoS2 QDs nan","au":["Meng-Xin Zhao","Si-Ru Chen","Shan-Shan Hu","Ting-Ting Liu","Jia-Le Teng","Ya-Wen Yu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"类 SOD/POD MoS2 量子点增强 Klebsiella 氨合成","zb":"利用具有类超氧化物歧化酶/过氧化物酶活性的 MoS2 量子点增强 Klebsiella pasteurii 的氨合成。该生物杂化系统在优化后实现了 0.42±0.01 μg·mL-1 的 NH4+ 产率，比未处理细胞高出 3.2 倍。","pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.155679","t":"Low-activation-energy ammonia synthesis over Ru/CexLa1-xOy via solid solution–induced oxygen vacancy formation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.155679","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Javier Arroyo-Caire","Edgar S. Duran-Uribe","Mayra Anabel Lara-Angulo","Manuel Antonio Diaz-Perez","Antonio Sepúlveda-Escribano","Juan Carlos Serrano-Ruiz"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"通过固溶体诱导氧空位形成的 Ru/CexLa1-xOy 低活化能氨合成","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.colsurfa.2026.140069","t":"Single-atom Ti doping on boron nitride monolayers with different defects as an efficient catalyst for nitrogen fixation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.colsurfa.2026.140069","s":"Colloids and Surfaces A: Physicochemical and Engineering Aspects","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Xuyun Zhang","Keqi Ding","Xiaoting Xu","Yong Wang","Qingxin Kang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen fixation"],"zt":"不同缺陷硼氮化单原子 Ti 掺杂用于高效固氮","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2025.126374","t":"Cs-promoted Fe–Co–Mo–N quaternary nitride with enhanced surface activity and thermal stability for ammonia synthesis under mild conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2025.126374","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Danim Yun","Mamoona Waris","Anh Ngoc T. Cao","Tae Yong Kim","Jeong Yeon Kim","Gwang-Nam Yun"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Cs 掺杂 Fe–Co–Mo–N 四元氮化物在温和条件下氨合成","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.oceram.2026.100986","t":"Comparative study of ultrafast high-temperature sintering (UHS) configurations for accelerated synthesis of (MgCoNiCuZn)O high-entropy oxide","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.oceram.2026.100986","s":"Open Ceramics","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Ultrafast high-temperature sintering (UHS) was employed to synthesize (MgCoNiCuZn)O in just 60 s using three different heating configurations: Standard with direct graphite felt contact (S-UHS), Alumina-separated (A-UHS), and Non-Contact (NC-UHS). All samples developed the targeted rock-salt phase, though their density, oxygen retention, and chemical uniformity varied with the UHS configuration. The NC-UHS required higher electrical power to reach comparable temperatures and showed the most pronounced oxygen loss, consistent with stronger carbon-assisted reduction conditions near the felt. The A-UHS demonstrated the highest uniformity and oxygen retention due to minimized contact with carbon. For comparison, S-UHS achieved the highest density but showed partial surface reduction. Surface impurities followed a trend of S-UHS < A-UHS < NC-UHS. These results suggest that the thermal and che","au":["Erik Ščasnovič","Liying Chen","Marek Rotter","Václav Pouchlý","Salvatore Grasso"],"o":"回填","why":["ultrafast high-temperature sintering"],"zt":"超快速高温烧结 (UHS) 配置的对比研究用于加速合成 (MgCoNiCuZn)O 高熵氧化物","zb":"采用三种加热配置（S-UHS、A-UHS、NC-UHS）在60 s内合成了(MgCoNiCuZn)O高熵氧化物。NC-UHS碳辅助还原条件更强，氧损失最明显；A-UHS与碳接触最少，均匀性和氧保留最高；S-UHS密度最高但表面部分还原。结果表明UHS过程中的热化学接触显著影响加热效率、氧化还原过程和相纯度。"},{"id":"10.1016/j.memsci.2026.125562","t":"Gas Permeation Properties of Amorphous Zeolitic Imidazolate Framework Membranes Made by Atomic/Molecular Layer Deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.memsci.2026.125562","s":"Journal of Membrane Science","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Amorphous metal-organic framework (MOF) membranes are desirable because they may retain some of the molecular sieving properties of their crystalline counterparts while being free of grain boundary defects, which often hinder the consistent achievement of high membrane performance. However, current methods, like melting and compression, for fabricating amorphous MOF membranes involve complex multi-step processes that can be challenging to scale. Here, we utilize atomic/molecular layer deposition (ALD/MLD) of diethylzinc (DEZ) and 2-methylimidazole (2mIm) to directly synthesize ultrathin amorphous zeolitic imidazolate framework (aZIF) deposits in γ-alumina-coated α-alumina supports. As the number of ALD/MLD cycles increased from 10 to 50, gas permeances decreased while ideal selectivities increased. Mixture separation factors for C3H6/C3H8, CO2/N2, and H2/C3H8 as high as 4, 37, and 194, r","au":["Prince Kumar Verma","Pragya Parihar","Yurun Miao","Danlin Chen","Jingzhi Xue","Eliseo Perez Gomez"],"o":"回填","why":["ALD"],"zt":"原子/分子层沉积制备的非晶态沸石咪唑酯骨架膜气体渗透性能","zb":"利用原子/分子层沉积 (ALD/MLD) 的二乙锌 (DEZ) 和 2-甲基咪唑 (2mIm) 直接在 γ-氧化铝涂层 α-氧化铝载体上合成超薄非晶态沸石咪唑酯骨架 (aZIF) 沉积。随着 ALD/MLD 周期从 10 增加到 50，气体渗透率降低而理想选择性增加。C3H6/C3H8、CO2/N2 和 H2/C3H8 的混合物分离因子分别高达 4、37 和 194。在 200 °C 和 2.5 bar 下，H2 和 C3H8 等摩尔进料时，H2/C3H8 混合物分离因子为 185，H2 渗透率为约 4.15x10-8 mol/m2-s-Pa (124 GPU)。此外，膜在 25 °C 和 1 bar 下实现 CO2/N2 混合物分离因子为 37，CO2 渗透率为 3.96x10-8 mol/m2-s-Pa (118 GPU)。","pp":"ChemRxiv"},{"id":"10.1016/j.matdes.2026.116126","t":"Additive manufacturing of polymer-derived SiOC(Fe) ceramic composites as a catalyst support exhibiting magnetic heating capability","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.matdes.2026.116126","s":"Materials & Design","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Additive manufacturing (AM) of advanced functional ceramics using preceramic polymers (PCPs) is gaining attention due to its processability and tailorable properties. A photosensitive resin with iron-modified polysiloxanes was developed for vat photopolymerization (VPP) to create porous SiOC(Fe) catalytic supports with magnetic heating capability. Ferric acetylacetonate and ferrocene were examined as iron precursors, leading to the formation of Fe-based magnetic particles (α-Fe, Fe 3 C, Fe x Si y ) within the silicon oxycarbide (SiOC) ceramic matrix after pyrolysis at 800 to 1500 °C. Depending on the Fe-based precursor used and the applied pyrolysis temperature, the obtained monoliths exhibited magnetic nanoparticle (MNP) contents ranging from 0.9 to 7.9 wt%, with particle sizes from 17 to 96 nm. The monolithic catalyst supports fabricated from ferric acetylacetonate modified PCP-based r","au":["Milan Vukšić","Thomas Konegger","Martin Schwentenwein","Sašo Gyergyek","Anja Sedminek","Sandra Drev"],"o":"回填","why":["magnetic heat"],"zt":"通过增材制造制备具有磁加热能力的聚合物衍生 SiOC(Fe) 陶瓷复合材料催化剂载体","zb":"开发了一种含铁改性聚硅氧烷的光敏树脂，通过光固化成型制备具有磁加热能力的多孔SiOC(Fe)催化剂载体。在800至1500 °C热解后形成Fe基磁性颗粒(α-Fe, Fe3C, FexSy)，质量分数0.9至7.9 wt%，粒径17至96 nm。以铁乙酰丙酮改性树脂为原料、900 °C热解的样品在60 kA·m–1磁场下加热至200 °C，显示出最高的比吸收率。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jiec.2025.11.035","t":"A review of flash Joule heating for the sustainable synthesis of graphene: principles, development, and applications in energy storage","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jiec.2025.11.035","s":"Journal of Industrial and Engineering Chemistry","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Xiaoyan Ma","Yu Zhang","Xiuxiu Zhang","Jianchao Wang","Weijun Peng","Yijun Cao"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"闪焦耳热在可持续制备石墨烯中的应用：原理、发展与储能应用综述","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jece.2026.123061","t":"Electrified reverse water-gas shift via direct Joule heating of Mo-based conductive catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2026.123061","s":"Journal of Environmental Chemical Engineering","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Yunfeng Jiang","Yingyu Ren","Di Wang","Yihai Wu","Lei Zheng","Jun Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"Mo 基导电催化剂直接焦耳热电解制逆水煤气变换","ob":"逆水煤气变换｜反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jece.2026.122504","t":"Rapid joule heating synthesis of oxygen-vacancy-rich high-entropy oxide as a high-performance electrocatalyst for OER","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2026.122504","s":"Journal of Environmental Chemical Engineering","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Li Wu","Ziheng Bian","Jiaming Zhao","Yaqi Yang","Lili Guan","Yarong Huang"],"o":"回填","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"快速焦耳热合成富氧空位的高熵氧化物作为高效氧析出电催化剂","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jallcom.2026.188454","t":"Inter-ligand reaction-mediated atomic layer deposition of Ru-incorporated MoCx films for dual-function copper diffusion barriers and seed layers","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jallcom.2026.188454","s":"Journal of Alloys and Compounds","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Ji Sang Ahn","Min Seok Kim","Kazuharu Suzuki","Jeong Hwan Han"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"配体反应介导的原子层沉积 Ru 掺杂 MoCx 薄膜用于双功能铜扩散屏障和种子层","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Ru/钌体系、原子层沉积","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jaap.2026.107759","t":"Graphene-structured biochar produced via Joule heating enhances soil functions, microbial communities, and plant growth","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jaap.2026.107759","s":"Journal of Analytical and Applied Pyrolysis","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Xiaofei Mao","Peilong Zhao","Mingyang Liu","Jiashu Song","Luxue Cui","Man Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"焦耳热制备的石墨烯结构生物炭增强土壤功能、微生物群落和植物生长","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.155494","t":"Atomic layer deposition of Pd and SnO2 on TiO2 nanotubes: A route to efficient hydrogen evolution","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.155494","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Stefania Wolff","Katarzyna Grochowska","Elissa Makhoul","Justyna Gumieniak","Agnieszka Kramek","Karol Załęski"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"Pd 和 SnO2 在 TiO2 纳米管上的原子层沉积：高效制氢的途径","ob":"析氢反应；涉及原子层沉积","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.155354","t":"Electrocatalysts obtained by atomic layer deposition technology for PEM fuel cells and electrolysers","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.155354","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Silvia-Iustina Pintilie","Claudia Cobzaru","Mihaela Iordache","Adriana Marinoiu"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积技术制备的用于质子交换膜燃料电池和电解槽的电催化剂","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.colsurfa.2026.139945","t":"Flash joule heating synthesis of N-P Co-doped hierarchical biochar for ultrafast methylene blue adsorption","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.colsurfa.2026.139945","s":"Colloids and Surfaces A: Physicochemical and Engineering Aspects","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Xin Chen","Zhaoyu Wang","Zhi Gong","Qiwen Chen","Xue Wang","Cong Gu"],"o":"回填","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"闪焦耳热合成 N-P 共掺杂分级生物炭用于超快亚甲基蓝吸附","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ceramint.2026.04.328","t":"Microstructure and crystallographic orientation relationships of Al2O3–Y3Al5O12 eutectic ceramic prepared by rapid heating of combustion synthesis chemical furnace","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ceramint.2026.04.328","s":"Ceramics International","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Aiyang Wang","Li Zhu","Shulin Wang","Man Xu","Qianglong He","Bingtian Tu"],"o":"回填","why":["rapid heating"],"zt":"燃烧合成化学炉快速加热制备的 Al2O3–Y3Al5O12 共晶陶瓷的微观结构和晶体学取向关系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ceramint.2026.04.094","t":"Rapid Joule heating fabrication and properties of LaB6 dispersion strengthened silver matrix electrical contact materials","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ceramint.2026.04.094","s":"Ceramics International","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:23:23Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Zijue Zhou","Jianshuo Liu","Ziyue Liu","Shuai Zhang","Chenchen Ye","Yifei Wu"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"快速焦耳热制备及性能的 LaB6 颗粒强化银基电接触材料","ob":"材料制备/结构调控","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.176741","t":"Decoupled regulation of kinetics and intrinsic activity via atomic layer deposition-guided spinel reconstruction of cobalt phosphate aerogels for oxygen evolution","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.176741","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Younghun Kim","Dong-Eun Kim","Sang-Hyun Kim","Jiseung Kim","Wonjun Lee","Hyun Jee Heo"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"通过原子层沉积引导的钴磷酸气凝胶尖晶石重构，实现动力学和本征活性的解耦调控用于析氧","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.176655","t":"Electrifying catalysis: Joule heating-driven advanced materials for volatile organic compound oxidation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.176655","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Kumar Vikrant","Yongbiao Hua","Dimitrios A. Giannakoudakis","Quan-Doan Mai","Anh-Tuan Le","Manh-Huong Phan"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"焦耳热驱动的电催化氧化挥发性有机化合物","ob":"其他催化反应","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.176432","t":"An Arrayed Carbon-Fiber Reactor for Enhanced Yield of Acetylene from Methane Pyrolysis by Pulsed Joule-heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.176432","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Mingze Chen","Yue Pan","Lu Yao","Chi Zhang","Songyuan Ding"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule-heat"],"zt":"阵列碳纤维反应器通过脉冲焦耳热提升甲烷热解乙炔产率","ob":"反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热","bt":1,"pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcata.2026.120978","t":"Construction of Co6Mo6C2/Mo2C/Co/CC heterostructure via ultra-fast Joule heating for oxygen evolution reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcata.2026.120978","s":"Applied Catalysis A: General","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Yaqi Yang","Fuxing Xu","Li Wu","Lili Guan","Yarong Huang","Xiwen Song"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"通过超快焦耳热构建Co6Mo6C2/Mo2C/Co/CC异质结构用于析氧反应","ob":"焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apsusc.2026.166423","t":"Efficient nitrogen reduction on indium nitride–supported transition-metal single-atom catalysts: mechanistic insights from first-principles analysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apsusc.2026.166423","s":"Applied Surface Science","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Marwa Tariq","Hsin-Tsung Chen"],"o":"回填","zt":"氮还原在铟氮化物负载的过渡金属单原子催化剂上的高效性：基于第一性原理分析的机理洞察","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.aoas.2026.100413","t":"Postponing nitrogen application under nitrogen reduction increased the yield of Tartary buckwheat","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.aoas.2026.100413","s":"Annals of Agricultural Sciences","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"Clarifying the effect of postponing nitrogen application on yield under nitrogen reduction is of great importance for increasing yield and optimizing the nitrogen application system of Tartary buckwheat. A two-year field experiment with six nitrogen treatments, including a conventional fertilizer application pattern (CK) and five treatments under 20% nitrogen reduction, with 0% (NP1), 10% (NP2), 20% (NP3), 30% (NP4), and 40% (NP5) postponed of nitrogen amounts, topdressing at the flowering stage, was conducted on the high-yielding Tartary buckwheat variety ‘Daku 1’. Compared with CK, the NP4 treatment significantly increased osmotic adjustment substance content, antioxidant enzyme– and nitrogen metabolism–related activities, dry matter accumulation, and yield. Compared with CK, the NP2, NP3, NP4, and NP5 treatments increased yield by 8.09%, 22.06%, 66.91%, and 31.62%, respectively, where","au":["Peiying Wang","Song Wu","Yuanxian Wu","Fang Cai","Kaifeng Huang"],"o":"回填","zt":"氮肥减量施用提高了苦荞产量","zb":"通过两年田间试验研究了氮减量下推迟施氮对苦荞产量的影响。结果表明，推迟施氮能显著提高产量，其中NP4处理产量比常规施肥增加66.91%。"},{"id":"10.26599/pom.2026.9140116","t":"Rational design of hexanuclear zirconium-cluster-based porphyrinic metal-organic frameworks for high-efficiency electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.26599/pom.2026.9140116","s":"Polyoxometalates","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Green ammonia (NH3) synthesis is pivotal for sustainable agriculture and hydrogen energy carriers, yet challenges persist in direct electrocatalytic nitrate reduction (e-NO3RR) under neutral conditions, including competing hydrogen evolution and sluggish reaction kinetics. Herein, we engineer a series of transition metal-porphyrin MOFs (NU-902 (M), M = Fe, Co, Ni, Cu) via coordination between metalated tetrakis(4-carboxyphenyl)porphyrin (M-TCPP) and Zr6O4(OH)4(CO2)12 clusters, constructing a hierarchical mesoporous architecture. Crucially, NU-902 (Cu) achieves a record Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 71.65% with an NH3 yield rate of 13.76 mg h-1 mg-1cat. at −0.9 V vs. RHE, outperforming similar frameworks based on Fe (14.01 mg h-1 mg-1cat. 63.83%), Co (9.51 mg h-1 mg-1cat. 71.51%), and Ni (2.40 mg h-1 mg-1cat. 67.99%). Moreover, the FE of NU-902 (Cu) remains above 65% after 500 cycles, and P","au":["Liqing Li","Xinming Wang","Jian Li","Yufang Wang","Haijun Pang","Huiyuan Ma"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"基于六核锆簇的卟啉金属有机框架的合理设计用于高效电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为电催化硝酸盐还原为氨，关键方法为设计六核锆簇基卟啉金属有机框架，主要结果为NU-902 (Cu)实现了71.65%的法拉第效率和13.76 mg h-1 mg-1cat的氨产率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.26599/nre.2025.9120183","t":"Recent advances in high performance Fe-based catalysts for electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction to ammonia: A review","u":"https://doi.org/10.26599/nre.2025.9120183","s":"Nano Research Energy","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia (NH3) is a versatile chemical, critical to agriculture and various industries. Today, ammonia is further regarded as one of the most promising carbon-free energy carriers in the net-zero hydrogen economy. Traditionally, the energy-intensive Haber–Bosch process has been mainly used for producing ammonia by the thermocatalytic conversion of high-purity nitrogen and hydrogen, while also contributing to major greenhouse gas emissions due to dependence on fossil fuels. The electrochemical nitrogen reduction reaction (e-NRR) is a highly promising and attractive alternative roadmap to achieving clean and sustainable ammonia production under conditions that are sufficiently mild to be fully powered by renewable energy sources. However, the industrial adoption of e-NRR is currently hindered by its low ammonia yields and poor selectivity resulting from the limited reactivity of ni","au":["Abdulmalik Aminu","Janah Shaya","Maguy Abi Jaoude","Bilal Masood Pirzada","Ibrahim Yildiz","Ahsanulhaq Qurashi"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1109/icops53334.2026.11660297","t":"Nanosecond Pulsed Discharges Over Water for Atmospheric-Pressure Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1109/icops53334.2026.11660297","s":"2026 IEEE International Conference on Plasma Science (ICOPS)","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia is a critical chemical for global fertilizer production and is increasingly explored as a carbon-free fuel and energy carrier, motivating the development of sustainable and decentralized synthesis routes. The conventional Haber-Bosch process, while industrially dominant, is energy-intensive, carbon-emissive, and inherently centralized, limiting its applicability for distributed ammonia production. Nanosecond pulsed plasma based production offers a promising alternative[1].","au":["Jayani H. Edirisooriyage","Olga Pakhomova","Chunqi Jiang"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"纳秒脉冲放电在水上用于大气压氨合成","zb":"研究对象为氨合成，关键方法为纳秒脉冲放电，主要结果为在大气压条件下实现了氨合成。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.1109/icops53334.2026.11660084","t":"Data Driven Analysis of Non-Equilibrium Plasma Characteristics Governing Ammonia Synthesis Performance","u":"https://doi.org/10.1109/icops53334.2026.11660084","s":"2026 IEEE International Conference on Plasma Science (ICOPS)","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Nonthermal plasma provides a unique environment for activating nitrogen molecules at low gas temperatures, offering new possibilities for ammonia synthesis beyond conventional thermal routes. However, the energy cost varies widely among different plasma devices, and the underlying controlling mechanisms remain unclear [1]–[2]. In this work, a comparative data-driven study is conducted to clarify how key non-equilibrium plasma characteristics influence both the production rate and the energy cost of ammonia synthesis in four typical atmospheric-pressure nonequilibrium plasma sources. Experimental datasets from gliding arc, microwave plasma, DBD, and APPJ are integrated into a machine learning regression framework to establish quantitative relationships between plasma temperature parameters and ammonia yield and energy cost. Feature analysis shows that vibrational excitation is the dominan","au":["Shuning Yang","Lanlan Nie","Ali Mesbah","Xinpei Lu"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"非平衡等离子体特性对氨合成性能的主导作用的数据驱动分析","zb":"研究四种典型大气压非平衡等离子体源（滑弧、微波等离子体、DBD 和 APPJ）中非平衡等离子体特性对氨合成速率和能耗的影响。实验数据集成到机器学习回归框架中，建立等离子体温度参数与氨产率和能耗的定量关系。特征分析表明，振动激发是等离子体辅助氨合成的主导反应路径。所有四种等离子体系统中，振动温度解释了超过一半的合成性能变化。电子能量分布计算表明，在 20 至 100 Td 的减电场范围内，大部分电子能量转移至分子振动激发，确立该路径为主要能量通道。提高电子温度增强电子轰击激发和离解，使能量沉积转向高能通道，削弱了振动激活的选择性，尤其在滑弧和微波等离子体系统中。相比之下，旋转温度主要影响高温下氨形成的可逆性，其中提高气体温度促进氨分解并加速振动激发。","ob":"氨分解制氢｜电场辅助，未证实焦耳供热"},{"id":"10.1016/s1872-2067(26)65038-3","t":"Species heterogeneity for efficient electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/s1872-2067(26)65038-3","s":"Chinese Journal of Catalysis","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Kefu Zhang","Luxiao Zhang","Jianyi Chu","Cenyu Mei","Siyuan Liu","Guilan Fan"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"物种异质性用于高效的电化学硝酸盐还原为氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/s1872-2067(26)64978-9","t":"Homojunction-driven d-band engineering in NiMoO4 for selective electrochemical nitrogen reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/s1872-2067(26)64978-9","s":"Chinese Journal of Catalysis","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yuxi Ren","Baorong Xu","Yu Jin","Hang Xiao","Ranran Niu","Wei Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["electrochemical nitrogen reduction"],"zt":"同质结驱动的 NiMoO4 d 带工程用于选择性电化学氮还原为氨","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.xcrp.2026.103333","t":"Photothermally enhanced ammonia synthesis and Zn-nitrite battery performance enabled by bimetallic Cu-Ni synergy","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.xcrp.2026.103333","s":"Cell Reports Physical Science","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electroreduction of nitrite (NO 2 − ) to ammonia (NH 3 ) offers dual benefits for resource valorization and wastewater remediation but suffers from limitations in active hydrogen (∗H) management and external energy utilization. Here, we report a photothermal electrocatalyst of Cu-Ni-FeOOH for efficient NO 2 − -to-NH 3 conversion. Experimental and theoretical investigations reveal that Ni centers promote water dissociation, supplying ∗H to adjacent Cu sites for NO 2 − hydrogenation. The catalyst achieves a high Faradaic efficiency of 98.6% with an NH 3 yield of 8.86 mg h −1 cm −2 at −0.1 V vs. reversible hydrogen electrode (RHE). When exposed to near-infrared light irradiation, the in situ -generated thermal energy further enhances the electrocatalytic activity for NO 2 − reduction and improves the performance of a Zn-nitrite battery. This work provides a strategic direction for susta","au":["Bin Chen","Jing Jiang","Qiancao Liu","Aike Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"光热增强的氨合成和 Zn-亚硝酸盐电池性能由双金属 Cu-Ni 协同效应实现","zb":"研究 Cu-Ni-FeOOH 光热电催化剂用于高效的亚硝酸盐还原为氨。Ni 中心促进水裂解，为相邻 Cu 位点提供 *H 进行亚硝酸盐加氢。催化剂在 -0.1 V vs. RHE 下实现 98.6% 法拉第效率和 8.86 mg h−1 cm −2 的氨产率。近红外光照射下，原位产生的热能进一步增强了亚硝酸盐还原的电催化活性，并提升了 Zn-亚硝酸盐电池性能。","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.surfin.2026.109275","t":"Dual p-block atoms anchored on N-doped graphene: Efficient transition-metal-free catalysts for nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.surfin.2026.109275","s":"Surfaces and Interfaces","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) is an efficient strategy to mitigate the nitrate-induced pollution and generate high-value product as a substitute for Haber-Bosch process. However, this process face challenges due to the lack of effective electrocatalysts and the limited understanding of the mechanism that drives NO 3 RR. Owing to more active sites, high selectivity and stability, double atom catalysts (DACs) outperform the single-atom counterparts. Herein, the catalytic performance of double p -block atoms embedded in nitrogen-doped graphene for the nitrate reduction reaction is investigated using density functional theory (DFT). A four-step screening process were conducted to evaluate stability, NO 3 - adsorption strength, selectivity and catalytic efficiency. Among the 10 candidates, BAl, BIn, AlGa, AlIn, GaGa and GaIn@N 6 -G stood out with low limiting potentials of -0.50, -0.25","au":["Md Tarikal Nasir","Qingchao Fang","Yun Han","Dimuthu Wijethunge"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"双 p 区原子锚定在氮掺杂石墨烯上：高效的过渡金属催化剂用于硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为氮掺杂石墨烯负载的双 p 区原子催化剂，用于硝酸盐还原反应。采用密度泛函理论（DFT）进行筛选，评估了 10 种候选材料的稳定性、NO3-吸附强度、选择性和催化效率。BAl、BIn、AlGa、AlIn、GaGa 和 GaIn@N6-G 表现优异，其极限电位分别为 -0.50、-0.25、-0.47、-0.23、-0.38 和 -0.18 V。高能垒有效抑制了析氢反应和副产物的形成，验证了其高选择性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.mcat.2026.116043","t":"Single-electron fδ and fπ bonds-advanced nitrogen reduction reaction in arene-coupled lanthanide/actinide catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mcat.2026.116043","s":"Molecular Catalysis","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Tong Qi","Hong-Xue Cai","Juan Wang","Si-Wei Zhao","Yuan-Ru Guo","Qing-Jiang Pan"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"芳烃耦合的镧系/锕系催化剂中单电子 fδ 和 fπ 键-先进的氮还原反应","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.mcat.2026.115992","t":"Kinetics investigation of ammonia decomposition on Ni(111) and Co(111) surface","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mcat.2026.115992","s":"Molecular Catalysis","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Caiyu Yang","Weihang Jia","Chong-Wen Zhou"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"Ni(111) 和 Co(111) 表面氨分解的动力学研究","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.matt.2026.102753","t":"Hierarchical superwetting electrodes with tunable triphase interface for efficient ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.matt.2026.102753","s":"Matter","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Lu Li","Honghao Li","Jinxin Gao","Ke Li","Yuliang Li","Chunyu Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"具有可调三相界面的分级超润湿电极用于高效的氨合成","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jpowsour.2026.240070","t":"Research progress on alloy catalysts in the electrocatalytic reduction of nitrates for ammonia production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpowsour.2026.240070","s":"Journal of Power Sources","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Huaiyu Zhou","Qing Wang","Yan Pan","Shuo Pan","Da Cui","Jingru Bai"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"在硝酸盐电催化还原制备氨方面的合金催化剂研究进展","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jpowsour.2026.240044","t":"Electrocatalytic ammonia oxidation on nickel and cobalt nanostructures for efficient hydrogen production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpowsour.2026.240044","s":"Journal of Power Sources","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Umar M. Jafar","Esraa Kotob","Mustapha Umar","Yahya Gambo","Khalid R. Alhooshani","Yousef A. Alsunni"],"o":"回填","why":["Electrocatalytic ammonia"],"zt":"镍和钴纳米结构上的电催化氨氧化用于高效的氢生产","ob":"其他催化反应｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jes.2026.06.017","t":"Roles and prospects of single-atom electrocatalysts in sustainable ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jes.2026.06.017","s":"Journal of Environmental Sciences","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Xingyu Jiang","Yangyang Yu","Guodong Jiang","Yulong Shan","Yunbo Yu","Yasser M.A. Mohamed"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"单原子电催化剂在可持续氨合成中的作用和前景","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jenvman.2026.129972","t":"Electrodeposition of Pd/In onto reconstructed copper foam for electrochemical reduction of nitrate to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jenvman.2026.129972","s":"Journal of Environmental Management","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Nitrate pollution in water has emerged as a significant environmental concern in recent decades. High concentration of nitrate in water poses great challenges to human health and the ecological balance of the water body. The electrochemical reduction of nitrate to ammonia holds great promise as a dual-purpose solution. It effectively removes nitrate from wastewater, while concurrently transforming this waste nitrate into a valuable resource, ammonia. We firstly prepared irregular nanorod structure on the surface Cu foam (CF) according to chemical self-growth and electrochemical self-reconstruction. Then we prepared RCF-Pd/In electrode by electrodepositing Pd and In on the surface of the reconstructed CF. The structure of irregular nanorods in the size range of 50 nm - 500 nm intersected with each other with rich pore could provide more accessible active sites for nitrate adsorption and e","au":["Zhanhui Shen","Jialu Shi","Jinfeng Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"在重构铜泡沫上电沉积Pd/In用于电化学还原硝酸为氨","zb":"水中的硝酸盐污染近年来已成为一个重要的环境问题。水中高浓度的硝酸盐对人类健康和水体的生态平衡构成巨大挑战。将硝酸盐电化学还原为氨是一种很有前景的解决方案。它有效地从废水中去除硝酸盐，同时将这种废物硝酸盐转化为有价值资源氨。首先根据化学自生长和电化学自重构在Cu泡沫(CF)表面制备了不规则纳米棒结构。然后在重构的CF表面通过电沉积制备了RCF-Pd/In电极。尺寸范围为50 nm - 500 nm的不规则纳米棒相互交叉，具有丰富的孔隙，可以为硝酸盐吸附和电化学还原提供更多可及的活性位点。制备的RCF-Pd/In电极表现出最高的电化学活性表面积(626 cm2)，最高的NO3--N转化率(88.1%)和最高的NH3选择性(96.2%)。在第7次测试中，硝酸盐转化率和NH3选择性分别高达82%和88%。在制备的RCF-Pd/In电极表面，经过7次循环测试后，也可以看到相互交叉具有丰富孔隙的不规则","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jece.2026.122911","t":"Reaction mechanisms and catalyst design principles of MOFs and their derivatives in the electrocatalytic nitrate reduction for ammonia production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2026.122911","s":"Journal of Environmental Chemical Engineering","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Huaiyu Zhou","Qing Wang","Yan Pan","Shuo Pan","Da Cui","Jingru Bai"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"MOFs及其衍生物在电催化硝酸还原为氨生产中的反应机理和催化剂设计原则","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jece.2026.122752","t":"Copper foam derived from waste copper ash: An efficient electrocatalyst for nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2026.122752","s":"Journal of Environmental Chemical Engineering","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Siqi Xing","Lin Shi","Xu Wu"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"废弃铜灰衍生的铜泡沫：一种高效的硝酸还原为氨的电催化剂","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jece.2026.122549","t":"Rare-earth ion-exchanged OMS-2 catalysts for the selective reduction of nitrogen oxides","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2026.122549","s":"Journal of Environmental Chemical Engineering","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Tingting Gao","Chengming Zhong","Jia Hou","Chengyang Yin","Ruiyuan Liu","Zhen Zhao"],"o":"回填","why":["reduction of nitrogen"],"zt":"稀土离子交换的OMS-2催化剂用于选择性还原氮氧化物","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jece.2026.122135","t":"Methane-promoted ammonia production from nitrate in water over zirconia-supported metallic iron","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2026.122135","s":"Journal of Environmental Chemical Engineering","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Lingke Miao","Wen Huang","Ryota Osuga","Ryoichi Otomo","Yuichi Kamiya"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"在氧化锆负载的金属铁上甲烷促进水中的硝酸盐制氨","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系","bt":1,"pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcis.2026.140133","t":"Synergistic Fe Ge dual sites in Fe13Ge8 Intermetallics boost nitrate reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcis.2026.140133","s":"Journal of Colloid and Interface Science","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO3RR) provides a promising route for simultaneous nitrate (NO3-) removal and sustainable ammonia (NH3) production. However, this process is limited by complex reaction pathways and sluggish kinetics. Herein, carbon-supported Fe13Ge8 intermetallic compounds (i.e. Fe13Ge8/C) are synthesized via a high-temperature annealing strategy. The obtained Fe13Ge8/C catalyst exhibits an NH3 yield rate of 5.8 mg·h-1·cm-2 and a Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 93% at -0.7 V in 1.0 M potassium hydroxide (KOH), outperforming carbon-supported iron nanoparticles (i.e. Fe/C) and most of the reported noble-metal-free NO3RR electrocatalysts. Density functional theory (DFT) calculations reveal that Fe sites in Fe13Ge8 effectively facilitate the adsorption and activation of NO3-. Meanwhile, Ge sites promote water (H2O) dissociation and active hydrogen (*H) generation","au":["Mingyan Zhu","Gang Lin","Siqing Tang","Fukai Feng","Yonghui Ren","Nianshu Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"Fe Ge双位点在Fe13Ge8金属间化合物中协同促进硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"碳负载的Fe13Ge8金属间化合物（即Fe13Ge8/C）通过高温退火策略合成，在-0.7 V、1.0 M KOH中表现出5.8 mg·h-1·cm-2的氨产率率和93%的法拉第效率，优于碳负载的铁纳米颗粒（即Fe/C）和大多数报道的无贵金属NO3RR电催化剂。DFT计算表明Fe13Ge8中的Fe位点有效促进NO3-的吸附和活化，同时Ge位点促进水（H2O）解离和活性氢（*H）的产生，从而为后续加氢步骤持续供应丰富的*H。Fe13Ge8中Fe和Ge双位点的协同作用显著降低了NO3RR决速步骤的能量势垒。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcat.2026.116823","t":"Engineering proton spillover pathways via BO4-mediated bridging in dual-metal-site electrocatalysts for poisoning resistant nitrate-to-ammonia conversion","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcat.2026.116823","s":"Journal of Catalysis","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yimeng Li","Jing Zhang","Changxu Ma","Dan Zhao","Dianxue Cao","Guiling Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate-to-ammonia"],"zt":"通过BO4介导的桥连工程质子溢流路径在双金属位点电催化剂中用于抗中毒硝酸盐至氨的转化","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.155517","t":"Catalytic ammonia decomposition into hydrogen over nickel porous media for enhancing combustion performance and emission reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.155517","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Ali Tolouei","Ayat Gharehghani","Esmail Khalife"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"在镍多孔介质上催化氨分解为氢气以增强燃烧性能和减少排放","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.155337","t":"Mechanistic insights into trimetallic site-specific synergy of CuCoNiOx/NF catalysts for electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.155337","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Xueqian Li","Aijing Ma","Dan Liu","Bhekie B. Mamba","Jianzhou Gui"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"对 CuCoNiOx/NF 催化剂中三金属位点特异性协同机制的电催化硝酸盐还原为氨的机理洞察","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.energy.2026.140918","t":"Synergistic integration of liquid air energy storage and ammonia synthesis: Enabling flexible, low-carbon industry with enhanced energy storage","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.energy.2026.140918","s":"Energy","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Xinyi Chen","Zhikang Wang","Xiaoyu Fan","Zhaozhao Gao","Xin Li","Liubiao Chen"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"液空储能与氨合成的协同集成：实现灵活、低碳工业与增强储能","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.coelec.2026.101859","t":"The dream of electrochemical ammonia synthesis: State of the art and future challenges","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.coelec.2026.101859","s":"Current Opinion in Electrochemistry","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Hao Xue","Xianbiao Fu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"电化学氨合成的梦想：现状与未来挑战","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.176932","t":"Unveiling the corner-sharing [Mn3+] − VO− [Mn3+] active sites in manganese oxides: How structure-defined oxygen vacancies redirect the nitrate reduction pathway toward high-rate ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.176932","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Xuehui Duan","Jingyi Zhang","Xian Wu","Wentao Sun","Yutong Fan","Haijiao Xie"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"揭示锰氧化物中角共享[Mn3+] − VO− [Mn3+]活性位点：结构定义的氧空位如何将硝酸盐还原途径转向高率氨合成","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.176774","t":"Plasma-catalytic ammonia synthesis over Ni/Al2O3 catalysts: The combination of experiment, diagnosis and simulation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.176774","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Xin Zeng","Liguang Dou","Dengke Xi","Xiucui Hu","Shuai Zhang","Shaojun Xu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Ni/Al2O3 催化剂上的等离子体催化氨合成：实验、诊断和模拟的结合","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.176626","t":"Energy-efficient ammonia cracking via inductive heating: Susceptor design, power transfer, and reactor optimization","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.176626","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Anusha Yajurvedi","Daniel Andres Quintero Coronel","Arturo Gonzalez-Quiroga","Kevin M. Van Geem","Patrice Perreault"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia cracking"],"zt":"通过感应加热进行节能氨分解：感应体设计、功率传输和反应器优化","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ccr.2026.217726","t":"Electrochemical reduction of N2 in mild conditions using redox or chemical catalysis: towards alternatives to the Haber-Bosch process?","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ccr.2026.217726","s":"Coordination Chemistry Reviews","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Decarbonized Ammonia (NH 3 ) production from N 2 reduction under mild conditions (temperature and pressure) is highly desirable. The overall process requires a six electrons-six protons addition to N 2 . Activation of the very inert dinitrogen molecule (N 2 ) is nevertheless challenging. In this review, we present works focusing on two alternative strategies for N 2 fixation using electrochemical means. The first one relies on activation of N 2 at Li/Ca, followed by proton transfers to form NH 3 , while the second relies on the use of transition metal complexes to achieve proton-coupled electron transfers.","au":["Théo Personeni","Malo Duquesnoy","Christophe Bucher","Nicolas Mézailles"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"温和条件下 N2 电化学还原：替代 Haber-Bosch 工艺的途径？","zb":"从温和条件（温度和压力）下 N2 还原生产脱碳氨 (NH3) 具有高度吸引力。整个过程需要 N2 加上六个电子和六个质子。尽管如此，活化非常惰性的 N2 分子仍然具有挑战性。该综述介绍了使用电化学方法进行 N2 固定的两种替代策略。第一种依赖于在 Li/Ca 上活化 N2，随后质子转移形成 NH3，第二种依赖于使用过渡金属配合物实现质子偶联电子转移。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.apmate.2025.100370","t":"Multifunctional metal–organic framework-based electrocatalysts: from CO2 reduction and ammonia synthesis to urea production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apmate.2025.100370","s":"Advanced Powder Materials","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The urgent need for sustainable chemical production has spurred interest in electrocatalytic technologies powered by renewable electricity. Among these, electrocatalytic carbon dioxide reduction (ECR), electrocatalytic ammonia synthesis (EAS), and particularly electrocatalytic urea synthesis (EUS) offer promising strategies for green carbon–nitrogen conversion. EUS stands out by co-reducing CO 2 and nitrogen sources (e.g., N 2 , NO, NO 2 − , NO 3 − ) to enable C–N bond formation, presenting unique opportunities for resource efficiency and emissions reduction. However, its practical implementation is limited by insufficient catalytic activity, selectivity, and durability; incomplete understanding of C–N coupling pathways; and competition from side reactions. Metal–organic framework (MOF)-based materials have emerged as versatile platforms for electrocatalysis owing to their tunable metal ","au":["Hao Liang","Aishan Li","Ning Yuan"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"基于多功能金属-有机框架的电催化剂：从 CO2 还原和氨合成到尿素生产","zb":"为应对可持续化学品生产的迫切需求，电催化技术受到关注。电催化 CO2 还原 (ECR)、电催化氨合成 (EAS) 和电催化尿素合成 (EUS) 为绿色碳-氮转化提供策略。EUS 通过 CO2 和氮源（如 N2、NO、NO2−、NO3−）共还原形成 C-N 键，具有资源效率和减排潜力。然而，EUS 的实际应用受限于催化活性、选择性和耐久性不足，C-N 耦合途径理解不充分及副反应竞争。金属-有机框架 (MOF) 材料因其可调金属节点和配体化学、多功能活性位点和分级多孔结构而成为电催化的通用平台。MOF 平台有望降低 C-N 耦合能垒，协调双底物输送和共吸附，抑制副反应析氢反应 (HER)，并改善 EUS 的电荷传输和耐久性。该综述分类 MOF 功能化策略用于活性位点设计和微环境调制。随后评估了 MOF 基材料在 ECR、EAS 和 EUS 中的代表性进展，特别关注结构-机理-性能相关性。基于 ","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.126507","t":"Proton capture effect of Cu-Co3O4@PANI for electrochemical ammonia synthesis from nitrate reduction under strongly acidic environment","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.126507","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Pengfei Liu","Xuetao Cheng","Yongzhe Liang","Ruihong Han","Yan-Qin Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Cu-Co3O4@PANI 的质子捕获效应用于强酸性环境下从硝酸盐还原电化学合成氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.126458","t":"Interfacial Water Dynamics on an Inverse Cu–CeO2 Catalyst for Enhanced Electrochemical Ammonia Production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.126458","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yujin Kong","Dayoung Kwon","Jihoon Son","Wooyul Kim","Hyeyoung Shin","Jihun Oh"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Production"],"zt":"界面水动力学对反 Cu–CeO2 催化剂在增强电化学氨生产中的应用","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1,"pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1002/cnma.70296","t":"Constructing PdNiMo Trimetallene Catalysts for Efficient Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cnma.70296","s":"ChemNanoMat","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic reduction of nitrate to ammonia (eNO 3 RR) is a promising green ammonia synthesis pathway, which uses nitrate in industrial wastewater as a raw material to generate ammonia under mild conditions by using renewable power resources. However, the complex multielectron reaction path of this process is prone to side reactions, which seriously limit the selectivity of ammonia and Faradaic efficiency. Based on this, a one‐pot wet chemical coreduction method was used to synthesize PdNiMo trimetallene catalysts for eNO 3 RR. Through the atomic‐scale alloying of Pd, Ni, and Mo in the two‐dimensional structure, the material synergistically regulates the active sites, electronic structure and lattice strain, thereby significantly improving the ammonia selectivity and Faradaic efficiency, providing an efficient catalytic platform for green ammonia synthesis.","au":["Yiqiu Xu","Tianrui Luo","Yizhe Gao","Kedi Yu","Yumin Leng","Zhengbo Chen"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.watres.2026.125648","t":"Life cycle assessment of membrane electrochemical systems for ammonia nitrogen recovery from wastewater","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.watres.2026.125648","s":"Water Research","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"This work presents a cradle-to-gate life cycle assessment of ammonia (NH₃) recovery, quantified as ammonium nitrogen (NH₄-N, as N), from wastewater using membrane electrochemical systems (MES). Five lab-scale configurations, including three single-membrane configurations (2V-1 N, 5V-1 N, and 10V-1 N) along with two multi-stack configurations (5V-11 N and 10V-20 N), were evaluated for environmental impact, energy intensity, and recovery performance per functional unit of 1 kg NH₄-N recovered. The different configurations presented in this work use a variation of energy and material inputs per functional unit to illustrate the trade-offs among the different scenarios and to explore a sustainable balance between recovery rate, energy intensity, and environmental performance. The multi-stack membrane configuration (10V-20 N) not only demonstrated technical feasibility, but also competitive e","au":["Fadhel H. Alrabiah","Kai Yang","Mohan Qin","Andrea L. Hicks"],"o":"回填","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1016/j.seppur.2026.137330","t":"Controlling the fate of nitrate: Selective electrocatalytic reduction to nitrogen and high-value chemicals via electrocatalyst and system design","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.seppur.2026.137330","s":"Separation and Purification Technology","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Xuejiao Ma","Nianyu Shang","Zizhe Yang","Jiayi Song","Jia Huang","Yanhe Han"],"o":"回填","zt":"控制硝酸盐的归宿：通过电催化剂和系统设计选择性地电催化还原为氮和高附加值化学品","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.resconrec.2026.108995","t":"Efficient gallium recovery from electronic wastes via flash Joule heating-induced structure transformation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.resconrec.2026.108995","s":"Resources, Conservation and Recycling","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Yusufujiang Mubula","Erkang Feng","Mingyue Xu","Zhenyu Ren","Yunn Shuan Chan","Teng Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"通过闪蒸焦耳热诱导的结构转变从电子废弃物中高效回收镓","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jphotochem.2026.117035","t":"Photoelectrocatalytic process for treating ternary precursor wastewater: Simultaneous degradation of Ammonia nitrogen and recovery of nickel and cobalt","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jphotochem.2026.117035","s":"Journal of Photochemistry and Photobiology A: Chemistry","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Chunxiang Tang","Yaoguo Huang","Linlin Chen","Lipeng Zhang","Yali Zhang"],"o":"回填","zt":"处理三元前驱体废水的光电催化过程：同时降解氨氮和回收镍和钴","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.155691","t":"Highly active and durable quinary CoNiCuFeCr/Cor catalyst for continuous flow ammonia borane hydrolysis toward hydrogen production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.155691","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Xueyan Dai","Lijun Lei","Shuai Hao","Zhenyi Zhao","Xuefei Si","Pengyong Xie"],"o":"回填","zt":"高活性耐用的五元CoNiCuFeCr/Co催化剂用于连续流动氨硼烷水解制氢","ob":"氨硼烷水解","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.hydromet.2026.106716","t":"Ammonia-free recovery of rare earth elements from ion-adsorption clays using sodium citrate","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.hydromet.2026.106716","s":"Hydrometallurgy","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"This study presents an ammonia-free hydrometallurgical flowsheet for the recovery of rare earth elements (REEs) from ion-adsorption clays using sodium citrate (Na 3 Cit) as a green lixiviant. Desorption tests demonstrated that 0.15 M Na 3 Cit at pH 6.4 achieves the highest total REE (TREE) extraction (1300 mg kg −1 ), outperforming conventional ammonium sulfate while minimizing dissolution of Al, Fe, and other matrix elements. Mechanistic analysis supported by zeta potential measurements shows that Na 3 Cit operates through ligand-assisted desorption coupled with mild ion exchange, enabling efficient REE release under near-neutral conditions without structural degradation of the clay. Two precipitation pathways were evaluated for REE recovery from the citrate leachate. Oxalic acid precipitation at pH 2.5–3.5 resulted in near-quantitative REE recovery (>95%) and produced high-purity mixed","au":["Spencer Cunningham","Gisele Azimi"],"o":"回填","zt":"使用柠檬酸钠从离子吸附土中无氨回收稀土元素","zb":"本研究提出了一种使用柠檬酸钠（Na3Cit）作为绿色浸出剂的冶金流程，从离子吸附土中无氨回收稀土元素（REEs）。解吸试验表明，0.15 M Na3Cit 在 pH 6.4 时实现了最高的总REE（TREE）提取（1300 mg kg−1），优于传统的硫酸铵，同时最大限度地减少了 Al、Fe 和其他基质元素的溶解。机理分析得到了 zeta 电位测量支持，表明 Na3Cit 通过配体辅助解吸与温和离子交换协同作用，在近中性条件下有效释放REE而不破坏土的结构。评估了两种从柠檬酸浸出液中回收REE的沉淀途径。在 pH 2.5–3.5 时使用草酸沉淀实现了近定量REE回收（>95%），并产生了高纯度混合REE草酸盐，总REO含量为 95–97 wt%。STEM–EDS 映射证实了均匀纳米级REE-草酸盐晶粒的形成。相比之下，两步碳酸沉淀过程（酸性活化后由 CaCO3/Na2CO3 中和）实现了高","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）；涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2025.138209","t":"Complete recovery of released ammonia from fuel supply system of ammonia fueled ship using novel adsorption unit","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2025.138209","s":"Fuel","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"As ammonia emerges as a promising zero carbon marine fuel, addressing the challenges associated with its toxicity and handling has become critical for safe onboard operation. Among various operational requirements, nitrogen purging is required to safely remove residual ammonia from the fuel supply system during emergency operation or maintenance procedures. However, the released ammonia poses environmental and safety risks due to its high toxicity, necessitating the development of an effective recovery system. This study presents a comprehensive dynamic simulation of the nitrogen purging process in an ammonia fuel supply system using Aspen HYSYS, where the flow characteristics of the discharged ammonia were analyzed under varying purging conditions. To evaluate recovery strategies, an adsorption unit adopting newly synthesized zeolite-13X impregnated with 0.5 wt% MgCl 2 was designed. An ","au":["Geonwoo Jeong","Ji Hye Park","Kwang Bok Yi","Yutaek Seo"],"o":"回填","zt":"使用新型吸附单元从氨燃料船燃料供应系统中完全回收释放的氨","zb":"为解决氨作为零碳海洋燃料的毒性和处理挑战，本研究通过 Aspen HYSYS 对氨燃料供应系统中的氮吹扫过程进行动态模拟，分析了不同吹扫条件下排出氨的流动特性。设计了一种采用新合成的浸渍有 0.5 wt% MgCl2 的沸石-13X 的吸附单元来评估回收策略。首先使用实验等温线和穿透数据验证了包含吸附剂的吸附模型。基于验证的模型，使用 Aspen Adsorption 在时间依赖性入口条件下开发了温度摆动吸附（TSA）单元，这些条件来自吹扫模拟。将 TSA 单元的性能与其他缓解策略（包括水洗涤器和氨锅炉）在设备尺寸和能耗方面进行了比较。结果表明，TSA 单元提供了一种紧凑的替代方案，能够完全回收氨用于潜在再利用，且能耗低于其他缓解策略。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1002/cctc.70876","t":"Nitrogen Reduction by Nanostructure‐Supported Ruthenium Catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cctc.70876","s":"ChemCatChem","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"ABSTRACT Reported here are the synthesis, characterization, and photocatalytic evaluation of two zero‐valent ruthenium catalysts supported on multi‐walled carbon nanotubes (Ru 0 @CNTs) and on graphitic carbon nitride (Ru 0 @g‐C 3 N 4 ), prepared by wet impregnation of RuCl 3 followed by thermal reduction under hydrogen. The materials were comprehensively characterized by XRD, SEM‐EDS, TGA‐DTG, BET surface area analysis, UV–vis diffuse reflectance spectroscopy, XPS, and ESR. Ru 0 @CNTs displayed a substantially higher specific surface area (73.5 m 2 g − 1 ) and pore volume (0.367 cm 3 g − 1 ) relative to Ru 0 @g‐C 3 N 4 (21.4 m 2 g − 1 ; 0.015 cm 3 g − 1 ), and exhibited broader visible‐light absorption associated with the narrower bandgap of the CNT support (1.82 eV vs. 2.71 eV for g‐C 3 N 4 ). In photocatalytic nitrogen reduction experiments, Ru 0 @CNTs yielded 183.2 ± 3.7 µmol NH 3 g −","au":["Rami Doukeh","Maria Lehene","Cezara Zagrean‐Tuza","Augustin C. Mot","Radu Silaghi‐Dumitrescu","Codruta Sarosi"],"o":"回填","why":["NRR"],"ob":"光催化固氮；涉及Ru/钌体系、碳材料｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1002/batt.70375","t":"Synergistic Bimetallic Metal–Organic Frameworks with Engineered Hydrophobicity for Enhanced Nitrogen Reduction Toward Zinc–Nitrogen Batteries","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/batt.70375","s":"Batteries & Supercaps","d":"2026-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Emerging zinc–nitrogen (Zn–N 2 ) batteries, which transform conventional electrically driven catalytic systems into electricity‐generating devices while simultaneously enabling ammonia electrosynthesis, are attracting increasing attention. As the core process, efficient nitrogen electrochemistry is essential for the performance of Zn–N 2 batteries. However, its operation in aqueous media is fundamentally constrained by the thermodynamic dominance of the hydrogen evolution reaction and the sluggish interfacial enrichment of inert nitrogen molecules. To address this bottleneck, this paper proposes a strategy to construct a hydrophobic microenvironment through bimetallic engineering, successfully preparing hydrophobic bimetallic metal–organic framework (MOF) composite Au/Ti–Zr–MOFs. This study shows that the synergistic effect of Ti and Zr bimetallic nodes not only induces lattice distortio","au":["Ziyi Zhang","Yuao Wei","Islam E. Khalil","Ge Huang","Shushu Liu","Faisal Saleem"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia electrosynthesis"],"ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"}]);
